  ["20"] = "Ah yes. Well, the magic that led us here seems to be most potent at a certain time, close before sunrise. \\z\n\t\t\tPerhaps like a giant pulse, or beacon. Maybe the gods set it here, or a mad sorcerer, \\z\n\t\t\twe don't know for sure yet... The portal deep down in the caves, resonating with magical energy where you came \\z\n\t\t\tthrough, can maybe bring something else into this world as well. \\z\n\t\t\tSo it must be carefully guarded while we investigate the island for more clues... \\z\n\t\t\tThere are some very interesting archeological findings here on the island throughout. \\z\n\t\t\tSeems the island has drawn some cults here, but why they are gone now, no one knows.",
  ["21"] = "It seems that throughout its history, this island was inhabited by very different species. \\z\n\t\t\tI like to study their remains.",
  ["22"] = "Yeah. Long time I haven't been to that place. How's old Vascalir? Still hanging around in the academy? \\z\n\t\t\tAnd Kraknaknork? Hah, I remember our brawl after that last card game. Fun times.",
  ["23"] = "What about him? Is he in one of his dark moods again? That's his normal mood, I mean. \\z\n\t\t\tJust buy your armor, weaponry and ammunition there and don't worry.",
  ["24"] = "Hmmm. Interesting. If only someone could help investigate this.",
  ["25"] = "Tired of the academy, maybe, but not of teaching. If you need druid or sorcerer spells, go to him.",
  ["26"] = "Ah, good old Hamish. A real wizard with potions. \\z\n\t\t\tWill supply you with very useful magic equipment for hunting.",
  ["2C"] = "Finally, reinforcements - oh but no, you came through the crystal portal, like the others! I am ser Menesto, I guard the portal. That beast caught me by surprise, I lost my dagger and had to retreat. ...",
  ["2D"] = "... ...",
  ["2E"] = "Hmm. ...",
