  ["2G"] = "I'll stay here till reinforcements come. Go up the ladder to reach the surface. You'll need a rope for the ropestot that comes after the ladder - here, take my spare equipment. ...",
  ["2H"] = "And remember: Tibia is a world with many dangers and mysteries, so be careful! Farewell, friend.",
  ["2I"] = "It's my duty to protect the city.",
