  ["BA"] = "Cruel beings. Large and monstrous, with a single eye, staring at their prey. ",
  ["BA0"] = "Sorry, you don't have enough money.",
  ["BA1"] = "Ahhhh!",
  ["BA2"] = "Have mercy!",
  ["BA3"] = "I admit! I admit!",
  ["BA4"] = "I repent!",
  ["BA5"] = "Noooooo!",
  ["BA6"] = "Please! I beg you to stop!",
  ["BA7"] = "Take it away! Please!",
  ["BA8"] = "In this category I have '{Bruise Bane}', '{Cure Bleeding}', '{Wound Cleansing}', \\z\n\t\t'{Cure Poison}'', '{Intense Wound Cleansing}'', '{Recovery}'' and '{Intense Recovery}''.",
  ["BA9"] = "In this category I have '{Light}', '{Find Person}', '{Magic Rope}', '{Levitate}', \\z\n\t\t'{Haste}', '{Charge}' and '{Great Light}'.",
  ["BAA"] = "Every Adventurer has one. The big advantage is that you can access your money in every branch of the World Bank! ...",
  ["BAB"] = "Would you like to know more about the {basic} functions of your bank account, the {advanced} functions, or are you already bored, perhaps?",
  ["BAC"] = "Waste not, want not!",
  ["BAD"] = "Arrr. Not a very profitable place.",
  ["BAE"] = "Arr! I'm a pira... er, I mean <cough> <cough> ... clerk. Banking clerk. \\z\n\t\t\tThat's what I am. You need somethin'? Bank business, p'raps?",
  ["BAF"] = "There's a choice of four: knight, sorcerer, paladin or druid.",
  ["BAG"] = "I'm afraid this service is not available to you until you reach the World mainland.",
  ["BAH"] = "He's an ol' trapper and knows his away around in Tibia, aye. \\z\n\t\t\tAsk him how a thing works and he'll be sure to have an answer. ...",
  ["BAI"] = "Gloomy sort. Keeps glaring at me for some reason. Or maybe for no reason, harr. \\z\n\t\t\tFormidable blacksmith, anyway. Sharpest sword blade I've seen in a long time.",
  ["BAJ"] = "Fetching white beard, I hope I grow one in due time, would impress the younger folk no end! \\z\n\t\t\tKnowing some sorcerer and druid spells like he does wouldn't come amiss, either. \\z\n\t\t\tGo to him if you need mage spells.",
  ["BAK"] = "Could've used his talent to brew up some more explosive runes back in the sea fight against... \\z\n\t\t\tah well, you wouldn't know the name anyway. Gotta admit, his potions are good stuff.",
  ["BAL"] = "<shifts uneasily> Well, maybe I did come across his ship some time. In bad weather. \\z\n\t\t\tAnd couldn't do a thing for those poor souls. And anyway, he swam ashore here. \\z\n\t\t\tSo it all worked out in the end, see.",
  ["BAM"] = "That's Mr Morris to you, friend. \\z\n\t\t\tGo get yourself a useful thing to do and ask him about a quest, will you.",
  ["BAN"] = "Don't burden yourself with too much cash - store it here!",
  ["BAO"] = "Harrr, what a dame! Would like to buy her a pint one day. \\z\n\t\t\t<leers> Unless she kills me with one of her icy looks first. Anyway, decent healer. \\z\n\t\t\tCan help ya with choosing a vocation.",
  ["BAP"] = "Aye, what about my name? You don't like it? Well, you don't have to wear it! \\z\n\t\t\tAnd I am quite happy with that!",
  ["BAT"] = "Don't take the money and run - deposit it and walk instead!",
  ["BAU"] = "Yeah, well, some romantic at work there. \\z\n\t\t\tIsland was reached at dawn, new heroes and adventurers forthcoming, stuff like that.",
  ["BAV"] = "Ah, wonderful stuff! That and a bottle o' rum, o'course! Harrharr. \\z\n\t\t\tYou have some gold you want to deposit or withdraw, just tell me.",
  ["BAW"] = "You can deposit and withdraw money from your bank account here.",
  ["BAX"] = "Once you are on the Tibian mainland, you can access new functions of your bank account, \\z\n\t\t\tsuch as changing money, transferring money to other players safely or taking part in house auctions.",
  ["BAY"] = "Abram Plunderpurse, at your service. <bows>",
  ["BAZ"] = "Here on Dawnport, I run the bank. I keep any gold you deposit safe, \\z\n\t\t\tso you can't lose it when you're out fighting or dying, heh. \\z\n\t\t\tAsk me for your balance to learn how much money you've already saved",
  ["BAa"] = "Waste not, want not!",
  ["BAb"] = "Don't burden yourself with too much cash - store it here!",
  ["BAc"] = "Don't take the money and run - deposit it and walk instead!",
  ["BAd"] = "So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["BAe"] = "No problem.",
  ["BAf"] = "You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["BAg"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't help you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BAh"] = "Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  ["BAi"] = "There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BAj"] = "I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["BAk"] = "I can sense that the druids north of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.",
  ["BAl"] = "I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["BAm"] = "I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["BAn"] = "I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.",
  ["BAo"] = "Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["BAp"] = "You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["BAq"] = "The druids north of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.",
  ["BAr"] = "You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["BAs"] = "The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["BAu"] = "Keep your adventurer's stone well.",
  ["BAv"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for free?",
  ["BAw"] = "Here you are. Take care.",
  ["BAx"] = "No problem.",
  ["BAy"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for 30 gold?",
  ["BAz"] = "Here you are. Take care.",
  ["BB"] = "485611800364197.",
  ["BB0"] = "I am Queen Eloise. For you it's 'My Queen' or 'Your Majesty', of course.",
  ["BB1"] = "I don't care about gossip like a simpleminded male would do.",
  ["BB2"] = "Soon the whole land will be ruled by women at last!",
  ["BB3"] = "Thank you, I'm fine.",
  ["BB4"] = "It's my humble domain.",
  ["BB5"] = "Sell? Your question shows that you are a typical member of your gender!",
  ["BB6"] = "We honor the gods of good in our fair city, especially Crunor, of course.",
  ["BB7"] = "All citizens of Carlin are my subjects. I see them more as my childs, though, epecially the male population.",
  ["BB8"] = "This beast scared my cat away on my last diplomatic mission in this filthy town.",
  ["BB9"] = "He is the scourge of the whole continent!",
  ["BBA"] = "I can teach you {healing spells}, {attack spells} and {support spells}. \\z\n\t\tWhat kind of spell do you wish to learn? \\z\n\t\tYou can also tell me for which level you would like to learn a spell, if you prefer that.",
  ["BBB"] = "The Spark of the Phoenix is given by me and by the great geomancer of the local earth temple. Do you wish to receive my part of the Spark of the Phoenix for |BLESSCOST| gold?",
  ["BBC"] = "May the great flame devour them all!",
  ["BBD"] = "Life feeds on fire and ultimately fire will feed on life.",
  ["BBE"] = "A weapon too powerful to be wielded by mortals. It has to be returned to the fire which gave birth to it.",
  ["BBF"] = "If he ever dares enter Kazordoon I will gladly dump him into the lava. Tthe sacred flame shall bring justice upon him.",
  ["BBG"] = "Our city was founded in ancient times. Abandoned by the gods we once fought for, we created a secure haven for our people.",
  ["BBH"] = "This mountain is said to be the oldest in the world. It is the place where fire and earth meet and separate at the same time.",
  ["BBI"] = "Bezil and Nezil are buying and selling equipment of all kinds.",
  ["BBJ"] = "Bezil and Nezil are buying and selling equipment of all kinds.",
  ["BBK"] = "She is the first knight of Kazordoon. She is responsible for teaching our young warriors how to handle an axe.",
  ["BBL"] = "Etzel is a true master of the elements. He is a role-model for our youngsters, jawoll.",
  ["BBM"] = "So receive the spark of the phoenix, pilgrim.",
  ["BBN"] = "He and his wife are running the Jolly Axeman tavern.",
  ["BBO"] = "He is a smith. If you are looking for exquisite weapons and armour just talk to him.",
  ["BBP"] = "She and her husband are running the Jolly Axeman tavern.",
  ["BBQ"] = "Uzgod is a weaponsmith just like those in the old legends.",
  ["BBR"] = "Though we are through with the so-called gods, Durin, the first dwarf to aquire divine powers of his own, is considered a protector of our race.",
  ["BBS"] = "Unlike the gods, the elements don't use mortals as toys, A skilled mind can understand and even control them to some extent.",
  ["BBT"] = "The ways of the gods are imprehensible to mortals. On the other hand, the elements are raw forces and can be understood and tamed.",
  ["BBU"] = "You can receive the Spiritual Shielding in the Whiteflower Temple south of Thais.",
  ["BBV"] = "Ask for the Fire of the Suns in the Suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["BBW"] = "The druids north of Carlin can provide you with the Embrace of Tibia.",
  ["BBX"] = "Maybe another time.",
  ["BBY"] = "Talk to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya about this blessing.",
  ["BBZ"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't help you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes.",
  ["BBa"] = "I'm the head pyromancer of Kazordoon. I guess you are here for healing or looking for a blessing.",
  ["BBb"] = "There are five different blessings available in five sacred places. These blessings are: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}.",
  ["BBd"] = "The ways of the gods are imprehensible to mortals. On the other hand, the elements are raw forces and can be understood and tamed.",
  ["BBe"] = "I am the head pyromancer of Kazordoon.",
  ["BBf"] = "My name is Pydar Firefist, Son of Fire, from the Savage Axes.",
  ["BBg"] = "Ask around. There's a lot to do, jawoll.",
  ["BBh"] = "That is our world.",
  ["BBi"] = "It's the fourth age of the yellow flame.",
  ["BBj"] = "LIKE MY TREASURE? WANNA PICK SOMETHING OUT OF IT?",
  ["BBk"] = "YOU LITTLE MAGGOT. COME BACK TO ME WHEN YOU CAN HANDLE A FIGHT AGAINST MY KIND.",
  ["BBl"] = "I HAVE A MISSION FOR YOU BUT YOU NEED TO DIE FIRST AND RETURN AS AN {UNDEAD} CREATURE. COME BACK TO ME WHEN YOU ACHIEVED THIS GOAL.",
  ["BBm"] = "EVERYTHING YOU CARRY WITH YOU CAN ALSO BE FOUND IN MY {TREASURE}. BRING ME SOMETHING I DON'T OWN!!!",
  ["BBn"] = "I HAVE A MISSION FOR YOU BUT YOU NEED TO DIE FIRST AND RETURN AS AN {UNDEAD} CREATURE. COME BACK TO ME WHEN YOU ACHIEVED THIS GOAL.",
  ["BBo"] = "BOON AND BANE. I HAVE CHOSEN THIS LIFE VOLUNTARILLY AND I NEVER REGRET IT. MY {TREASURE} IS GROWING BIGGER EACH DAY.",
  ["BBp"] = "ALRIGHT. BUT FIRST OF ALL I WANT YOU TO BRING ME SOMETHING IN EXCHANGE. SURPRISE ME....AND IF I LIKE IT, YOU MAY GET WHAT YOU DESERVE.",
  ["BBq"] = "HAVE YOU SEEN THESE LEGENDARY ITEMS BACK THERE? WHO COULD REFUSE THE CHANCE OF OBTAINING ONE?!? SO WHAT IS YOUR ANSWER?",
  ["BBr"] = "I GRANT YOU ACCESS TO THE DUNGEON IN THE NORTH. YOU'LL FIND SOME OF MY LIVING BROTHERS THERE....BUT.....EVERY TIME YOU WANT TO ENTER YOU HAVE TO GIVE ME SOMETHING PRECIOUS. ALRIGHT?",
  ["BBs"] = "AS YOU WISH. WHAT DO YOU HAVE TO OFFER?",
  ["BBt"] = "I LIKE THAT AND GRANT YOU ACCESS TO THE DUNGEON IN THE NORTH FOR THE NEXT FEW MINUTES. COME BACK ANYTIME AND BRING ME MORE TREASURES.",
  ["BBu"] = "THIS IS NOT WORTH BEING PART OF MY TREASURE! BRING ME SOMETHING ELSE.",
  ["BBv"] = "THIS IS NOT WORTH BEING PART OF MY TREASURE! BRING ME SOMETHING ELSE",
  ["BBw"] = "TELL ME IF YOU CHANGE YOUR MIND. MY TREASURE THIRSTS FOR GOLD.",
  ["BBx"] = "I greet thee, my loyal {subject}.",
  ["BBy"] = "I greet thee, my loyal {subject}.",
  ["BBz"] = "I can promote you for 20000 gold coins. Do you want me to promote you?",
  ["BC"] = "These fools and their superstitious life cult don't understand anything of importance.",
  ["BC0"] = "I guess you couldn't convince Gamon to give you a stake, eh?",
  ["BC1"] = "Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  ["BC2"] = "There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BC3"] = "I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["BC4"] = "I can sense that the druids north of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.",
  ["BC5"] = "I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["BC6"] = "I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["BC7"] = "I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.",
  ["BC8"] = "You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["BC9"] = "The druids north of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.",
  ["BCA"] = "Congratulations! You are now promoted.",
  ["BCB"] = "The royal treasure is hidden beyond the grasps of any thieves by magical means.",
  ["BCC"] = "Go and hunt them! For queen and country!",
  ["BCD"] = "Visit the church or the townguards for help.",
  ["BCE"] = "I will call for heroes as soon as the need arises again.",
  ["BCF"] = "Our city is rich and prospering.",
  ["BCG"] = "I don't want to talk about 'sewers'.",
  ["BCH"] = "Dungeons are places where males crawl around and look for trouble.",
  ["BCI"] = "Feel free to visit our town's magnificent shops.",
  ["BCJ"] = "Don't worry about time in the presence of your Queen.",
  ["BCK"] = "We need the assistance of heroes now and then. Even males prove useful now and then.",
  ["BCL"] = "Alright then, come back when you are ready.",
  ["BCM"] = "The taxes in Carlin are not high, more a symbol than a sacrifice.",
  ["BCN"] = "I am the Queen, the only rightful ruler on the continent!",
  ["BCO"] = "Ask one of the soldiers about that.",
  ["BCP"] = "Our enemies are numerous. We have to fight vile monsters and have to watch this silly king in the south carefully.",
  ["BCQ"] = "They dare to reject my reign over them!",
  ["BCR"] = "Isn't our city marvellous? Have you noticed the lovely gardens on the roofs?",
  ["BCS"] = "My subjects maintain many fine shops. Go and have a look at their wares.",
  ["BCT"] = "Ask around about them.",
  ["BCU"] = "The four major guilds are the Knights, the Paladins, the Druids, and the Sorcerers.",
  ["BCV"] = "They haven't troubled our city lately. I guess, they fear the wrath of our druids.",
  ["BCW"] = "I remember about those uniforms, they had a camouflage inlay so they could be worn the inside out too. I will send some color samples via mail to Mr. Postner.",
  ["BCX"] = "The paladins are great hunters.",
  ["BCY"] = "It's a shame that the High Paladin does not reside in Carlin.",
  ["BCZ"] = "The knights of Carlin are the bravest.",
  ["BCa"] = "The sorcerers have a small isle for their guild. So if they blow something up it does not burn the whole city to ruins.",
  ["BCb"] = "The druids of Carlin are our protectors and advisors. Their powers provide us with wealth and food.",
  ["BCc"] = "Carlin is a center of the forces of good, of course.",
  ["BCd"] = "The forces of evil have a firm grip on this puny city to the south.",
  ["BCe"] = "The order, Crunor gives the world, is essential for survival.",
  ["BCf"] = "Chaos is common in the southern regions, where they allow a man to reign over a realm.",
  ["BCg"] = "A mans tale ... that means 'nonsense', of course.",
  ["BCh"] = "I greet thee, my loyal {subject}.",
  ["BCl"] = "I greet thee, my loyal {subject}.",
  ["BCm"] = "The uniforms of our guards and soldiers are of unparraleled quality of course.",
  ["BCn"] = "I am {Queen} Eloise. It is my duty to reign over this marvellous {city} and the {lands} of the north.",
  ["BCo"] = "We women try to bring justice and wisdom to all, even to males.",
  ["BCp"] = "Alright, I guess you need a stake first. Maybe Gamon can help you, the leg of a chair or something could just do. Try asking him for a stake, and if you have one, bring it back to me.",
  ["BCq"] = "Keep your adventurer's stone well.",
  ["BCr"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for free?",
  ["BCs"] = "Here you are. Take care.",
  ["BCt"] = "No problem.",
  ["BCu"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for 30 gold?",
  ["BCv"] = "Here you are. Take care.",
  ["BCw"] = "Sorry, you don't have enough money.",
  ["BCx"] = "No problem.",
  ["BCy"] = "You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["BCz"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't help you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BD"] = "Only inferior species need weapons.",
  ["BD0"] = "Keep your adventurer's stone well.",
  ["BD1"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for free?",
  ["BD2"] = "Here you are. Take care.",
  ["BD3"] = "No problem.",
  ["BD4"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for 30 gold?",
  ["BD5"] = "Here you are. Take care.",
  ["BD6"] = "Please, not so loud, not so loud. Some of us are trying to rest in peace here.",
  ["BD7"] = "Now that we have arrived you should waste no time and fight your way to the lair of evil and destroy its master before its too late!",
  ["BD8"] = "Me humble name is Rapanaio. Good old goblin name meaning honest, generous and nice person, I swear!",
  ["BDA"] = "You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["BDB"] = "Ah, I see you brought a stake with you. Are you ready to receive my line of the prayer then?",
  ["BDC"] = "The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["BDE"] = "So receive my prayer: 'Light shall be near - and darkness afar'. Now, bring your stake to Tibra in the Carlin church for the next line of the prayer. I will inform her what to do.",
  ["BDF"] = "I will wait for you.",
  ["BDG"] = "You should visit Tibra in the Carlin church now.",
  ["BDH"] = "You already received my line of the prayer.",
  ["BDI"] = "So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["BDJ"] = "Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["BDK"] = "Okay, then just browse through all of my wares.",
  ["BDL"] = "Don't forget to deposit your money here in the Global Bank before you head out for adventure.",
  ["BDM"] = "Are you here to get a task or to report you finished task?",
  ["BDN"] = "They are mean and cruel. Humble goblin rarely trades with them. They would rather kill poor me if not too greedy for stuff only me can get them. Still, they rob me of it for a few spare coins and there is noooo profit for poor goblin.",
  ["BDO"] = "Me job merchant is. Me trade with all kinds of things. Me not good trader though, so you get everything incredibly cheap! You might think me mad, but please don't rip off poor goblin too much. Me has four or five wives and dozens of kids to feed!",
  ["BDP"] = "Humans so clever. Much, much smarter than poor, stupid goblin. They have big rich town. Goblin lives here poor and hungry. Me so impressed by you strong and smart humans. So much to learn from you. Poor goblin only sees pretty city from afar. Poor goblin too afraid to go there.",
  ["BDQ"] = "Me have seen a gold coin once or twice. So bright and shiny it hurt me poor eyes. You surely are incredibly rich human who has even three or four coins at once! Perhaps you want to exchange them for some things me offer? Just don't rob me too much, me little stupid goblin, have no idea what stuff is worth... you look honest, you surely pay fair price like I ask and tell if it's too cheap.",
  ["BDR"] = "Furry guys are strange fellows. Always collecting things and stuff. Not easy to make them share, oh there is noooo profit for little, poor me to be made. They build underground dens that can stretch quite far. Rumour has it the corym have strange tunnels that connect their different networks all over the world.",
  ["BDS"] = "Me humble name is Rafzan. Good old goblin name meaning honest, generous and nice person, I swear!",
  ["BDT"] = "Most goblins so afraid of everything, that they fight everything. Me different. Me just want trade.",
  ["BDU"] = "You humans are so big, strong, clever and beautiful. Me really feel little and green beside you. Must be sooo fun to be human. You surely always make profit!",
  ["BDV"] = "To be honest to me human friend, me only heard about it, never seen one. I imagine it's something cute and cuddly.",
  ["BDW"] = "Swamp is horrible. Slowly eating away at health of poor little goblin. No profit here at all. Me will die poor and desperate, probably eaten by giant mosquitoes.",
  ["BDX"] = "Beardmen are nasty. Always want to kill little goblin. No trade at all. Not good, not good.",
  ["BDY"] = "So much to do, so little help. Me poor goblin desperately needs help. Me have a few tasks me need to be done. I can offer you all money I made if you only help me a little with stuff which is easy to strong smart human but impossible for poor, little me.",
  ["BDZ"] = "Me heard Thais is big city with king! Must be strong and clever, to become chief of all humans. Me cannot imagine how many people you have to beat up to become king of all humans. Surely he makes lot of profit in his pretty city.",
  ["BDa"] = "Please, not so loud, not so loud. Some of us are trying to rest in peace here.",
  ["BDb"] = "Sorry, you don't have enough money.",
  ["BDc"] = "No problem.",
  ["BDd"] = "You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["BDe"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't help you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BDf"] = "I think you have forgotten to bring your stake, pilgrim.",
  ["BDg"] = "Yes, I was informed what to do. Are you prepared to receive my line of the prayer?",
  ["BDh"] = "So receive my prayer: 'Let there be power and compassion'. Now, bring your stake to Brewster in Port Hope for the next line of the prayer. I will inform him what to do.",
  ["BDi"] = "I will wait for you.",
  ["BDj"] = "You should visit Brewster in Port Hope now.",
  ["BDk"] = "You already received my line of the prayer.",
  ["BDl"] = "So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["BDm"] = "A blessed stake? That is a strange request. Maybe Quentin knows more, he is one of the oldest monks after all.",
  ["BDn"] = "Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  ["BDo"] = "There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BDp"] = "I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["BDq"] = "I can sense that the druids north of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.",
  ["BDr"] = "I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["BDs"] = "I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["BDt"] = "I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.",
  ["BDu"] = "You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["BDv"] = "The druids north of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.",
  ["BDw"] = "Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["BDx"] = "You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["BE"] = "I heard that elves moved in upstairs.",
  ["BE0"] = "Cormaya? Not a good place to make business, it's way too far and small.",
  ["BE1"] = "It's not the real thing, but almost as good. The merchants there claim ridiculous prices, which is fine for my own business.",
  ["BE2"] = "Ah yes, Edron! Such a lovely and quiet island! I usually make some nice business there.",
  ["BE3"] = "Meep? I mean - hello! Sorry, |PLAYERNAME|... Being a {rat} has kind of grown on me.",
  ["BE4"] = "Your power of observation is stunning. Yes, I'm a rat.",
  ["BE6"] = "Come visit my little pawnshop! General equipment and such. Don't miss it!",
  ["BE7"] = "What interest could a king have in this little settlement? If a king cares about us, there must be something important behind all this.",
  ["BE8"] = "Liberty comes, liberty goes, only the bay stays. Hehe.",
  ["BE9"] = "I sell torches, candelabra, and oil.",
  ["BEA"] = "Do you seek a passage to {0} for {1}?",
  ["BEB"] = "We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["BEC"] = "My name is Rapanaio from the Royal Tibia Line.",
  ["BEE"] = "Passage to {Evil Isle}.",
  ["BEG"] = "Do you seek a passage to {0} for {1}?",
  ["BEH"] = "We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["BEI"] = "My name is Rapanaio from the Royal Tibia Line.",
  ["BEK"] = "Passage to {Kazordoon}.",
  ["BEL"] = "I am a travelling trader. I don't buy everything, though. And not from everyone, for that matter.",
  ["BEM"] = "Too few customers there, it's not worth the trip.",
  ["BEN"] = "Um... I don't think so.",
  ["BEO"] = "I don't like being underground much. I also tend to get lost in these labyrinthine dwarven tunnels, so I rather avoid them.",
  ["BEP"] = "When you avoid the slums, it's a really pretty city. Almost as pretty as the governor's daughter.",
  ["BEQ"] = "Um... I don't think so.",
  ["BER"] = "I like the settlement itself, but I don't set my foot into the jungle. Have you seen the size of these centipedes??",
  ["BES"] = "Um... I don't think so.",
  ["BET"] = "I wish it was a little bit warmer there, but with a good mug of barbarian mead in your tummy everything gets a lot cosier.",
  ["BEU"] = "I feel uncomfortable and rather unsafe in Thais, so I don't really travel there.",
  ["BEV"] = "Um... I don't think so.",
  ["BEW"] = "I am Rashid, son of the desert.",
  ["BEX"] = "Although it's the flourishing trade centre of Tibia, I don't like going there. Too much competition for my taste.",
  ["BEY"] = "It's almost time to journey on.",
  ["BEZ"] = "Kings, queens, emperors and kaliphs... everyone claims to be different and unique, but actually it's the same thing everywhere.",
  ["BEa"] = "Of course, old friend. You can also browse only armor, legs, shields, helmets, boots, weapons, enchanted weapons, jewelry or miscellaneous stuff.",
  ["BEb"] = "Elves... I don't really trust them. All this talk about nature and flowers and treehugging... I'm sure there's some wicked scheme behind all this.",
  ["BEc"] = "My beloved hometown! Ah, the sweet scent of the desert sands, the perfect shape of the pyramids... stunningly beautiful.",
  ["BEd"] = "I have to go to Carlin once in a while, since the queen wishes to see my exclusive wares in regular intervals.",
  ["BEe"] = "Cormaya? Not a good place to make business, it's way too far and small.",
  ["BEf"] = "It's not the real thing, but almost as good. The merchants there claim ridiculous prices, which is fine for my own business.",
  ["BEg"] = "Ah yes, Edron! Such a lovely and quiet island! I usually make some nice business there.",
  ["BEh"] = "I am a travelling trader. I don't buy everything, though. And not from everyone, for that matter.",
  ["BEi"] = "Too few customers there, it's not worth the trip.",
  ["BEj"] = "Um... I don't think so.",
  ["BEk"] = "I don't like being underground much. I also tend to get lost in these labyrinthine dwarven tunnels, so I rather avoid them.",
  ["BEl"] = "When you avoid the slums, it's a really pretty city. Almost as pretty as the governor's daughter.",
  ["BEm"] = "Um... I don't think so.",
  ["BEn"] = "I like the settlement itself, but I don't set my foot into the jungle. Have you seen the size of these centipedes??",
  ["BEo"] = "Um... I don't think so.",
  ["BEp"] = "I wish it was a little bit warmer there, but with a good mug of barbarian mead in your tummy everything gets a lot cosier.",
  ["BEq"] = "I feel uncomfortable and rather unsafe in Thais, so I don't really travel there.",
  ["BEr"] = "Um... I don't think so.",
  ["BEs"] = "I am Rashid, son of the desert.",
  ["BEt"] = "Although it's the flourishing trade centre of Tibia, I don't like going there. Too much competition for my taste.",
  ["BEu"] = "It's almost time to journey on.",
  ["BEv"] = "Kings, queens, emperors and kaliphs... everyone claims to be different and unique, but actually it's the same thing everywhere.",
  ["BEw"] = "Of course, old friend. You can also browse only armor, legs, shields, helmets, boots, weapons, enchanted weapons, jewelry or miscellaneous stuff.",
  ["BEx"] = "Elves... I don't really trust them. All this talk about nature and flowers and treehugging... I'm sure there's some wicked scheme behind all this.",
  ["BEy"] = "My beloved hometown! Ah, the sweet scent of the desert sands, the perfect shape of the pyramids... stunningly beautiful.",
  ["BEz"] = "I have to go to Carlin once in a while, since the queen wishes to see my exclusive wares in regular intervals.",
  ["BF"] = "Numbers are essential. They are the secret behind the scenes. If you are a master of mathematics you are a master over life and death.",
  ["BF0"] = "This tower, of course, silly one. It holds my {master'}s {treasure}.",
  ["BF1"] = "His name is none of your business",
  ["BF2"] = "I am guarding the treasures of the tower. Only those who pass the {test} of the three sigils may pass.",
  ["BF3"] = "I am known as the riddler. That is all you need to know.",
  ["BF4"] = "I am the guardian of the paradox tower.",
  ["BF5"] = "The key of this tower! You will never find it! A malicious plant spirit is guarding it!.",
  ["BF6"] = "<mumbles>",
  ["BF7"] = "Just great. Getting stranded on a remote underground isle was not that bad but now I'm becoming a tourist attraction!",
  ["BF8"] = "Have you noticed that I'm actually the only rock on this island with a proper job? Those lazy pebbleheads! I'm proud to announce: I'm a trader",
  ["BF9"] = "No, you got it all wrong! I said I'm stuck between a rock and a hard place!",
  ["BFA"] = "That guy is a shrewd trader, sweetie. I bet even I could learn a thing or two from him.",
  ["BFB"] = "I have shovels, picks, scythes, bags, ropes, backpacks, plates, scrolls, watches, some lightsources, and other stuff. Just ask me for a {trade}.",
  ["BFC"] = "Mostly, pirates are bad for business. But sometimes, they are good for business.",
  ["BFD"] = "Sadly the workers have hardly enough money to buy something to eat and to drink. That is bad also for my business.",
  ["BFE"] = "Ah, there is little in the world that comes close to the taste of rum.",
  ["BFF"] = "I heard there is a fine bounty on his head. Would be a shame though to lose such a handsome man to the executioner <winks>.",
  ["BFG"] = "Sugar lets the money flow. We depend heavily on it.",
  ["BFH"] = "Just between you and me hun, that woman is a witch. Love potions, poison, voodoo dolls to torture your neighbour. You name it, she got it.",
  ["BFI"] = "Thais might be a splendid town, but this is of no use to us here. The situation in our town gets worse with every ship full of foreigners that arrives here.",
  ["BFJ"] = "I heard Venore will soon acquire several trade monopolies that will grant them wealth for centuries.",
  ["BFK"] = "Well, <lowers the voice to a whisper> there are several people around who know this or that about voodoo and not all of them are up to something good. Just buy some lucky charms from that old hag Charlotta to be on the safe side.",
  ["BFL"] = "A handsome man but a bit too stiff. I think no one has ever had a chance to see him smiling.",
  ["BFM"] = "I will pay you 5 gold for every empty vial. Ok?",
  ["BFN"] = "Hmm, but please keep Tibia litter free.",
  ["BFP"] = "Uh! <whispers> There are ... rumours, you know? About bloody rituals and gruesome curses ... better don't talk aloud about such issues.",
  ["BFQ"] = "Kshh!! No talks about ... the magic folk here ... This might draw their attention.",
  ["BFR"] = "Hard to imagine that this fat man has such a pretty daughter.",
  ["BFS"] = "Don't mention HIM in my house you fool. You call evil and mayhem upon us.",
  ["BFT"] = "I am not dealing with food.",
  ["BFU"] = "I won't say anything bad about such a high-born person. That's why I remain silent hun .",
  ["BFV"] = "I run this little pawnshop, hun, but I think you knew that already.",
  ["BFW"] = "Come visit my little pawnshop! General equipment and such. Don't miss it!",
  ["BFZ"] = "I was a carpenter, back on Main. Wanted my own little shop. Didn't sit with the old man. So I shipped to somewhere else. Terrible storm.",
  ["BFa"] = "Woke up on this island. Had to eat squirrels before the adventurers found me and took me in. End of story.",
  ["BFb"] = "Only the best quality, I assure you. A rope in need is a friend indeed! Imagine you stumble into a rat hole without a rope - heh, your bones will be gnawed clean before someone finds ya!",
  ["BFc"] = "Now, about that rope - ask me for {equipment} to see my wares. <winks>",
  ["BFd"] = "Don't forget to always have a rope with you! Buy one here, only the best quality!",
  ["BFe"] = "You know, I really don't want to poke into someone else's private life. \\z\n\t\t\tSuffice it to say that everyone has chapters of his life he doesn't want to mention. \\z\n\t\t\tJudging by Coltrayne's looks, we're looking at a trilogy here.",
  ["BFf"] = "Old Inigo was the one who found me, actually, and brought me to the outpost. \\z\n\t\t\tI was half starved by then. He taught me how to make better traps and how to fish... I owe much to Inigo.",
  ["BFm"] = "Don't complain to ME when you fell down a hole without a rope to get you out! You can buy one here now!",
  ["BFn"] = "Everything an adventurer needs!",
  ["BFo"] = "A rope is the adventurer's best friend!",
  ["BFp"] = "Fresh meat! Durable provisions! Ropes and shovels!",
  ["BFq"] = "Feeling like a bit of treasure-seeking? \\z\n\t\tBuy a shovel or a pick and investigate likely-looking stone piles and cracks!",
  ["BFr"] = "Richard. Just Richard. Lost my surname with my past in that storm. <winks>",
  ["BFs"] = "This lovely island here. Once I didn't have to live off squirrels, it became quite enjoyable. \\z\n\t\t\tNasty things though live underground, so take care where you tread and ALWAYS have a rope with you!",
  ["BFt"] = "<shrugs> Never been, mate. Heard it's kinda cute, though.",
  ["BFu"] = "Don't forget to always have a rope with you! Buy one here, only the best quality!",
  ["BFv"] = "Don't complain to ME when you fell down a hole without a rope to get you out! You can buy one here now!",
  ["BFw"] = "Everything an adventurer needs!",
  ["BFx"] = "A rope is the adventurer's best friend!",
  ["BFy"] = "Fresh meat! Durable provisions! Ropes and shovels!",
  ["BFz"] = "Feeling like a bit of treasure-seeking? \\z\n\t\tBuy a shovel or a pick and investigate likely-looking stone piles and cracks!",
  ["BG"] = "Our books are written in 469, of course you can't understand them.",
  ["BG0"] = "I am not mad... I- YES, that's the whole problem, isn't it? What's going on, what's happening to me? I don't even know anymore.",
  ["BG1"] = "Yes, well... I'm taking a break. It will take some time. I don't know how long I just... I want to get away from all this for some time, that's it.",
  ["BG5"] = "Hm? What is the meaning of all this?",
  ["BG6"] = "What have I become? What is slime if it's not for everyone?",
  ["BG7"] = "Slime! Everywhere! SLIME TIME! Or... not?",
  ["BG8"] = "Evil little beasts... I hope someone helps me fight them.",
  ["BG9"] = "Nasty creepy crawlies!",
  ["BGA"] = "I can help you buy trading stuff with you. Good for me, good for you. It's a win-win!",
  ["BGB"] = "Have you noticed that I'm actually the only rock on this island with a proper job? Those lazy pebbleheads! I'm proud to announce: I'm a trader",
  ["BGC"] = "So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["BGD"] = "No problem.",
  ["BGE"] = "You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["BGF"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't help you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BGG"] = "Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  ["BGH"] = "There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BGI"] = "I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["BGJ"] = "I can sense that the druids north of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.",
  ["BGK"] = "I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["BGL"] = "I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["BGM"] = "I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.",
  ["BGN"] = "Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["BGO"] = "You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["BGP"] = "The druids north of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.",
  ["BGQ"] = "You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["BGR"] = "The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["BGT"] = "Keep your adventurer's stone well.",
  ["BGU"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for free?",
  ["BGV"] = "Here you are. Take care.",
  ["BGW"] = "No problem.",
  ["BGX"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for 30 gold?",
  ["BGY"] = "Here you are. Take care.",
  ["BGZ"] = "Sorry, you don't have enough money.",
  ["BGa"] = "Don't forget to deposit your money here in the Global Bank before you head out for adventure.",
  ["BGb"] = "Check out my good and sturdy weapons!",
  ["BGd"] = "I am Romella and I will be serving you today.",
  ["BGe"] = "I have many weapons to offer. If you'd like to see my offers, ask me for a {trade}.",
  ["BGf"] = "I sell and buy weapons. If you'd like to see my offers, ask me for a {trade}.",
  ["BGg"] = "Our warehouse is the main supplier of the local garrison.",
  ["BGh"] = "It says the amazons are looking for a certain magical weapon in this area.",
  ["BGi"] = "I wonder how they finance themselves. I bet they are secretly trading in some strange stuff.",
  ["BGj"] = "Make sure to buy some extra weapons before facing that one.",
  ["BGk"] = "I heard the amazons are after it.",
  ["BGl"] = "Check out my good and sturdy weapons!",
  ["BGm"] = "<sigh> The world has grown complicated since my youth.",
  ["BGn"] = "Selling and buying fine weapons!",
  ["BGo"] = "Hello there, adventurer! Need a deal in weapons or armor? I'm your man!",
  ["BGq"] = "Hello there, adventurer! Need a deal in weapons or armor? I'm your man!",
  ["BGr"] = "Great spirit potions as well as health and mana potions in different sizes!",
  ["BGu"] = "Great spirit potions as well as health and mana potions in different sizes!",
  ["BGv"] = "If you need alchemical fluids like slime and blood, get them here.",
  ["BGw"] = "Hm? What is the meaning of all this?",
  ["BGx"] = "What have I become? What is slime if it's not for everyone?",
  ["BGy"] = "Slime! Everywhere! SLIME TIME! Or... not?",
  ["BGz"] = "I AM THE... I mean... I am - what is a mage, if he is not {mad}? If he isn't... raging? I am... I am just sane. A sane mage.",
  ["BH"] = "Go and wash your eyes for using this obscene number!",
  ["BH0"] = "I have an old friend there. Haven't heard from him in a while.",
  ["BH1"] = "Oh, it's not too bad here, believe me. At least I always get young and enthusiast disciples! \\z\n\t\tThough I must confess I miss the vastness of the Tibian plains. <sighs>",
  ["BH2"] = "A kind old hunter. He loves to see young life around, taking on the ways and lays of the land. \\z\n\t\tIf you have any question, ask Inigo for help.",
  ["BH3"] = "There's something about these words which makes me feel awkward. Or maybe it's you who causes that feeling. You better get lost.",
  ["BH4"] = "Heed. Your. Will. We. Will.",
  ["BH5"] = "Intruder. Intrude. Must. Explain.",
  ["BH6"] = "Ssssttttoooopppp.",
  ["BHA"] = "Hey! You over there, could you help me with a little quest? Just say 'hi' or 'hello' to talk to me!",
  ["BHB"] = "Don't be shy, can't hurt to greet me with 'hello' or 'hi'!",
  ["BHC"] = "General equipment and all sorts of goods. Visit my store!",
  ["BHD"] = "Hey there, adventurer! Need a little rest in my inn? Have some food!",
  ["BHE"] = "Do you want to sail {0}?",
  ["BHF"] = "We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["BHG"] = "Do you want to sail {0} for {1}?",
  ["BHH"] = "We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["BHI"] = "Where do you want to go? To {Liberty bay} or to {Nargor}?",
  ["BHJ"] = "I am the captain of this ship.",
  ["BHK"] = "I am the captain of this ship.",
  ["BHL"] = "Do you want to sail {0} for {1}?",
  ["BHM"] = "We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["BHN"] = "Where do you want to go? To {Liberty bay} or to {Meriana}?",
  ["BHO"] = "I am the captain of this ship.",
  ["BHP"] = "I am the captain of this ship.",
  ["BHW"] = "Spells are very useful in combat - not only for mages, though of course we particularly rely on them for much of our damage output. ...",
  ["BHX"] = "Ah, the beauty of our world! It is vast and extraordinarily diverse. Strange islands, beautiful cities and fierce monsters that roam the wildernesses. Mysteries, adventures, danger around every corner. ...",
  ["BHY"] = "Once you have reached level 8, you are ready to choose a vocation and go to the Tibian Mainland.",
  ["BHZ"] = "Your choice of vocation will determine your life in Tibia, and the skills and fighting techniques you may use. ...",
  ["BHa"] = "There are four vocation: knight, druid, paladin and sorcerer. If you want to know more about them, talk to Oressa in the temple. ...",
  ["BHb"] = "I myself teach try-out spells for both the magical classes, whereas Tybald in the next room specialises in knight and paladin spells.",
  ["BHc"] = "A very intelligent girl. Prefers to listen to wild animals' noises instead of humans', which is quite understandable when you think about it. ...",
  ["BHd"] = "However, she's also a very apt healer and can give you advice on your choice of vocation.",
  ["BHe"] = "There's a broad variety of what spells can do, as you will see as you progress further. The next spells you can buy with level 8 and on. ...",
  ["BHf"] = "Some attack spells can be directed at a single target while others affect an area, having an effect either over time or instantaneous. Even other spells protect you, or can be used to create runes. ...",
  ["BHg"] = "Each vocation has its own individual spells that none of the other vocations can use. You can only learn spells at a spell trainer of your vocation. ...",
  ["BHh"] = "The spells here on Dawnport are for trying out only, and you will forget them once you choose your definite vocation and leave for the Mainland. ...",
  ["BHi"] = "There, you can go to a spell teacher in a city to permanently learn a spell.",
  ["BHj"] = "The Mainland offers many more adventures, dangers and quests than this small isle, and also has spell teachers where you can permanently learn a spell for your vocation. ...",
  ["BHk"] = "Once you reach level 8 you may choose your definite vocation and leave for Main. Go to a city and seek out the spell trainer of your vocation to learn a spell. And make sure you have enough gold! ...",
  ["BHl"] = "The art of spell teaching is complex and dangerous, and we will only impart our valuable knowledge of a spell to a novice if they can pay the price.",
  ["BHm"] = "In this category I have '{Lighthealing}', '{Healfriend}', and '{Curepoison}'.",
  ["BHn"] = "Roughened and toughened by life's tragedies. A good man, but somber.",
  ["BHo"] = "Yes, child. If you wish to learn a spell, tell me.",
  ["BHp"] = "A very headstrong young man, though I appreciate his devotion to the craft of potion-making. \\z\n\t\tNo respect for senior authority or age at all! Except maybe for a little soft spot for Mr Morris.",
  ["BHq"] = "A strange young man. He seems driven, to my mind. By what force, I do not know. \\z\n\t\tI take it the world needs adventurers such as him.",
  ["BHr"] = "Redeeming one's soul by becoming a clerk? Not very likely. Once a pirate, always a pirate. \\z\n\t\tBut he's a charming old rogue.",
  ["BHs"] = "Not a half bad cook, truly. Must have been that squirrel diet, \\z\n\t\tit seems to have lead him to discover a new cuisine - everything to forget the bad taste of squirrels, he said.",
  ["BHt"] = "He is proficient in the martial arts. A very skilled teacher of spells for knights and paladins. \\z\n\t\tIf that is your vocation, you should talk to Ser Tybald.",
  ["BHu"] = "Ah, yes. Travelled with Plunderpurse a lot as I recall. Captain Plunderpurse, then. \\z\n\t\t\tGot his head full of numbers and statistics, that boy.",
  ["BHv"] = "In this category I have '{Findperson}', '{Magicrope}', '{Levitate}', '{Light}', \\z\n\t\t'{Greatlight}', '{Haste}', '{Poisonfield}', '{Firefield}', '{Lightmagicmissile}' and '{Energyfield}'.",
  ["BHw"] = "In this category I have '{Deathstrike}', '{Firewave}', '{Apprenticesstrike}', \\z\n\t\t'{Energystrike}', '{Terrastrike}', '{Flamestrike}', '{Icestrike}', '{Physicalstrike}', '{Icewave}'.",
  ["BHx"] = "I can teach you {healing spells}, {support spells} and {attack spells}. \\z\n\t\tWhat kind of spell do you wish to learn?",
  ["BHy"] = "I am Garamond Starstream.",
  ["BHz"] = "Did you not listen? I am the teacher of druid and sorcerer spells for level 8 to 18. \\z\n\t\tI teach young adventurers spells they can use once they have the proper vocation - druid or sorcerer.",
  ["BI"] = "The language of my kind. Superior to any other language and only to be spoken by entities with enough eyes to blink it.",
  ["BI0"] = "The world of Tibia is very large with tons of places to explore. Vast deserts, Caribbean islands, deep jungles, green meadows and jagged mountains await you!",
  ["BI1"] = "The temple is the place to go when you are very low on {health} or poisoned. Ask {Cipfried} for a heal - he usually notices emergencies by himself.",
  ["BI2"] = "Your current health is shown by the red bar on the right side. {Death} awaits you if it goes down to zero.",
  ["BI3"] = "Dying in Tibia is painful, so try to avoid it. You will lose part of your {experience} points and also equipment. Make sure your {health} always stays up!",
  ["BI4"] = "You gain experience when fighting {monsters}. You can take a look at your skill window to check your progress.",
  ["BI5"] = "Good monsters to start hunting are {rats}. They live in the {sewers} below the village.",
  ["BI6"] = "One entrance to the sewers is south of this {academy}. Look for a sewer grate, then use it to climb down.",
  ["BI7"] = "Hello, |PLAYERNAME|. Welcome to the Academy of Rookgaard. May I sign you up as a {student}?",
  ["BI8"] = "The academy is the building you are standing in. We have a {library}, a {bank} and the room of the {oracle}.",
  ["BI9"] = "There are many books in the bookcases around you, unless some naughty kids stole them again. Read them for more and detailed information.",
  ["BIA"] = "Heed. Your. Will. We. Will.",
  ["BIB"] = "Intruder. Intrude. Must. Explain.",
  ["BIC"] = "Ssssttttoooopppp.",
  ["BID"] = "Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|! And remember: No running up and down in the academy!",
  ["BIE"] = "Hello, |PLAYERNAME|. Welcome to the Academy of Rookgaard. May I sign you up as a {student}?",
  ["BIF"] = "Newcomers - visit me! I'll answer your questions!",
  ["BIG"] = "Thank you! Here is your reward.",
  ["BIH"] = "Dixi sells and buys {armors}, {shields}, {helmets} and {legs}. You can find her shop south of the academy, just go up the stairs in {Obi}'s shop.",
  ["BII"] = "A mysterious druid who lives somewhere in the wilderness. He sells small health {potions} just like {Lily}.",
  ["BIJ"] = "Lee'Delle's shop is in the western part of town, on the {premium} side. She sells everything cheaper.",
  ["BIK"] = "In the southern part of town, Lily sells {potions} which might come in handy once you are deep in a dungeon and need {health}.",
  ["BIR"] = "HEY! You don't have so many!",
  ["BIS"] = "Go and find some rats to kill!",
  ["BIT"] = "Have you brought a dead rat to me to pick up your reward?",
  ["BIU"] = "Thank you! Here is your reward.",
  ["BIV"] = "HEY! You don't have one! Stop playing tricks on me or I'll give you some extra work!",
  ["BIW"] = "Go and find some rats to kill!",
  ["BIX"] = "Do you have a suitable present box for me?",
  ["BIY"] = "THANK YOU! Here is a helmet that will serve you well.",
  ["BIZ"] = "HEY! You don't have one! Stop playing tricks on me or I'll give you some extra work!",
  ["BIa"] = "Get some training in the academy!",
  ["BIb"] = "Well, I would like to send our king a little present but I do not have a suitable box. If you find a nice box, please bring it to me.",
  ["BIc"] = "You are pretty inexperienced. I think killing rats is a suitable challenge for you. For each fresh {dead rat} I will give you two shiny coins of gold.",
  ["BId"] = "For this remark I will wash your mouth with soap, young lady!",
  ["BIe"] = "For this remark I will wash your mouth with soap, young man!",
  ["BIf"] = "This is an island with {vocation} teachers. You can learn all about the different vocations there once you are level 8.",
  ["BIg"] = "It's |TIME|, so you are late. Hurry!",
  ["BIh"] = "My name is Seymour, but for you I am 'Sir' Seymour.",
  ["BIi"] = "At least you know how to address a man of my importance.",
  ["BIj"] = "I'm the master of this fine {academy}, giving {lessons} to my students.",
  ["BIk"] = "Oh, which lesson did you want to attend again? Was it {Rookgaard}, {fighting}, {equipment}, {citizens}, the {academy} or the {oracle}?",
  ["BIl"] = "Feeling lost? Ask me for help!",
  ["BIm"] = "In a bank you can deposit your earned gold coins safely. Just go downstairs to {Paulie} and ask him to {deposit} your money.",
  ["BIn"] = "Yes, depositing your money will keep it safe, so it is a good idea to store it in the bank. Of course, you can always withdraw it again.",
  ["BIo"] = "Well, the {king} doesn't send troops anymore, the {academy} is dreadfully low on money, and the end of the world is pretty nigh. Apart from that I'm reasonably fine, I suppose.",
  ["BIp"] = "Most of the citizens here are {merchants}. You can give me the name of any non-player character and I will tell you something about him or her.",
  ["BIq"] = "Merchants buy and sell goods. Just ask them for a {trade} to see what they offer or buy from you.",
  ["BIr"] = "Trolls are quite nasty monsters which you shouldn't face before level 3 or 4 depending on your {equipment}. Ask the bridge {guards} for their locations!",
  ["BIs"] = "The guards {Dallheim} and {Zerbrus} protect our village from {monsters} trying to enter. They also mark useful {dungeon} locations on your map.",
  ["BIt"] = "There are four vocations: {knights}, {paladins}, {sorcerers} and {druids}. You can choose your vocation once you are level 8 and have talked to the {oracle}.",
  ["BIu"] = "Sorcerers are talented elemental magicians. You will learn all about them once you are level 8 and reached the Island of {Destiny}.",
  ["BIv"] = "Knights are strong melee fighters. You will learn all about them once you are level 8 and reached the Island of {Destiny}.",
  ["BIw"] = "Gain some knowledge in the academy!",
  ["BIx"] = "Druids are nature magic users and great healers. You will learn all about them once you are level 8 and reached the Island of {Destiny}.",
  ["BIy"] = "Paladins are swift distance fighters. You will learn all about them once you are level 8 and reached the Island of {Destiny}.",
  ["BIz"] = "We have a {weapon} and an {armor} shop south of the academy. {Equipment} such as {ropes} are sold to the north-west. {Potions} can be bought to the south. And then there are the {farms}.",
  ["BJ"] = "Noisy pests.",
  ["BJ0"] = "Newcomers - visit me! I'll answer your questions!",
  ["BJ1"] = "Get some training in the academy!",
  ["BJ2"] = "Feeling lost? Ask me for help!",
  ["BJ3"] = "Gain some knowledge in the academy!",
  ["BJ4"] = "Goodbye, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["BJ5"] = "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["BJ6"] = "Fine elven armor and weapons. Have a look.",
  ["BJ7"] = "Looking for protective spells for druids? I can teach you.",
  ["BJ8"] = "No news are good news.",
  ["BJ9"] = "The Bonecrusher family is ideally suited for military jobs.",
  ["BJA"] = "Don't go hunting without proper equipment. You need at least a suitable {weapon}, {armor}, {shield}, {rope} and {shovel}. A {torch} is also good as well as {legs}, a {helmet} and {shoes}.",
  ["BJB"] = "Make money by killing {monsters} and picking up their {loot}. You can sell many of the things they carry.",
  ["BJC"] = "Once a monster is dead, you can select 'Open' on the {corpse} to check what's inside. Sometimes they carry {money} or other items which you can sell to {merchants}.",
  ["BJD"] = "You can even sell some corpses! For example, you can sell fresh dead rats to {Tom} the tanner or me. He also buys other dead creatures, just ask him for a {trade}.",
  ["BJE"] = "You definitely need a rope to progress in dungeons, else you might end up stuck. Buy one from {Al Dee} or {Lee'Delle}.",
  ["BJF"] = "A shovel is needed to dig some {dungeon} entrances open. 'Use' it on a loose stone pile to make a hole large enough to enter.",
  ["BJG"] = "You should not descend into dungeons without proper {equipment}. Once you are all prepared, ask the bridge {guards} for suitable {monsters}.",
  ["BJH"] = "A torch will provide you with light in dark {dungeons}. 'Use' it to light it. You can buy them from {Al Dee} or {Lee'Delle}.",
  ["BJI"] = "Brilliant! We need fine adventurers like you! If you are ready to learn, just ask me for a lesson. You can always ask for the differently coloured words - such as this one - to continue the lesson.",
  ["BJJ"] = "Well, I could give you valuable {lessons} or some general {hints} about the game, or a small {quest} if you're interested.",
  ["BJK"] = "The starter armor, a coat, does not protect you well. First of all, earn some money and try to get a sturdy leather armor from {Dixi}'s  or {Lee'Delle}'s shop. Simply ask for a {trade}.",
  ["BJL"] = "The starter weapon, a club, won't get you far. You should earn some {money} and buy a better weapon such as a sabre from {Obi}'s or {Lee'Delle}'s shop. Simply ask for a {trade}.",
  ["BJM"] = "A sturdy leather helmet is a good choice for a beginner. You can either buy it from {Dixi} and {Lee'Delle}, or, once you are strong enough, {loot} them from {trolls}.",
  ["BJN"] = "I fear you have to buy your first shield by yourself. A wooden shield from {Dixi} or {Lee'Delle} is a good choice.",
  ["BJO"] = "Leather boots are basic shoes which will protect you well. You can either buy them from {Dixi} and {Lee'Delle}, or, once you are strong enough, {loot} them from {trolls}.",
  ["BJP"] = "Leather legs might be a good basic protection. You can buy them from {Dixi} or {Lee'Delle}. Or, once you are strong enough, hunt {trolls}. They sometimes carry them in their {loot}.",
  ["BJQ"] = "Many monsters, such as rabbits or deer, are excellent food providers. You can also buy food from {Willie} or {Billy}, the farmers.",
  ["BJR"] = "Paying for your Tibia account will turn it into a premium account. This means access to more areas and functions of the game as well as other neat features.",
  ["BJS"] = "Hail to King Tibianus! Long live our king! Not that he cares for an old veteran who is stuck on this godforsaken island...",
  ["BJT"] = "Brilliant! We need fine adventurers like you! If you are ready to learn, just ask me for a lesson. You can always ask for the differently coloured words - such as this one - to continue the lesson.",
  ["BJU"] = "Use a small health potion in case of emergencies to fill up around 75 health points. You can buy them at {Lily}'s shop. She also has {antidote} potions.",
  ["BJV"] = "Some monsters poison you. To heal poison, use an antidote potion on yourself. Buy them at {Lily}'s store.",
  ["BJW"] = "Rookgaard is the name of this {village} as well as of the whole {island}. It belongs to the kingdom of {Thais}, in our world which is called {Tibia}.",
  ["BJX"] = "The island is separated into a {premium} side and a non-premium side. On both sides you will find {dungeons}, but the premium side tends to be a little less crowded with other players.",
  ["BJY"] = "The city of Thais is reigned by King Tibianus. Of course, there are many other cities but you will learn about them later.",
  ["BJZ"] = "The most important places in this village are the {temple}, the different {shops}, the {academy} and the {bridges}.",
  ["BJa"] = "There is a bridge to the north and one to the west which lead outside the village. You should only leave once you are well {equipped} and at least level 2.",
  ["BJb"] = "You can leave for mainland once you are level 8. To do so talk to the {oracle}.",
  ["BJc"] = "You have to fight {monsters} to train your {skills} and {level}. If you lose {health}, eat {food} to regain it or use a {potion}.",
  ["BJd"] = "The more you fight with a weapon, the better will be your skill handling this weapon. Don't worry about that right now though, this will become important once you have a {vocation}.",
  ["BJe"] = "Only nonsense on your mind, eh?",
  ["BJf"] = "Once you gained enough experience for a level, you will advance. This means - among other things - more {health} points, a faster walking speed and more strength to carry things.",
  ["BJg"] = "The farms are west of here. You can buy and sell {food} there which you need to regain {health}.",
  ["BJh"] = "To attack a rat, simply click on it in your battle list. Make sure that you have proper {equipment}, though! Also, I give you 2 gold coins for each {dead rat}.",
  ["BJi"] = "I personally don't have anything to trade, but you can ask {merchants} for a trade. That will open a window where you can see their offers and the things they buy from you.",
  ["BJj"] = "Well, I could give you valuable {lessons} or some general {hints} about the game, or a small {quest} if you're interested.",
  ["BJk"] = "Shall I try and take a guess at your destiny?",
  ["BJl"] = "Well, like I told you before, I really think you got that spirit of a sorcerer in you. But of course it's completely up to you!",
  ["BJm"] = "Well, like I told you before, I really think you got that spirit of a druid in you. But of course it's completely up to you!",
  ["BJn"] = "Well, like I told you before, I really think you got that spirit of a paladin in you. But of course it's completely up to you!",
  ["BJo"] = "Well, like I told you before, I really think you got that spirit of a knight in you. But of course it's completely up to you!",
  ["BJp"] = "Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|! And remember: No running up and down in the academy!",
  ["BJq"] = "Obi sells and buys {weapons}. You can find his shop south of the academy.",
  ["BJr"] = "Norma has recently opened a bar here meaning she sells drinks and snacks. Nothing of importance to you, young student.",
  ["BJs"] = "Oh, let's not talk about Loui.",
  ["BJt"] = "A fine and helpful man. Without him, many new adventurers would be quite clueless.",
  ["BJu"] = "This is Tom the tanner's mother. Other than that, I don't think she is of importance.",
  ["BJv"] = "Al Dee has a general {equipment} store in the north-western part of the village. He sells useful stuff such as {ropes}.",
  ["BJw"] = "A traveller from the {main} continent. I wonder what brought her here. No one comes here of his own free will.",
  ["BJx"] = "Billy is {Willie}'s cousin, but he has his farm on the {premium} side of the village.",
  ["BJy"] = "Willie is a fine farmer, although he is short-tempered. He sells and buys {food}.",
  ["BJz"] = "A humble monk living in the {temple} south of here. He can heal you if you are wounded or poisoned.",
  ["BK"] = "Their mages are so close to the truth. Closer then they know and closer then it's good for them.",
  ["BK0"] = "Don't forget to deposit your money here in the Global Bank before you head out for adventure.",
  ["BK1"] = "Where did I put my broom? Mother?",
  ["BK2"] = "Mother?! Oh no, now I have to do this all over again",
  ["BK3"] = "Mhmhmhmhm.",
  ["BK4"] = "Lalala...",
  ["BK5"] = "Precisely.",
  ["BK8"] = "So my initial calculations had been correct!",
  ["BK9"] = "Looks like I have to find another way then.",
  ["BKA"] = "If you have a crime to report and clues, then do it, but don't waste my time.",
  ["BKB"] = "If you have a crime to report and clues, then do it, but don't waste my time.",
  ["BKC"] = "If you have a crime to report and clues, then do it, but don't waste my time.",
  ["BKD"] = "If you have a crime to report and clues, then do it, but don't waste my time.",
  ["BKE"] = "The castle is one of the safest places in Carlin.",
  ["BKF"] = "Our people are fine and peaceful.",
  ["BKG"] = "I bet they spy on us... not my business, however.",
  ["BKH"] = "I scared this bigmouth so much that he left the town by night. HO, HO, HO!",
  ["BKI"] = "The city is is a peaceful place, and it's up to me to keep it this way.",
  ["BKJ"] = "HAIL TO QUEEN ELOISE!",
  ["BKK"] = "He is the guy responsible to keep the sewers working. Someone has to do such kind of jobs. I can't handle all the garbage of the city myself.",
  ["BKL"] = "Rowenna is one of our local smiths. When you look for weapons, look for Rowenna.",
  ["BKM"] = "Rowenna is one of our local smiths. When you look for weapons, look for Rowenna.",
  ["BKN"] = "Cornelia is one of our local smiths. When you look for armor, look for Cornelia.",
  ["BKO"] = "Cornelia is one of our local smiths. When you look for armor, look for Cornelia.",
  ["BKP"] = "She has the sharpest eye in the region, I'd say.",
  ["BKQ"] = "Her peacefulness is sometimes near stupidity.",
  ["BKR"] = "I worship Banor of course.",
  ["BKS"] = "For me, he's the god of justice.",
  ["BKT"] = "His cult is forbidden in our town.",
  ["BKU"] = "HAIL TO QUEEN ELOISE!",
  ["BKV"] = "Wouldn't wonder if some males worship him secretly. HO, HO, HO!",
  ["BKW"] = "I deal more with the human mosters, you know? HO, HO, HO!",
  ["BKX"] = "Would certainly make a good butterknife. HO, HO, HO!",
  ["BKY"] = "The only thing that rebels here now and then is the stomach of a male after trying to make illegal alcohol. HO, HO, HO!",
  ["BKZ"] = "For obvious reasons it's forbidden in our city.",
  ["BKa"] = "Just fine.",
  ["BKb"] = "Would you like to buy the general key to the town?",
  ["BKc"] = "Yeah, I bet you'd like to do that! HO, HO, HO!",
  ["BKd"] = "If they make trouble, I'll put them behind bars like all others.",
  ["BKe"] = "If they make trouble, I'll put them behind bars like all others.",
  ["BKf"] = "The Bonecrusher family is ideally suited for military jobs.",
  ["BKg"] = "Isn't this a beautiful day? Perfect for farming.",
  ["BKh"] = "Containers, decoration and general goods, all here!",
  ["BKi"] = "Goodbye, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["BKj"] = "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["BKk"] = "Good bye!.",
  ["BKl"] = "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["BKm"] = "*mumbles*",
  ["BKn"] = "That astronomer of the academy simply has no idea what he is dealing with...",
  ["BKo"] = "Some secrets should better be left uncovered.",
  ["BKp"] = "Ha, ha... *mumbles* Hmm.",
  ["BKq"] = "Don't forget to deposit your money here in the Tibian Bank before you head out for adventure.",
  ["BKr"] = "Hiho adventurers, get your runes, potions, wands and rods here!",
  ["BKs"] = "Alms! Alms for the poor!",
  ["BKt"] = "Sir, Ma'am, have a gold coin to spare?",
  ["BKu"] = "I need help! Please help me!",
  ["BKv"] = "Chuqua jamjam!! Tiyopa Sinatuki?",
  ["BKw"] = "Indeed, there has to be some other way.",
  ["BKx"] = "Mmh, interesting.",
  ["BKy"] = "Yes indeed, all of the equipment should be checked and calibrated regularly.",
  ["BKz"] = "No, we have to give this another go.",
  ["BL"] = "Good tools to work with ... After their death, that is.",
  ["BL2"] = "Do you seek a passage to {0} for {1}?",
  ["BL3"] = "We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["BL4"] = "I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Svargrond}, to {Kazordoon}, to {Zao}, to the {Femor Hills}, {Edron} or to {Marapur} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["BL5"] = "I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Svargrond}, to {Kazordoon}, to {Zao}, to the {Femor Hills}, {Edron} or to {Marapur} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["BL6"] = "I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Svargrond}, to {Kazordoon}, to {Zao}, to the {Femor Hills}, {Edron} or to {Marapur} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["BL7"] = "I can fly you to {Darashia}, {Edron}, {Issavi}, {Svargrond}, {Kazordoon}, {Zao} or to {Femor Hills} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["BL8"] = "I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Svargrond}, to {Kazordoon}, to {Zao}, to the {Femor Hills}, {Edron} or to {Marapur} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["BL9"] = "Feel the wind in your hair during one of my carpet rides!",
  ["BLA"] = "Hm, I need to recapitulate my equipment...",
  ["BLB"] = "I heard of a device which would allow man to sail the sea of light. I call it the {Lightboat}, probably the most important invention in our history. And I will not rest until I have found a way to put the plan of its inventor into action.",
  ["BLC"] = "I heard of a device which would allow man to sail the sea of light. I call it the {Lightboat}, probably the most important invention in our history. And I will not rest until I have found a way to put the plan of its inventor into action.",
  ["BLD"] = "I heard of a device which would allow man to sail the sea of light. I call it the {Lightboat}, probably the most important invention in our history. And I will not rest until I have found a way to put the plan of its inventor into action.",
  ["BLG"] = "Precisely.",
  ["BLH"] = "So my initial calculations had been correct!",
  ["BLI"] = "Looks like I have to find another way then.",
  ["BLJ"] = "Hm, I need to recapitulate my equipment...",
  ["BLK"] = "I can't reveal much to you right now as time is of the essence. I can tell you though that the glooth plant and the whole town are in danger and we have to act to stop a {madman} and his schemes.",
  ["BLL"] = "I defeated him there in the past. It has been abandoned for many {years}, but I suspected him to return from the dead eventually, as he has done so often before.",
  ["BLM"] = "The creature is powerful but not very clever. It seems it can be easily {enraged} and then it would likely let slip all caution and would relentlessly attack without regard for its safety.",
  ["BLN"] = "I used the time to prepare. You'll find my talking tubes all the {way} to his lair, and I can provide you with vital information about the things ahead.",
  ["BLO"] = "I can't reveal much to you right now as time is of the essence. I can tell you though that the glooth plant and the whole town are in danger and we have to act to stop a {madman} and his schemes.",
  ["BLP"] = "I defeated him there in the past. It has been abandoned for many {years}, but I suspected him to return from the dead eventually, as he has done so often before.",
  ["BLQ"] = "The creature is powerful but not very clever. It seems it can be easily {enraged} and then it would likely let slip all caution and would relentlessly attack without regard for its safety.",
  ["BLR"] = "I used the time to prepare. You'll find my talking tubes all the {way} to his lair, and I can provide you with vital information about the things ahead.",
  ["BLS"] = "I can't reveal much to you right now as time is of the essence. I can tell you though that the glooth plant and the whole town are in danger and we have to act to stop a {madman} and his schemes.",
  ["BLT"] = "I defeated him there in the past. It has been abandoned for many {years}, but I suspected him to return from the dead eventually, as he has done so often before.",
  ["BLU"] = "The creature is powerful but not very clever. It seems it can be easily {enraged} and then it would likely let slip all caution and would relentlessly attack without regard for its safety.",
  ["BLV"] = "I used the time to prepare. You'll find my talking tubes all the {way} to his lair, and I can provide you with vital information about the things ahead.",
  ["BLW"] = "I can't reveal much to you right now as time is of the essence. I can tell you though that the glooth plant and the whole town are in danger and we have to act to stop a {madman} and his schemes.",
  ["BLX"] = "I defeated him there in the past. It has been abandoned for many {years}, but I suspected him to return from the dead eventually, as he has done so often before.",
  ["BLY"] = "The creature is powerful but not very clever. It seems it can be easily {enraged} and then it would likely let slip all caution and would relentlessly attack without regard for its safety.",
  ["BLZ"] = "I used the time to prepare. You'll find my talking tubes all the {way} to his lair, and I can provide you with vital information about the things ahead.",
  ["BLa"] = "HAIL TO THE KING!",
  ["BLb"] = "HAIL TO THE KING!",
  ["BLc"] = "MIND YOUR MANNERS COMMONER! To address the king greet with his title!",
  ["BLd"] = "MIND YOUR MANNERS COMMONER! To address the king greet with his title!",
  ["BLg"] = "Health potions! Mana potions! Buy them here!",
  ["BLh"] = "All kinds of potions available here!",
  ["BLi"] = "Don't forget to deposit your money here in the Global Bank before you head out for adventure.",
  ["BLj"] = "Do you want to sail {0}",
  ["BLk"] = "We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["BLl"] = "Where do you want to go? To {Tibia}, {Senja} or {Vega}?",
  ["BLm"] = "I am the captain of this ship.",
  ["BLn"] = "I am the captain of this ship.",
  ["BLo"] = "Well, you see me standing behind a bar. Selling drinks. Food. And stuff. Now try figuring out what I could be making a living of down here.",
  ["BLp"] = "I can offer you bread, cheese, ham, or meat. And as drinks we serve beer and water. If you'd like to see what we have to offer, just ask me for a trade.",
  ["BLq"] = "Id like to take a walk with Aurita.",
  ["BLr"] = "I miss Aurita golden hair.*sigh*",
  ["BLs"] = "Pas in boldly tyll thow com to an hall the feyrist undir sky ... *sings*",
  ["BLt"] = "Are you interested in a trade?",
  ["BLu"] = "Dont touch the wings, theyre delicate.",
  ["BLv"] = "Tralllalalla.",
  ["BLw"] = "Potions, wands and runes for aspiring magicians.",
  ["BLx"] = "Feel the wind in your hair during one of my carpet rides!",
  ["BLy"] = "I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Svargrond}, to {Kazordoon}, to {Zao}, to the {Femor Hills}, {Edron} or to {Marapur} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["BLz"] = "I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Svargrond}, to {Kazordoon}, to {Zao}, to the {Femor Hills}, {Edron} or to {Marapur} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["BM"] = "78572611857643646724.",
  ["BM0"] = "Uhhhhhh....",
  ["BM1"] = "It's my curse to be the eternal {guardian} of this ancient {place}.",
  ["BM2"] = "I'm the {guardian} of the {SEVENTH} and final seal. The seal to open the last door before ... but perhaps it's better to see it with your own eyes.",
  ["BM3"] = "It served as a temple, a source of power and ... as a sender for an ancient {race} which lived a long time ago and has long been forgotten.",
  ["BM4"] = "The race that built this edifice came to this place from the stars. They ran from an enemy even more horrible than themselves. But they carried the {seed} of their own destruction in them.",
  ["BM5"] = "This ancient race was annihilated by its own doings, that's all I know. Aeons have passed since then, but the sheer presence of this {complex} is still defiling and desecrating this area.",
  ["BM6"] = "Its constructors were too strange for you or even me to understand. We don't know what this ... thing they built was supposed to be good for. I feel a constant twisting and binding of souls, though, that is probably only a side-effect.",
  ["BM7"] = "The place you know as the Ghostlands had a different name once ... and many names after. Too many to remember them all.",
  ["BM9"] = "Uhhhhhh....",
  ["BMA"] = "What .. happened?",
  ["BMB"] = "Don't forget to deposit your money here in the Global Bank before you head out for adventure.",
  ["BMH"] = "Some parts of the sewers were abandoned when they were beyond repair due to old age and earthquakes. ...",
  ["BMI"] = "That part was never truly well liked. There were rumours that the workers found some ancient structures there and that it was ripe with accidents during the construction. ...",
  ["BMJ"] = "The city sealed those parts off, and I have no idea how anything could get in or out without the permission of the magistrate. ...",
  ["BMK"] = "But since you are investigating on their behalf, you might work out some agreement with them, if you're mad enough to enter the sewers at all. ...",
  ["BML"] = "However, you will have to talk to one of the Glooth Brothers who are responsible for the sewer system's maintenance. You'll find them somewhere down there.",
  ["BMM"] = "Me put name away name long ago. Now only blind prophet of ape people are.",
  ["BMN"] = "Our people a lot to learn have. One day we might live in peace with you hairless apes, who knows.",
  ["BMO"] = "Me not know. Me seldom have visions of not banana related objects.",
  ["BMP"] = "Hairless apes strange people are. ",
  ["BMQ"] = "Me is who in dreams speak to holy banana. Me divine the will of banana.",
  ["BMR"] = "Me {prophet} and {guardian} is.",
  ["BMS"] = "Me is who in dreams speak to holy banana. Me divine the will of banana.",
  ["BMT"] = "Me guard the forbidden land behind the great palisade. If any want to enter, he must ask me for transport.",
  ["BMU"] = "Me guard the forbidden land behind the great palisade. If any want to enter, he must ask me for transport.",
  ["BMV"] = "Good ape he is. Has to work hard to make other apes listen but you helped a lot.",
  ["BMW"] = " Our holy ancestor he is. Big as mountain. Lizards say they built palisade to keep him but we not believe ... We think Bong palisade built to have peace from pesky lizards. We respect peace of Bong, keep people away from forbidden land.",
  ["BMX"] = " The lizards evil and vengeful are. Ape people on guard must be.",
  ["BMY"] = "Let me mourn in peace.",
  ["BMZ"] = "Times have changed <sigh>. In the past dragons were feared and respected. Only the {demons} rivalled our notoriety.",
  ["BMa"] = "Those upstarts! I wonder why would anyone care about them. They lack our style. For them it is all about brute force and showing-off.",
  ["BMb"] = "Breathing fire is an art! Instead of setting everything on fire, you exhale a cone of fire to give a worthy opponent a chance to avoid it.",
  ["BMc"] = "Your lives are so short and meaningless and yet you are here! And as a race you even have your own history and remember things with the help of {books}, which amazes me.",
  ["BMd"] = "I like the idea of books so much that I acquired a human servant to record my memoirs. You find a copy somewhere in my lair.",
  ["BMe"] = "Lava is only fun as long as it doesn't harden - then it turns into an annoyance.",
  ["BMf"] = "I really have to find this scroll. Where did I put it?",
  ["BMg"] = "Too much dust here. I should tidy up on occasion.",
  ["BMh"] = "Someone opened the Grimoire of Flames without permission. Egregious!",
  ["BMi"] = "I am Charkahn the Slayer! The immortal father of the {orcs} and master of this {hive}.",
  ["BMj"] = "Pah! Don't mock me, mortal! This shape is a curse which the evil {djinn} bestowed upon me!",
  ["BMk"] = "This cursed djinn king! I set him free from an enchanted {lamp}, and he {cheated} me!",
  ["BMl"] = "Because I freed him he granted me three wishes. He was true to his word in the first two {wishes}.",
  ["BMm"] = "He built this fortress over Uldrek's grave within a single night. Also, he granted me my second wish and gave me immortality. Test it and try to kill me if you want. Har Har!",
  ["BMn"] = "I wished to father more healthy and fertile children as any orc has ever done. But the djinn cheated me and made me a slime! Then he laughed at me and left for his abandoned fortress in the {Deathwish} Mountains.",
  ["BMo"] = "His ancient fortress on Darama was deserted as the evil Djinn fled this world after his imprisonment. Now the time has come for the evil Djinns to return to their master although this will certainly awaken the {good Djinn} too.",
  ["BMp"] = "I will not share anything more about that topic with you {paleskins}.",
  ["BMq"] = "You are as ugly as maggots, although not quite as as tasty.",
  ["BMr"] = "This cursed djinn king! I set him free from an enchanted lamp, and he cheated me!",
  ["BMs"] = "The orcs are the bearers of Blogs rage. This makes us the ultimate fighters and the most powerful of all races.",
  ["BMt"] = "The orcs are the bearers of Blogs rage. This makes us the ultimate fighters and the most powerful of all races.",
  ["BMu"] = "I can sense the presence and the feelings of my underlings and {minions}. I embrace the rage of the horde.",
  ["BMv"] = "The orcish horde of this hive is under my control. I sense their emotions and their needs and provide them with the leadership they need to focus their hate and rage",
  ["BMw"] = "Hate and rage are the true blessings of Blog, since they are powerful weapons. They give the hive strength. I provide them with direction and focus.",
  ["BMx"] = "The Raging One blessed us with his burning hate. We are truly his children and therefore {divine}.",
  ["BMy"] = "To conquer, to destroy and to dominate. Orcs are born to rule the {world}.",
  ["BMz"] = "One day I will rule the world, even when turned into a {slime}.",
  ["BN0"] = "It's my duty to protect the city.",
  ["BN1"] = "Equipment and general goods!",
  ["BN2"] = "Selling ammunition and buying bows and crossbows!",
  ["BN3"] = "I am... a traveler. Just leave me alone if you have nothing {interesting} to talk about.",
  ["BN4"] = "I don't know anything about money, missing or not.",
  ["BN5"] = "He often comes here. But his constant confusion gives me a worse headache than Frodo's beer. I rather avoid him.",
  ["BN6"] = "Uhm, never heard about him... and you can't prove otherwise.",
  ["BN7"] = "Thats a common name, perhaps I met a William, not sure about that.",
  ["BN8"] = "I am... a traveler. Just leave me alone if you have nothing {interesting} to talk about.",
  ["BN9"] = "Uhhh ohhhh one of the beers yesterday must have been bad.",
  ["BNA"] = "Ask me for a passage...",
  ["BNB"] = "Full steam ahead!",
  ["BNE"] = "Ask me for a passage...",
  ["BNF"] = "In this category I have '{Bruise Bane}', '{Cure Bleeding}', '{Wound Cleansing}', \\z\n\t\t'{Cure Poison}', '{Intense Wound Cleansing}', '{Recovery}' and '{Intense Recovery}'.",
  ["BNG"] = "In this category I have '{Light}', '{Find Person}', '{Magic Rope}', '{Levitate}', '{Haste}', \\z\n\t\t'{Charge}' and '{Great Light}'.",
  ["BNH"] = "I can teach you {healing spells}, {attack spells} and {support spells}. \\z\n\t\tWhat kind of spell do you wish to learn? \\z\n\t\tYou can also tell me for which level you would like to learn a spell, if you prefer that.",
  ["BNI"] = "I think you have forgotten to bring your stake, my child.",
  ["BNJ"] = "I am a priest of the great pantheon.",
  ["BNK"] = "The teachings of Crunor tell us to honor life and not to harm it.",
  ["BNL"] = "It is my mission to bring the teachings of the gods to everyone.",
  ["BNM"] = "It is my mission to bring the teachings of the gods to everyone.",
  ["BNN"] = "My name is Tibra. Your soul tells me that you are |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["BNO"] = "Queen Eloise is wise to listen to the proposals of the druidic followers of Crunor.",
  ["BNP"] = "The grace of the gods must be earned, it cannot be bought!",
  ["BNQ"] = "The world of Tibia is the creation of the gods.",
  ["BNR"] = "Now, it is |TIME|.",
  ["BNS"] = "There's something strange in its neighbourhood. But whom we gonna call for help if not the gods?",
  ["BNT"] = "Yes, I was informed what to do. Are you prepared to receive my line of the prayer?",
  ["BNU"] = "Remind: Not everything you call monster is evil to the core!",
  ["BNV"] = "The mythical blade was hidden in ancient times. Its said that powerful wards protect it.",
  ["BNW"] = "The fallen one should be mourned, not feared.",
  ["BNX"] = "Only a man can fall as low as he did. His soul rotted away already.",
  ["BNY"] = "The gods of good guard us and guide us, the gods of evil want to destroy us and steal our souls!",
  ["BNZ"] = "The gods we call the good ones are Fardos, Uman, the Elements, Suon, Crunor, Nornur, Bastesh, Kirok, Toth, and Banor.",
  ["BNa"] = "Fardos is the creator. The great obsever. He is our caretaker.",
  ["BNb"] = "Uman is the positive aspect of magic. He brings us the secrets of the arcane arts.",
  ["BNc"] = "Air is one of the primal elemental forces, sometimes worshipped by tribal shamans.",
  ["BNd"] = "Fire is one of the primal elemental forces, sometimes worshipped by tribal shamans.",
  ["BNe"] = "So receive my prayer: 'Hope may fill your heart - doubt shall be banned'. Now, bring your stake to Maealil in the elven settlement for the next line of the prayer. I will inform him what to do.",
  ["BNf"] = "Sula is the essence of the elemental power of water.",
  ["BNg"] = "Suon is the lifebringing sun. He observes the creation with love.",
  ["BNh"] = "Crunor, the great tree, is the father of all plantlife. He is a prominent god for many druids.",
  ["BNi"] = "Nornur is the mysterious god of fate. Who knows if he is its creator or just a chronist?",
  ["BNj"] = "Bastesh, the deep one, is the goddess of the sea and its creatures.",
  ["BNk"] = "Kirok, the mad one, is the god of scientists and jesters.",
  ["BNl"] = "Toth, Lord of Death, is the keeper of the souls, the guardian of the afterlife.",
  ["BNm"] = "Banor, the heavenly warrior, is the patron of all fighters against evil. He is the gift of the gods to inspire humanity.",
  ["BNn"] = "The gods we call the evil ones are Zathroth, Fafnar, Brog, Urgith, and the Archdemons!",
  ["BNo"] = "Zathroth is the destructive aspect of magic. He is the deciver and the thief of souls.",
  ["BNp"] = "I will wait for you.",
  ["BNq"] = "Fafnar is the scorching sun. She observes the creation with hate and jealousy.",
  ["BNr"] = "Brog, the raging one, is the great destroyer. The berserk of darkness.",
  ["BNs"] = "The bonemaster Urgith is the lord of the undead and keeper of the damned souls.",
  ["BNt"] = "The demons are followers of Zathroth. The cruelest are known as the ruthless seven.",
  ["BNu"] = "I don't want to talk about that subject!",
  ["BNv"] = "You should visit Maealil in the elven settlement now, my child.",
  ["BNw"] = "You already received my line of the prayer, dear child.",
  ["BNx"] = "A blessed stake? That is a strange request, my child. Maybe Quentin knows more, he is one of the oldest monks after all.",
  ["BNy"] = "You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["BNz"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't help you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BO0"] = "Interesting reaction. Bloodcurdling. Must inspect further.",
  ["BO1"] = "This is really sanguine!",
  ["BO2"] = "Hmm... the conductors are too dry to transmit energy.",
  ["BO3"] = "Ah, fresh blood. My favourite.",
  ["BO4"] = "What a beautiful day for a little boat trip.",
  ["BO5"] = "You are not ready yet.",
  ["BO8"] = "What a beautiful day for a little boat trip.",
  ["BO9"] = "I don't feel safe here ... I hope we can return to Ankrahmun soon.",
  ["BOA"] = "My Name? I am To... ahm... hum... My name is {Hugo}.",
  ["BOB"] = "Yes, that's my name of course.",
  ["BOC"] = "Uh .. I... I met a Todd on the road. He told me he was traveling to Venore, look there for your Todd.",
  ["BOD"] = "I love that city.",
  ["BOE"] = "I never was there. Now leave me alone.",
  ["BOF"] = "Resistance is futile... uhm... I wonder where I picked that saying up. Oh my head...",
  ["BOG"] = "Buying fresh corpses of rats, rabbits and wolves.",
  ["BOH"] = "{Dixi} and {Lee'Delle} sell my leather clothes in their shops.",
  ["BOI"] = "That's my job. It can be dirty at times but it provides enough income for my living.",
  ["BOJ"] = "Do I look like a tourist information centre? Go ask someone else.",
  ["BOK"] = "Help? I will give you a few gold coins if you have some fresh dead {animals} for me. Note the word {fresh}.",
  ["BOL"] = "Fresh means: shortly after their death.",
  ["BOM"] = "Much to do these days.",
  ["BON"] = "Good monsters to start with are rats. They live in the {sewers} under the village of {Rookgaard}.",
  ["BOO"] = "Dungeons can be dangerous without proper {equipment}.",
  ["BOP"] = "You need at least a {backpack}, a {rope}, a {shovel}, a {weapon}, an {armor} and a {shield}.",
  ["BOQ"] = "Sorry, I haven't been outside for a while, so I don't know.",
  ["BOR"] = "Oh yeah, I'm also interested in wolf paws and bear paws.",
  ["BOS"] = "Troll leather stinks. Can't use it.",
  ["BOT"] = "I don't buy orcs. Their skin is too scratchy.",
  ["BOU"] = "Are you crazy?!",
  ["BOV"] = "Nope, sorry, don't sell that. Go see {Al Dee} or {Lee'Delle}.",
  ["BOW"] = "Nope, sorry, don't sell that. Ask {Dixi} or {Lee'Delle}.",
  ["BOX"] = "Nope, sorry, don't sell that. Ask {Obi} or {Lee'Delle}.",
  ["BOY"] = "I'm buying fresh {corpses} of rats, rabbits and wolves. I don't buy half-decayed ones. If you have any for sale, {trade} with me.",
  ["BOZ"] = "He's an apple polisher.",
  ["BOa"] = "Now that's an interesting woman.",
  ["BOb"] = "He's a better cook than his cousin {Willie}, actually.",
  ["BOc"] = "Also buying minotaur leather.",
  ["BOd"] = "I kinda like him. At least he says what he thinks.",
  ["BOe"] = "He sticks his nose too much in books.",
  ["BOf"] = "My mother?? Did you meet my mother??",
  ["BOg"] = "I don't have a problem with him.",
  ["BOh"] = "Typical pencil pusher.",
  ["BOi"] = "It's in the academy, just above Seymour. Go there once you are level 8 to leave this place.",
  ["BOm"] = "Alright. Can I help you with something else then?",
  ["BOs"] = "That's what I thought. I marked the wolf den on your map. To go there, exit the village to the north and walk north-east. Good luck finding that poacher and figuring out a plan to take those skins! Hehe.",
  ["BOt"] = "Well, then walk Rookgaard barefoot. It's up to you!",
  ["BOu"] = "Are you sure? I think I see some war wolf leather on you. You should reply with {yes}.",
  ["BOv"] = "My name is Tom the tanner.",
  ["BOw"] = "I'm the local {tanner}. I buy fresh animal {corpses}, tan them, and convert them into fine leather clothes which I then sell to {merchants}.",
  ["BOx"] = "Buying fresh corpses of rats, rabbits and wolves.",
  ["BOy"] = "Oh yeah, I'm also interested in wolf paws and bear paws.",
  ["BOz"] = "Also buying minotaur leather.",
  ["BP0"] = "I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.",
  ["BP1"] = "You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["BP2"] = "The druids north of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.",
  ["BP3"] = "You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["BP4"] = "Keep your adventurer's stone well.",
  ["BP5"] = "The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["BP7"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for free?",
  ["BP8"] = "Here you are. Take care.",
  ["BP9"] = "No problem.",
  ["BPA"] = "You are not ready yet.",
  ["BPD"] = "I don't feel safe here ... I hope we can return to Ankrahmun soon.",
  ["BPE"] = "Runes, wands, rods, health and mana potions! Have a look!",
  ["BPF"] = "Hear me! Hear me! The mage Wyrdin in the Edron academy is looking for brave adventurers to undertake a task!",
  ["BPG"] = "Hear me! Hear me! The postmaster's guild has open spots for aspiring postmen! Contact Kevin Postner at the post office in the plains south of Kazordoon!",
  ["BPH"] = "Hear me! Hear me! The inquisition is looking for daring people to fight evil! Apply at the inquisition headquarters next to the Thaian jail!",
  ["BPI"] = "In Ankrahmun's desert, a storm has revealed the entry to a nightmare that can't be sealed. Horrible creatures there spell instant death to all young adventurers who dare take a breath!",
  ["BPJ"] = "Near Darashia's coast, a storm has revealed the entry to a nightmare that can't be sealed. Horrible creatures there spell instant death to all young adventurers who dare take a breath!",
  ["BPK"] = "Near Drefia's mountains, a storm has revealed the entry to a nightmare that can't be sealed. Horrible creatures there spell instant death to all young adventurers who dare take a breath!",
  ["BPL"] = "Hear ye! Hear ye! What a lucky and beautiful day! Visit Carlin, Ankrahmun, or Liberty Bay. Yasir, the oriental trader might be there. Gather your creature products, for this chance is rare.",
  ["BPM"] = "Hear ye! Hear ye! A fiery gate has opened, threatening a city! Guard the people frightened, their death would be a pity!",
  ["BPU"] = "Okay, who knows, maybe you have a chance. A really small one though. Listen up: ...",
  ["BPV"] = "First, you have to prove your guts by bringing me 100 hardened bones. ...",
  ["BPW"] = "Next, if you actually managed to collect that many, please complete a small task for our guild and bring us 100 turtle shells. ...",
  ["BPX"] = "It is said that excellent shields can be created from these. ...",
  ["BPY"] = "Alright, um, afterwards show me that you have fighting spirit. Any true hero needs plenty of that. ...",
  ["BPZ"] = "The last task is the hardest. You will need to bring me a claw from a mighty dragon king. ...",
  ["BPa"] = "Did you understand everything I told you and are willing to handle this task?",
  ["BPb"] = "In this category I have '{Wound Cleansing}'' and '{Cure Poison}''.",
  ["BPc"] = "In this category I have '{Light}', '{Find Person}' and '{Great Light}'.",
  ["BPd"] = "I can teach you {healing spells} and {support spells}. What kind of spell do you wish to learn? You can also tell me for which level you would like to learn a spell, if you prefer that.",
  ["BPe"] = "In this category I have '{Bruise Bane}', '{Cure Bleeding}', '{Wound Cleansing}', '{Cure Poison}', '{Intense Wound Cleansing}', '{Recovery}' and '{Intense Recovery}'.",
  ["BPf"] = "In this category I have '{Light}', '{Find Person}', '{Magic Rope}', '{Levitate}', '{Haste}', '{Charge}' and '{Great Light}'.",
  ["BPg"] = "I can teach you {healing spells}, {attack spells} and {support spells}. What kind of spell do you wish to learn? You can also tell me for which level you would like to learn a spell, if you prefer that.",
  ["BPh"] = "Courageous adventurers, come buy your weapons and armors here!",
  ["BPi"] = "So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["BPj"] = "No problem.",
  ["BPk"] = "You don't even have that strange stake with you.",
  ["BPl"] = "Brewster sent me a strange message about some strange hocus-pocus. I think it's nonsense, but since you have come that far, I'll play along. Are you ready?",
  ["BPm"] = "So receive my prayer: 'Your mind shall be a vessel for joy, light and wisdom' - uh, wow, something happened. Well, I guess that's it, but next time if you need some mumbo jumbo rather go to Chondur.",
  ["BPn"] = "You don't even have that strange stake with you.",
  ["BPo"] = "No problem, I have other things to do.",
  ["BPp"] = "A blessed stake? I don't believe in things like that. If anyone does, it's probably old Quentin.",
  ["BPq"] = "I won't do that rubbish again. Go pester Chondur with your hocus-pocus.",
  ["BPr"] = "You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["BPs"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't help you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BPt"] = "Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["BPu"] = "Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  ["BPv"] = "There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BPw"] = "I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["BPx"] = "I can sense that the druids north of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.",
  ["BPy"] = "I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["BPz"] = "I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["BQ"] = "Yes, yes, I will kill you soon enough, now let me continue my investigation on you.",
  ["BQ0"] = "Well, if you change your mind, let me know.",
  ["BQ1"] = "Here, this studded armor will protect you much better. Fits you perfectly! Now - let's work on your footwear. Tom the Tanner can create great boots out of quality leather. You should pay him a visit!",
  ["BQ2"] = "Seriously, don't reject that offer. I'm going to give you a studded armor. No one refuses free stuff! If you don't like it, you can sell it - I don't need it anymore. I promise it's not too used or smelly. Want it?",
  ["BQ3"] = "Then do whatever you have to do first, but please hurry!",
  ["BQ4"] = "Take a small break then and return to me when you have recovered... and cleaned your face.",
  ["BQ5"] = "Alright, then just let me know when you're ready. Don't take too much time though.",
  ["BQ6"] = "This brass helmet will make sure you don't hurt your head. I probably should have given that to you BEFORE you made a rocky tunnel collapse! Take your well-deserved break. Once you're ready for the next mission, talk to me again.",
  ["BQ7"] = "Seriously, don't reject that offer. I'm going to give you a brass helmet. No one refuses free stuff! If you don't like it, you can sell it - I don't need it anymore. I promise there are no fleas in it. Want it?",
  ["BQ8"] = "Let me know when you're ready. This should be fun.",
  ["BQ9"] = "Okay, then good hunting.",
  ["BQA"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for 30 gold?",
  ["BQB"] = "Here you are. Take care.",
  ["BQC"] = "Sorry, you don't have enough money.",
  ["BQD"] = "Goodbye, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["BQE"] = "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["BQF"] = " <the dwarf quizzically raises his brow - the only destinations he accepts seems to be {Cormaya} or {Kazordoon}>",
  ["BQG"] = "In this category I have '{Bruise Bane}', '{Cure Bleeding}', '{Wound Cleansing}', '{Cure Poison}', '{Intense Wound Cleansing}', '{Recovery}' and '{Intense Recovery}'.",
  ["BQH"] = "In this category I have '{Light}', '{Find Person}', '{Magic Rope}', '{Levitate}', '{Haste}', '{Charge}' and '{Great Light}'.",
  ["BQI"] = "I can teach you {healing spells}, {attack spells} and {support spells}. What kind of spell do you wish to learn? You can also tell me for which level you would like to learn a spell, if you prefer that.",
  ["BQJ"] = "Feel the wind in your hair during one of my carpet rides!",
  ["BQK"] = "I would never transport this one.",
  ["BQL"] = "So you heard about haunted Drefia? Many adventures travel there to test their skills against the undead: vampires, mummies, and ghosts.",
  ["BQM"] = "Some people claim it is hidden somewhere under the endless sands of the devourer desert in Darama.",
  ["BQN"] = "Thais is noisy and overcrowded. That's why I like Darashia more.",
  ["BQO"] = "I have seen almost every place on the continent.",
  ["BQP"] = "I could retell the tales of my travels for hours. Sadly another flight is scheduled soon.",
  ["BQQ"] = "Just another Thais but with women to lead them.",
  ["BQR"] = "You can buy flying carpets only in Darashia.",
  ["BQS"] = "I transport travellers to the continent of Darama for a small fee. So many want to see the wonders of the desert and learn the secrets of Darama.",
  ["BQT"] = "I heard too many news to recall them all.",
  ["BQU"] = "Never heard about a place like this.",
  ["BQV"] = "I heard too many news to recall them all.",
  ["BQW"] = "I can fly you to {Darashia} on Darama, {Kazordoon}, {Svargrond}, {Issavi}, {Farmine} or {Edron} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["BQX"] = "I can fly you to {Darashia} on Darama, {Kazordoon}, {Svargrond} or {Edron} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["BQY"] = "I can fly you to {Darashia} on Darama, {Kazordoon}, {Svargrond} or {Edron} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["BQb"] = "Hold on!",
  ["BQc"] = "You shouldn't miss the experience.",
  ["BQd"] = "I am known as Uzon Ibn Kalith.",
  ["BQe"] = "I am a licensed Darashian carpet pilot. I can bring you to {Darashia}, {Kazordoon}, {Svargrond} or {Edron}.",
  ["BQf"] = "The caliph welcomes travellers to his land.",
  ["BQg"] = "The caliph welcomes travellers to his land.",
  ["BQh"] = "Oh, there is so much to tell about Daraman. You better travel to Darama to learn about his teachings.",
  ["BQi"] = "Feel the wind in your hair during one of my carpet rides!",
  ["BQj"] = "Feel the wind in your hair during one of my carpet rides!",
  ["BQk"] = "Never heard about a place like this.",
  ["BQl"] = "Hold on!",
  ["BQm"] = "You shouldn't miss the experience.",
  ["BQn"] = "I am known as Uzon Ibn Kalith.",
  ["BQo"] = "I transport travellers to the continent of Darama for a small fee. So many want to see the wonders of the desert and learn the secrets of Darama.",
  ["BQp"] = "I heard too many news to recall them all.",
  ["BQs"] = "Feel the wind in your hair during one of my carpet rides!",
  ["BQt"] = "Love is beautiful, we are loved.",
  ["BQv"] = "Love is beautiful, we are loved.",
  ["BQw"] = "Im eager for a bath in the lake.",
  ["BQx"] = "Im interested in shiny precious things, if you have some.",
  ["BQy"] = "No, you cant have this cloak.",
  ["BQz"] = "Talk to me if you want to help protecting the village.",
  ["BR"] = "They will mourn the day they abandoned us.",
  ["BR0"] = "Ah, what the heck.Make sure you know what you want before you bug me.",
  ["BR1"] = "I try out old and new {recipes}. You can sell all {food} to me.",
  ["BR2"] = "I'd love to try a banana pie but I lack the {bananas}. If you get me one, I'll reward you.",
  ["BR3"] = "Which one?",
  ["BR4"] = "This island would be wonderful if there weren't a constant flood of newcomers.",
  ["BR5"] = "If I were you, I'd stay here.",
  ["BR6"] = "I know how to spell.",
  ["BR7"] = "I'm a magician in the kitchen.",
  ["BR8"] = "I'm not in the weapon business, so stop disturbing me.",
  ["BR9"] = "I'm glad that we don't see many officials here.",
  ["BRA"] = "Rookgaard needs your help more than ever.",
  ["BRB"] = "Well done, this bone is exactly what I needed! Great. I have to do some preparations, but as reward for your great work, I have a shiny new weapon for you. Here, would you like to have this sword?",
  ["BRC"] = "Ah... well, if you lost that bone on the way, that's too bad. I just hope you didn't get hungry and nibbled on it. I wouldn't eat cursed flesh if I were you. Anyway, you can still have this old sword as reward, do you want it?",
  ["BRD"] = "This sword has helped me in many fierce battles. I hope you can put it to good use. Once you're ready for the next mission, talk to me again.",
  ["BRE"] = "Seriously, don't reject that offer. Just take that sword, it's free. If you don't like it, you can sell it - I don't need it anymore. I promise there are no blood stains on it. Want it?",
  ["BRF"] = "Well, then just let me know when you're ready.",
  ["BRG"] = "Alright. Here is the empty flask to use on a dead wasp. I also marked the wasps' nest on your map. Be careful and don't forget to wear your silver amulet for poison protection!",
  ["BRH"] = "Should I explain it again?",
  ["BRI"] = "Oh, but there you have it in your inventory! Yeah, your backpack is a bit of a mess. I understand you overlooked it. Dig deeper!",
  ["BRJ"] = "No problem. Here's a new one. I can only give you one per hour though, so try not to lose it again this time.",
  ["BRK"] = "Great, then please find the wasps' nest, kill one and use the empty flask on its dead body.",
  ["BRL"] = "Well, if you change your mind you know where to find me. Remember that if you help Rookgaard, Rookgaard might be able to help you.",
  ["BRM"] = "Well, please come back with the poison soon. We won't have much time until Kraknaknork's next attack.",
  ["BRN"] = "Oh, but you don't carry any - did you lose the flask? I can give you a new empty one, but that will also reset your mission, meaning you have to extract new poison. Would you like that?",
  ["BRO"] = "Alright. Here is the empty flask to use on a dead wasp. Don't lose it this time!",
  ["BRP"] = "Great, then please find the wasps' nest, kill one and use the empty flask on its dead body.",
  ["BRQ"] = "This brass shield is actually brand-new. It's never been used! I hope it will serve you well. Take a small break, regenerate your health, and then talk to me again for your final mission!",
  ["BRR"] = "Seriously, don't reject that offer. Just take that shield, it's free. If you don't like it, you can sell it - I don't need it anymore. I promise it's really brand-new. Want it?",
  ["BRV"] = "OK, dude!",
  ["BRW"] = "Awesome! Off to work with you. I've marked the barn on your map.",
  ["BRX"] = "Oh, but you have... you should say {yes}!",
  ["BRY"] = "No worries, let's refresh your memory. To fight a monster, click on it in the battle list and you'll automatically attack it. It's as easy as that! If you want to practice, just hunt a few harmless rabbits south of here. Remember it now?",
  ["BRZ"] = "Actually I think you have killed enough. You should reply with {yes}!",
  ["BRa"] = "What do you mean? If you're ready to {help} me again, just say so.",
  ["BRb"] = "Talk to me if you want to help protecting the village.",
  ["BRc"] = "Rookgaard needs your help more than ever.",
  ["BRd"] = "Have you moved to a new home? I'm the specialist for equipping it.",
  ["BRe"] = "Don't forget to deposit your money here in the Tibian Bank before you head out for adventure.",
  ["BRf"] = "Finishing prey hunting tasks will give you hunting task points (HTP). These can be exchanged for items of the following categories: {outfit}, {mount}, {trophies} and {furniture}. ...",
  ["BRg"] = "Please note, that all items will be put into your Store inbox!",
  ["BRi"] = "Every Adventurer has one. The big advantage is that you can access your money in every branch of the World Bank! ...",
  ["BRj"] = "Would you like to know more about the {basic} functions of your bank account, the {advanced} functions, or are you already bored, perhaps?",
  ["BRk"] = "Waste not, want not!",
  ["BRo"] = "Don't burden yourself with too much cash - store it here!",
  ["BRp"] = "Don't take the money and run - deposit it and walk instead!",
  ["BRq"] = "We can {change} money for you. You can also access your {bank account}.",
  ["BRr"] = "There are three different coin types in Tibia: 100 gold coins equal 1 platinum coin, \\z\n\t\t\t100 platinum coins equal 1 crystal coin. \\z\n\t\t\tSo if you'd like to change 100 gold into 1 platinum, simply say '{change gold}' and then '1 platinum'.",
  ["BRs"] = "We can {change} money for you. You can also access your {bank account}.",
  ["BRt"] = "Your bank account will be used automatically when you want to {rent} a house or place an offer \\z\n\t\t\ton an item on the {market}. Let me know if you want to know about how either one works.",
  ["BRu"] = "You can check the {balance} of your bank account, {deposit} money or {withdraw} it. \\z\n\t\t\tYou can also {transfer} money to other characters, provided that they have a vocation.",
  ["BRv"] = "You can check the {balance} of your bank account, {deposit} money or {withdraw} it. \\z\n\t\t\tYou can also {transfer} money to other characters, provided that they have a vocation.",
  ["BRw"] = "Waste not, want not!",
  ["BRx"] = "Don't burden yourself with too much cash - store it here!",
  ["BRy"] = "Don't take the money and run - deposit it and walk instead!",
  ["BRz"] = "Selling weapons, ammunition and armor. Special offers only available here, have a look!",
  ["BS"] = "I am the great librarian.",
  ["BS1"] = "{Tokens} are small objects made of metal or other materials. You can use them to buy superior equipment from token traders like me.",
  ["BS2"] = "There are several ways to obtain the tokens I'm interested in - killing certain bosses, for example. In exchange for a certain amount of tokens, I can offer you some first-class items.",
  ["BS3"] = "Disrupt the Heart of Destruction, fell the World Devourer to prove your worth and you will be granted the power to imbue 'Powerful Strike', 'Powerful Void' and --'Powerful Vampirism'.",
  ["BS4"] = "If you have any gold tokens with you, let's have a look! These are my offers.",
  ["BS5"] = "I have creature products for the imbuements {strike}, {vampirism} and {void}. Make your choice, please!",
  ["BS6"] = "Trading tokens! First-class equipment available!",
  ["BS7"] = "The powerful bundle for the void imbuement consists of 25 rope belts, 25 silencer claws and 5 grimeleech wings. Would you like to buy it for 6 gold tokens??",
  ["BS8"] = "The basic bundle for the strike imbuement consists of 20 protective charms. Would you like to buy it for 2 gold tokens??",
  ["BS9"] = "The intricate bundle for the strike imbuement consists of 20 protective charms and 25 sabreteeth. Would you like to buy it for 4 gold tokens??",
  ["BSA"] = "I'm a farmer, not a preacher.",
  ["BSB"] = "Buying and selling food!",
  ["BSC"] = "What about them? Do you live there?",
  ["BSD"] = "I've got no time for your dungeon nonsense.",
  ["BSE"] = "My cousin {Billy} cooks rat stew. Yuck! Can you imagine that?",
  ["BSF"] = "Are you afraid of monsters? I bet even the sight of a {rat} would let your knees tremble. Hahaha.",
  ["BSG"] = "Do I look like a clock?",
  ["BSH"] = "I'm a farmer, not a preacher.",
  ["BSI"] = "Can't stand him.",
  ["BSJ"] = "Quite a babe.",
  ["BSK"] = "Don't ever mention his name again! He can't even {cook}!",
  ["BSL"] = "Our little monkey.",
  ["BSM"] = "Make sure you know what you want before you bug me.",
  ["BSN"] = "Uhm, fine guy I think.",
  ["BSO"] = "Boring little girl.",
  ["BSP"] = "Overrated.",
  ["BSQ"] = "She thinks she owns this island with her underpriced offers.",
  ["BSR"] = "I don't like hippie girls.",
  ["BSS"] = "Leave me alone with that guy.",
  ["BST"] = "About time we got a bar here.",
  ["BSU"] = "This old guy has only money on his mind.",
  ["BSV"] = "Hopefully it gets you off this island soon so you can stop bugging me.",
  ["BSW"] = "Uptight and correct in any situation.",
  ["BSX"] = "You, over there! Stop sniffing around my farm! Either trade with me or leave!",
  ["BSY"] = "If he wants to sacrifice all his free time for beginners, fine with me. Then they don't disturb me.",
  ["BSZ"] = "This joke of a man thinks he is sooo important.",
  ["BSa"] = "Decent guy.",
  ["BSb"] = "Yeah, so?",
  ["BSc"] = "Overrated.",
  ["BSd"] = "Too old to be interesting for me.",
  ["BSi"] = "Haven't they taught you anything at school? Ask for a {trade} if you want to trade.",
  ["BSj"] = "Help yourself. Or ask the other {citizens}, I don't have time for that.",
  ["BSk"] = "Fine enough.",
  ["BSl"] = "Willie.",
  ["BSm"] = "I'm a farmer and a cook.",
  ["BSn"] = "Ah, what the heck.Make sure you know what you want before you bug me.",
  ["BSo"] = "Buying and selling food!",
  ["BSp"] = "Make sure you know what you want before you bug me.",
  ["BSq"] = "You, over there! Stop sniffing around my farm! Either trade with me or leave!",
  ["BSr"] = "No part of clan. Me prefer company of precious. Or mirror image. Always nice to see pretty me!",
  ["BSs"] = "What you on quest for? Go leave Woblin alone with {precious}",
  ["BSt"] = "Me not give {key}! Key my precious now! By old goblin law all that one has in his pockets for two days \\z\n\t\t\tis family heirloom! Me no part with my precious ... hm unless you provide Woblin with some {reward}!",
  ["BSu"] = "<mumbles> So where was I again?",
  ["BSv"] = "<mumbles> Typical - you can never find a hero when you need one!",
  ["BSw"] = "<mumbles> Could the bonelord language be the invention of some madman?",
  ["BSx"] = "<mumbles> The curse algorithm of triplex shadowing has to be two times higher than an overcharged nanoquorx on the peripheral...",
  ["BT"] = "It's a fine library, isn't it?",
  ["BT0"] = "Hey mate, up for a game of dice?",
  ["BT1"] = "So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["BT2"] = "No problem.",
  ["BT3"] = "You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["BT4"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't help you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BT5"] = "Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  ["BT6"] = "There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BT7"] = "I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["BT8"] = "I can sense that the druids north of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.",
  ["BT9"] = "I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["BTA"] = "The powerful bundle for the strike imbuement consists of 20 protective charms, 25 sabreteeth and 5 vexclaw talons. Would you like to buy it for 6 gold tokens??",
  ["BTB"] = "The basic bundle for the vampirism imbuement consists of 25 vampire teeth. Would you like to buy it for 2 gold tokens??",
  ["BTC"] = "The intricate bundle for the strike imbuement consists of 20 protective charms and 25 sabreteeth. Would you like to buy it for 4 gold tokens??",
  ["BTD"] = "The powerful bundle for the vampirism imbuement consists of 25 vampire teeth, 15 bloody pincers and 5 pieces of dead brain. Would you like to it for 6 gold tokens??",
  ["BTE"] = "The basic bundle for the void imbuement consists of 25 rope belts. Would you like to buy it for 2 gold tokens??",
  ["BTF"] = "The intricate bundle for the void imbuement consists of 25 rope belts and 25 silencer claws. Would you like to buy it for 4 gold tokens??.",
  ["BTG"] = "So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["BTH"] = "No problem.",
  ["BTI"] = "I think you have forgotten to bring your stake.",
  ["BTJ"] = "Yes, I was informed what to do. Are you prepared to receive my line of the prayer?",
  ["BTK"] = "So receive my prayer: 'Protection will be granted - from dangers at hand'. Now, bring your stake to Isimov in the dwarven settlement for the next line of the prayer. I will inform him what to do.",
  ["BTL"] = "I will wait for you.",
  ["BTM"] = "You should visit Isimov in the dwarven settlement now.",
  ["BTN"] = "You already received my line of the prayer.",
  ["BTO"] = "A blessed stake? That is a strange request. Maybe Quentin knows more, he is one of the oldest monks after all.",
  ["BTP"] = "You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["BTQ"] = "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't help you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BTR"] = "Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["BTS"] = "Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  ["BTT"] = "There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["BTU"] = "I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["BTV"] = "I can sense that the druids north of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.",
  ["BTW"] = "I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
