  ["BTb"] = "You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["BTc"] = "Keep your adventurer's stone well.",
  ["BTd"] = "The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["BTf"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for free?",
  ["BTg"] = "Here you are. Take care.",
  ["BTh"] = "No problem.",
  ["BTi"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for 30 gold?",
  ["BTj"] = "Here you are. Take care.",
  ["BTk"] = "Sorry, you don't have enough money.",
  ["BTl"] = "Beds, chairs, tables, statues and everything you could imagine for decorating your home!",
  ["BTn"] = "Beds, chairs, tables, statues and everything you could imagine for decorating your home!",
  ["BTo"] = "In this category I have '{Bruise Bane}', '{Cure Bleeding}', '{Wound Cleansing}', \\z\n\t\t'{Cure Poison}', '{Intense Wound Cleansing}', '{Recovery}' and '{Intense Recovery}'.",
  ["BTp"] = "In this category I have '{Light}', '{Find Person}', '{Magic Rope}', '{Levitate}', '{Haste}', \\z\n\t\t'{Charge}' and '{Great Light}'.",
  ["BTq"] = "I can teach you {healing spells}, {attack spells} and {support spells}. \\z\n\t\tWhat kind of spell do you wish to learn? \\z\n\t\t\tYou can also tell me for which level you would like to learn a spell, if you prefer that.",
  ["BTr"] = "<sigh> lost... word...",
  ["BTw"] = "<sigh> lost... word...",
  ["BTx"] = "<sigh> ohhhh.... memories...",
  ["BTy"] = "The secrets... too many... sleep...",
  ["BTz"] = "Loneliness...",
  ["BU"] = "I am 486486 and NOT 'Blinky' as some people called me ... before they died.",
  ["BU0"] = "There are many books in the {academy}. Theory can be just as important as practice.",
  ["BU1"] = "It's my duty to protect this village and its {citizens}.",
  ["BU2"] = "It looks like you have mastered the drill.",
  ["BU3"] = "Sorry, I don't trade. Ask the shop owners for a trade instead.",
  ["BU4"] = "I don't approve of her opening a bar. Those drunken adventurers stumbling over the bridge at nighttime are not especially helpful in improving the situation.",
  ["BU5"] = "Such a chicken-hearted person.",
  ["BU6"] = "He sells {weapons}. His shop is south west of town, close to the {temple}.",
  ["BU7"] = "He dedicated his life to welcoming newcomers to this island.",
  ["BU8"] = "She has her own problems.",
  ["BU9"] = "There's something about this guy I don't like.",
  ["BUA"] = "I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["BUB"] = "I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.",
  ["BUC"] = "Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["BUD"] = "You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["BUE"] = "The druids north of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.",
  ["BUF"] = "You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["BUG"] = "The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["BUI"] = "Keep your adventurer's stone well.",
  ["BUJ"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for free?",
  ["BUK"] = "Here you are. Take care.",
  ["BUL"] = "No problem.",
  ["BUM"] = "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for 30 gold?",
  ["BUN"] = "Here you are. Take care.",
  ["BUO"] = "Sorry, you don't have enough money.",
  ["BUP"] = "Bye, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["BUQ"] = "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|! You're looking really bad. Let me heal your wounds.",
  ["BUR"] = "<nods> At your service, |PLAYERNAME|, protecting the {village} from {monsters}.",
  ["BUS"] = "Are you injured or poisoned? I can help you.",
  ["BUT"] = "Zerbrus, at your service.",
  ["BUU"] = "I'm the guard of this bridge. I defend Rookgaard against the beasts of the {wilderness} and the {dungeons}, and even of the stinking {sewers}.",
  ["BUV"] = "My duty is eternal. Time is of no importance.",
  ["BUW"] = "Before you fight monsters, deposit your money there. If you die, you won't lose it if it's save in the bank.",
  ["BUX"] = "Fine.",
  ["BUY"] = "I have to stay here, sorry. But I can {heal} you if you are wounded. I have also valuable information about {monsters}.",
  ["BUZ"] = "I'm an expert concerning the wildlife and {monsters} on this island.",
  ["BUa"] = "I'm not a gossiper, but if you want to know something about a certain Rookgaardian, ask.",
  ["BUb"] = "They're not that dangerous, but don't let yourself get cornered by many of them. They still can hurt.",
  ["BUc"] = "There are two types of spiders on this island: normal spiders and poison spiders. As their name says, the latter ones can poison you which will cause a constant loss of your health. Beware of them!",
  ["BUd"] = "For Rookgaard! For Tibia!",
  ["BUe"] = "Once you have upgraded your starter {equipment} a little - maybe leather stuff - and got a better weapon as well as a shield, you should be able to kill trolls.",
  ["BUf"] = "You need a stronger weapon than the starter club to kill wolves. Maybe a {sabre} or a short {sword} will do.",
  ["BUg"] = "The orcs have a hideout under the troll cave, just descend deep. Still, be very careful!",
  ["BUh"] = "Minotaurs are very strong. You will need a group of people or at least level 6 and good equipment to be able to kill them.",
  ["BUi"] = "They are a little tougher than they look like, but they're still good beginner monsters.",
  ["BUj"] = "The skeletons on this island are usually fairly hidden. They are often found near graves and always underground. Beware of their evil life drain.",
  ["BUk"] = "There is a bear cave close to this bridge. Be careful, though, they hit hard!",
  ["BUl"] = "Wasp hives exist only behind the north bridge, so ask {Dallheim} for information. I'm glad there are no wasps here. They always make me jump.",
  ["BUm"] = "Snakes can poison you, too, but their poison is usually not as dangerous as that of poison spiders. Just be careful and kill them fast.",
  ["BUn"] = "Premium warriors pay. They gain many advantages this way.",
  ["BUo"] = "No monster shall go past me.",
  ["BUp"] = "HAIL TO THE KING!",
  ["BUq"] = "It's north of the temple.",
  ["BUr"] = "A place of protection. Nothing can harm you there.",
  ["BUs"] = "I can mark you some dungeons on your map if you ask me about {monsters} suited for your level.",
  ["BUt"] = "The sewers are crowded with {rats}. They make fine targets for young heroes.",
  ["BUu"] = "There are {wolves}, {bears}, {snakes}, {deer}, and {spiders} in the wilderness past this bridge.",
  ["BUv"] = "I'm a follower of {Banor}.",
  ["BUw"] = "The heavenly warrior! Read {books} to learn about him.",
  ["BUx"] = "You will learn about magic soon enough.",
  ["BUy"] = "In the world of Tibia, many challenges await the brave adventurer.",
  ["BUz"] = "The premium side of Rookgaard lies beyond.",
  ["BV"] = "It's 1, not 'Tibia', silly.",
  ["BV0"] = "I wait. I wait for someone like you to come here. I wait for them to grow disconsolate. I wait for them to despair. And I wait for them to die. Muhahaha.",
  ["BV1"] = "I am Zumtah, Zumtah the impeccable, Zumtah the marvellous, Zumtah the... the... eternal.",
  ["BV2"] = "The land you are currently dwelling in, human. Don't you have any sense of your surroundings?",
  ["BV3"] = "I have seen many of them. I have seen many of them die. In here, with me. Perhaps you will be pleased to meet them. Not long and you will join their ranks. Muhaha.",
  ["BV4"] = "Pesky creatures. Many of them have been brought here, many of them died here. Humans, lizards, beasts, they all die the same. Down here, with me. Muhahaha.",
  ["BV5"] = "What? What do you mean by that?",
  ["BV6"] = "Hmm, an old one. I don't care much about politics or power, as here, he has none. Here, only I have power. Muhaha.",
  ["BV7"] = "What are you talking about, such things do not matter down here. Down here alone, isolated and broken. Muhaha.",
  ["BV8"] = "If you purchase premium time for your account, this opens up a lot of possibilities. ...",
  ["BV9"] = "For example, you will be able to travel off the mainland, ride a mount and benefit from offline training as well as having more outfits and magic spells to choose from.",
  ["BVA"] = "Want to know what monsters are good for you at your level? Just ask me!",
  ["BVB"] = "She's very attractive. Too bad my duty leaves me no time to date her.",
  ["BVC"] = "He guards the temple and can heal you if you are badly injured or poisoned, just like me.",
  ["BVD"] = "She's {Obi's} granddaughter and deals with {armors} and {shields}. Her shop is south west of town, close to the temple.",
  ["BVE"] = "One of these reclusive druids.",
  ["BVF"] = "Her shop is just north of the bridge. She really has good offers.",
  ["BVG"] = "Gentle girl, but a little to esoteric for my taste. However, her {potions} might come in handy.",
  ["BVH"] = "You can find the oracle on the top floor of the {academy}, just above {Seymour}. Go there when you are level 8.",
  ["BVI"] = "The local {bank} clerk.",
  ["BVJ"] = "His job of teaching young heroes is important for the survival of all of us.",
  ["BVL"] = "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|! You're looking really bad. Let me heal your wounds.",
  ["BVT"] = "<nods> At your service, |PLAYERNAME|, protecting the {village} from {monsters}.",
  ["BVU"] = "Bye, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["BVV"] = "Hmm, |PLAYERNAME|. I really don't know if you should go into the wilderness without a shield. You should earn some money by hunting rats under the village first until you can afford at least a wooden shield.",
  ["BVW"] = "Are you injured or poisoned? I can help you.",
  ["BVX"] = "For Rookgaard! For Tibia!",
  ["BVY"] = "No monster shall go past me.",
  ["BVZ"] = "The premium side of Rookgaard lies beyond.",
  ["BVa"] = "Want to know what monsters are good for you at your level? Just ask me!",
  ["BVb"] = "Come over here if you have to resupply!",
  ["BVc"] = "I wish someone could spare a minute and help me...",
  ["BVd"] = "This is too hard for an old woman like me.",
  ["BVe"] = "Hello, young adventurer, you look strong enough to help me!",
  ["BVf"] = "Feel the wind in your hair during one of my carpet rides!",
  ["BVg"] = "I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Svargrond}, to {Kazordoon}, to {Zao}, to the {Femor Hills}, to {Edron} or to {Issavi} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["BVh"] = "I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Svargrond}, to {Kazordoon}, to {Zao}, to the {Femor Hills}, to {Edron} or to {Issavi} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["BVk"] = "Do you seek a passage to {0} for {1}?",
  ["BVl"] = "We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["BVm"] = "I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Svargrond}, to {Kazordoon}, to {Zao}, to the {Femor Hills}, to {Edron} or to {Issavi} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["BVn"] = "I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Svargrond}, to {Kazordoon}, to {Zao}, to the {Femor Hills}, to {Edron} or to {Issavi} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["BVo"] = "I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Svargrond}, to {Kazordoon}, to {Zao}, to the {Femor Hills}, to {Edron} or to {Issavi} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["BVp"] = "I can fly you to {Darashia}, {Edron}, {Issavi}, {Svargrond}, {Kazordoon}, {Zao} or to {Femor Hills} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["BVq"] = "I can fly you to {Darashia}, to {Svargrond}, to {Kazordoon}, to {Zao}, to the {Femor Hills}, to {Edron} or to {Issavi} if you like. Where do you want to go?",
  ["BVr"] = "Feel the wind in your hair during one of my carpet rides!",
  ["BVs"] = "Don't forget to deposit your money here in the Global Bank before you head out for adventure.",
  ["BVw"] = "Bah, I know. I received some sort of 'nomination' from our outpost in Port Hope. ...",
  ["BVx"] = "Usually it takes a little more than that for an award though. However, I honour Myra's word. ...",
  ["BVy"] = "I hereby grant you the right to wear a special sign of honour, acknowledged by the academy of Edron. Since you are a woman, I guess you don't want manly stuff. There you go.",
  ["BVz"] = "I sell equipment for your adventure! Just ask me for a {trade} to see my wares.",
  ["BW"] = "Uglyness incarnate. One eye! Imagine that! Horrible!",
  ["BW6"] = "Ships are a comfortable way of travelling to distant cities. At any harbour, you can board the ship and ask its captain where he sails to.",
  ["BW7"] = "Travelling by ship will cost you some gold, though, so be sure to have money with you.",
  ["BX"] = "485611800364197.",
  ["BXC"] = "Yes, I remember him well. It was a tragedy. An earthquake led to a cave-in and many of our brave miners died. ...",
  ["BXD"] = "Their ghosts still haunt the Grothmok tunnel in which they died, so we had to seal it off.",
  ["BY"] = "78572611857643646724.",
