  ["L0"] = "Where do you want to go? To {Carlin}, {Ab'Dendriel}, {Venore}, {Port Hope}, {Liberty Bay}, {Svargrond}, {Yalahar}, {Roshamuul}, {Oramond} or {Edron}?",
  ["L00"] = "Would you like to assist us in re-establishing order in our city?",
  ["L01"] = "Then stop bothering me.",
  ["L02"] = "My men believe it iz a dizturbanze cauzed by ze corruption zat zpreadz everywhere. Zey are too zcared to go down zere. And zat'z where you come in. ... ",
  ["L03"] = "Have you finished your mission?",
  ["L04"] = "There are rumors of a mysterious statue in the desert next to Darashia. Nobody really knows the meaning of it.",
  ["L05"] = "Did you understand everything I told you and are willing to handle this task?",
  ["L06"] = "Oh great! Supplies from Carlin! Let me see ...<she digs into the parcel>...ahh, nothing meaningful at all, like always. Well, before I give you the password for the delivery, you have to help me! ...",
  ["L07"] = "Then, toll the Bloodgong north of the sacrificial stones to set the dark flows going. Return to me after that.",
  ["L08"] = "Ah, excellent. Obtain the second addon for your rift warrior outfit.",
  ["L09"] = "Sorry, you do not have enough gold coins.",
  ["L0A"] = "Here you are. Happy cooking!",
  ["L0B"] = "Have you collected 15 ounces of magic sulphur?",
  ["L0C"] = "Great! Here, take this yalaharian addon in a return.",
  ["L0D"] = "Fine! Here is the contract. Please sign it. Talk to me about it again when you're done.",
  ["L0E"] = "You already know the secrets of mathemagics! Now go and use them to learn.",
  ["L0F"] = "I think he is getting old, entrusting human scum such as you are with an important mission like that. ...",
  ["L0G"] = "Thank you this stage of the ritual is complete.",
  ["L0H"] = "Sorry.",
  ["L0I"] = "Nice! I'm really happy to have the picture back. First of all I have to check if everything's fine. Then I'll put it back on its place. For now, I'd like you to find out if some rumours about fake pictures in the MOTA are true. ...",
  ["L0J"] = "You've met Fahim the Wise? That's good. I'm pretty sure it was easy to give him a nice beating. ...",
  ["L0K"] = "The Green Claw Swamp is treacherous and dangerous. You will have a hard time to find any clues ...",
  ["L0L"] = "There are no missions for you left right now. But you are worthy indeed. Do you want to advance in our guild?",
  ["L0M"] = "Outsiders managed to sneak in, infiltrate and influence the society... for the worse. Who knows for what ends. They chaaaaanged... ...",
  ["L0N"] = "Take this!",
  ["L0O"] = "Uh... I didn't expect you to return that early. Sorry, but I'm not finished yet with your backpack. I'm doing the best I can, promised.",
  ["L0P"] = "Axe is not done yet!",
  ["L0Q"] = "Alright |PLAYERNAME|. Vocation?",
  ["L0R"] = "We need you to recover this crystal. Travel to the southern camp of the raiders and find our contact man there. Get the memory crystal and bring ithere. The society and the shamans will then decide our next steps. Do you think you can do this?",
  ["L0S"] = "Although, we probably should not do so after your last failure, we are willing to grant you another mission.",
  ["L0T"] = "I need a new quality atlas for our captains. Only one of the best will do it. I heard the explorers society sells the best, but only to members of a certain rank. You will have to get this rank or ask a high ranking member to buy it for you.",
  ["L0U"] = "Have you been successful?",
  ["L0V"] = "Yes, well... I do have one remaining copy of the plans. I will keep them as a... reminder. Such ill-fated devices only cause trouble and despair. Mankind would be better off, without them, right?",
  ["L0W"] = "I don't know whether you are experienced in such things. If not, you could ask somebody who is. But I'm not sure where in Issavi you should look to hire a thief.",
  ["L0X"] = "Were you able to retrieve 40 pieces of ape fur?",
  ["L0Y"] = "Do you want to buy a label for 1 gold?",
  ["L0Z"] = "This is really not advisable. Behind this barrier, strong forces are raging violently. Are you sure that you want to go there?",
  ["L0a"] = "Well, bye then.",
  ["L0b"] = "Then no.",
  ["L0c"] = "He wasn't a bad man. He was only misguided by false friends who told him what society expected of him ...",
  ["L0d"] = "I can't help you, sorry!",
  ["L0e"] = "As you know, our lovely city is a bastion of civilisation surrounded by numerous hazards. The nearby Plains of Havoc and the hostile elven town Shadowthorn are only a few of the obstacles we have to overcome on an almost daily basis ...",
  ["L0f"] = "I'm sorry but I sell only one copy to each customer. Otherwise they would have been sold out a long time ago.",
  ["L0g"] = "For all I've heard, this is rather a barren isle than a whole new land. There are so many places to explore in this world, I won't send our best explorers on account of a rumour.",
  ["L0h"] = "Well, one of the boys has run away. I think he got the scent of some beast. He's young and inexperienced so I can't blame the cub ...",
  ["L0i"] = "Sorry but I only give missions to those who are considered a true Barbarian. ",
  ["L0j"] = "The dwarves are leftovers from a time long gone by. They have outlived their usefulness to the gods and seem to have come to terms with that. ...",
  ["L0k"] = "You don't have my scroll.",
  ["L0l"] = "Well, actually it is a bit more complicated than that. Firstly, you'll have to get forged documents. Ask around in the criminal camp to find a forger. ...",
  ["L0m"] = "So the rumours are true. How could this happen? I'll keep the picture at its place until we've got a replacement. Please fo to {Angelo} and ask him if he has a new artefact for our museum.",
  ["L0n"] = "Bring me 100 of their eye patches, 100 of their peg legs and 100 of their hooks, in that order. ...",
  ["L0o"] = "I'm upset to accuse myself, the lyre is hidden in a tomb west of Kilmaresh.",
  ["L0p"] = "I knew it! I knew I had made a copy! Oh, I am so clever! ...",
  ["L0q"] = "Since you have proven to be a capable soldier, we have another mission for you. ...",
  ["L0r"] = "Well, nothing wrong about exploring the town on your own. Let me know if you need something!",
  ["L0s"] = "It will be your task to get one such grindstone and bring it back to me.",
  ["L0t"] = "Bah, Farmine here, Farmine there. Is there nothing else than Farmine to talk about these days? Hrmpf, whatever. So what do you want?",
  ["L0u"] = "You don't have it...",
  ["L0v"] = "One fresh dead bat, three jalapeño peppers, five brown breads, two eggs, one powder herb and five red mushrooms.",
  ["L0w"] = "Now, watch this. <mumbles darkly> THERE. THE COMPLETE INCANTATION SCROLL. ...",
  ["L0x"] = "Please find great crystal of Fasuon and pray there for his support!",
  ["L0y"] = "Before we start I must ask you for a small donation of 1000 gold coins. Are you willing to pay 1000 gold coins for the test?",
  ["L0z"] = "My last prisoner? Hmm. ...",
  ["L1"] = "Where do you want to go? To {Carlin}, {Ab'Dendriel}, {Venore}, {Port Hope}, {Liberty Bay}, {Svargrond}, {Yalahar}, {Roshamuul}, {Oramond} or {Edron}?",
  ["L10"] = "You brought scroll with lizard text? Good! I will see what text tells me! Come back when ready for other mission.",
  ["L11"] = "Even if the present has not improved our relations, the weapons will enable the barbarians to put more pressure on Svargrond and Carlin. So in any case we profited from the present.",
  ["L12"] = "A zzingle individual can be azz zztrong azz an army if he zztrikezz zze army azz a whole. ... ",
  ["L13"] = "By the way, if you want to have a look on the prismatic and gill items first, just head over to the depot and check the market.",
  ["L14"] = "As the ruby slips into the notch, the strong red of the stone intensifies a thousandfold. You fear to hurt your eyes and turn away immediately. The ray seems to be directed to the centre of the plateau with astounding precision.",
  ["L15"] = "You don't have a red lantern.",
  ["L16"] = "So listen to the first step of my plan. I want you to infiltrate their base. Try to enter their tavern, which meansthat you have to get past the guard. ...",
  ["L17"] = "The equivalent of 5000 gold will do. Are you willing to make such a donation?",
  ["L18"] = "Good .. bye.",
  ["L19"] = "You don't have the needed itens yet.",
  ["L1A"] = "Well, that is his story ... Nah, that's not a tear in my eye. It's just the wind, you know.",
  ["L1B"] = "The teleporter here will transport you to one of the bigger gnomish outposts. ...",
  ["L1C"] = "Now don't be shocked, but - they do put sandcrawlers in there. When I tried to prepare that dish at first, I was repelled by its awful appearance, but since it smelled so good I did take a sip and was pleasantly surprised of the great taste. ...",
  ["L1D"] = "Some of our siblings are tainted by the destructive energies that threaten Feyrist. They are darker now, more aggressive, twisted ... I'm sure you already met them. ...",
  ["L1E"] = "A cookie? Sure, is it for free?",
  ["L1F"] = "The sewers need repair. You in?",
  ["L1G"] = "So listen well. Behind the lower left door you will find a bag. The letters in the bag are for none other than Santa Claus! Deliver them to his house on the isle of Vega, {use} thebag on his mailbox and report back here.",
  ["L1H"] = "Here is your stamp. It can't be transferred to another person and will last one week from now. You'll get notified upon using an ore wagon when it isn't valid anymore.",
  ["L1I"] = "I remember that grapes were his favourites. He was almost addicted to them.",
  ["L1J"] = "That's a ghost, in case you don't know. Goes by name of... Zarifan, if I recall correctly. ...",
  ["L1K"] = "Well done, my friend. That will help us a lot. Of course there are other things to be done though. ...",
  ["L1L"] = "It's not a drama!! I think there is just no god who's responsible for toothbrush safety, that's all ...",
  ["L1M"] = "Come back when you do.",
  ["L1N"] = "So do you want to side with me |PLAYERNAME|? ",
  ["L1O"] = "Hmpf. Why should I waste my time to help some amateur? I'm afraid I can only offer my assistance to actors that are as great as I am. ...",
  ["L1P"] = "I will need something that can be adequately used as intestines. Something alive. Stuff it into this storage flask and return it to me!",
  ["L1Q"] = "There you find for sure the cause for the unrest of the spirits. Find someone in Svargrond who can give you a passage to Helheim and seek for the cause. Are you willing to do that?",
  ["L1R"] = "What do you want to do, if you know about these mighty dragons' abodes? Go there and look for a fight?",
  ["L1S"] = "He has a house in the wilderness. Just between Ab'Dendriel and the orcland. I'll mark his hut on your map.",
  ["L1T"] = "If you manage though to kill all the tentacles it is using within a few heartbeats, it will become confused by its momentary helplessness and will probably attack with its main body. ...",
  ["L1U"] = "Wrong answer!",
  ["L1V"] = "The missions available for your rank are {lizard urn}, {bonelord secrets} and {orc powder}.",
  ["L1W"] = "No gold, no sale, that's it.",
  ["L1X"] = "You may pass this portal if you have 50 acorns as offering. Do you have the acorns with you?",
  ["L1Y"] = "Talking frogs don't exist, idiot. It's your fucking imagination tricking you. And now your imagination commands you to walk away.",
  ["L1Z"] = "Whisper moss strong is, but me need liquid that humans have to make it work ...",
  ["L1a"] = "Collect them and give them to Aurita. Each of those notes will grant her a walk on the beach with Taegen.",
  ["L1b"] = "Oh they don't change that much since in the old days as... <tells a boring and confusing story about a cake, a parcel, himself and two squirrels, at least he tells you his measurements in the end> ",
  ["L1c"] = "Yenny? I know no Yenny, nor have I ever used that name! You have mistook me with someone else.",
  ["L1d"] = "Have you managed to obtain a rare deer trophy for my customer?",
  ["L1e"] = "The only person who might have some cough syrup is this druid Ustan. You find him in the tavern. Hmmm the tavern ... <hicks>",
  ["L1f"] = "Sorry, you first need to bring my Heavy Old Tomes or do the quest before continuing.",
  ["L1g"] = "You head back south to the site with the onyx lookout.",
  ["L1h"] = "Pah! I said 200 gold. You don't have that much.",
  ["L1i"] = "Sorry but you don't have the item.",
  ["L1j"] = "No wonder that they always have been so well prepared. Now you come into play, destroy the scrying crystal ball in Elvenbane. It should be on the top floor. ...",
  ["L1k"] = "I'm tired of all these young unskilled wannabe heroes. Every Tibian can show his skills or actions by wearing a special outfit. To prove oneself worthy of the demon outfit, this is how it goes: ...",
  ["L1l"] = "Have you finished your mission?",
  ["L1m"] = "Oh yes, an interesting topic. We had vivid discussions about this discovery. But what is it that you want?",
  ["L1n"] = "Fine! There's one more skill that I need to test and which is cruicial for a successful trader. ...",
  ["L1o"] = "I expect you to fight your way through his minions and to show him that we are determined and powerful enough to retake the quarter, if necessary by force. Talk to himafter killing some of his henchmen. ...",
  ["L1p"] = "Don't waste my time.",
  ["L1q"] = "Good bye.",
  ["L1r"] = "The second addon is granted to someone who has voted for each bossfight at least once.",
  ["L1s"] = "Is it your true wish to sacrifice a dragon scale mail to Zathroth?",
  ["L1t"] = "Thank you for your offering. You may pass the Portal to the Powers of Earth now.",
  ["L1u"] = "Would you like to get a lottery ticket instead of the deposit for your vials?",
  ["L1v"] = "You do not have enough money to donate that amount.",
  ["L1w"] = "Right. Now, we need to waken the old powers through ritual. Let me know when you are ready for this {mission}.",
  ["L1x"] = "You do not have it!",
  ["L1y"] = "Needless to say, the Marid won't be too eager to part with it. Try not to get killed until you have delivered the stone to me.",
  ["L1z"] = "Zo are you ready to get zomezing done?",
  ["L2"] = "Where do you want to go? To {Carlin}, {Ab'Dendriel}, {Venore}, {Port Hope}, {Liberty Bay}, {Svargrond}, {Yalahar}, {Roshamuul}, {Oramond} or {Edron}?",
  ["L20"] = "Thais has become a melting pot of some source. Yet whatever you melt, if the ingredients are corrupted, the outcome is always flawed.",
  ["L21"] = "Go now to general Baa'leal and don't forget to greet him correctly! ...",
  ["L22"] = "Here it is.",
  ["L23"] = "Good, of course you will also receive an additional monetary reward for your troubles. Are you fine with that?",
  ["L24"] = "Superb! You won't regret this. I will reward you beyond your wildest dreams! ...",
  ["L25"] = "Sorry, you will have to wait before you can undertake this mission again.",
  ["L26"] = "Voilà, we're done! To be honest, I don't know what this drink does, but at least it makes me really happy. Drink together with a loved one and enjoy!",
  ["L27"] = "Well, there's one problem. How would I know I can trust you? You might be one of them... hm. Can you think of something really unlikely for a vampire? If you know a way to prove it to me, ask me about your {mission}.",
  ["L28"] = "What? So why in the world should I give you an invitation? It's not as if you were someone important, are you?",
  ["L29"] = "I still have a pretty gypsy dress and a pearl necklace somewhere, which you could wear instead of this ragged skirt. For the small fee of 20000 gold pieces, it'd be yours. ...",
  ["L2A"] = "You got the ring back? Very well done! Now search for the memories that will prove the Ambassador's treason. I don't know much about ancient artefacts but you could ask the librarian in the palace. I'm sure he knows something helpful.",
  ["L2B"] = "Ah, also a keen lover of arts I assume? You might have already caught a glimpse of that humble masterpiece over there in the corner - I sculpt sulky sculptures! ...",
  ["L2C"] = "Have you really brought me 50 holy orchids?",
  ["L2D"] = "Will you be our guardian?",
  ["L2E"] = "You do not have enough money.",
  ["L2F"] = "Oh my. Its not easy to impress a mermaid I guess. Please get me a {love poem}. I think elves are the greatest poets so their city seems like a good place to look for one.",
  ["L2G"] = "No, you don't have any...",
  ["L2H"] = "You already talked with me.",
  ["L2I"] = "Done.",
  ["L2J"] = "True dwarven pickaxes having to be maded by true weaponsmith! You wanting to get pickaxe for explorer society?",
  ["L2K"] = "I'm very pleased to hear that! Which do you prefer - paying 150000 at once or 10000 for 15 times?",
  ["L2L"] = "I provide two addons. For the first one I need you to bring me five sturdy books. For the second addon you need twenty epaulettes. Do you want one of these addons?",
  ["L2M"] = "Very nice, there you go! Just bring me the printout from the probe after deploying it! You can request a new probing {device} or a new {detector} if you lose it - but it takes some time for me to get a new one ready so be careful with that stuff.",
  ["L2N"] = "Too expensive?! You think me work is cheap? Well, if you want cheap, I can make cheap. Hrmpf. I make cheap sword for 300 gold. Ok?",
  ["L2O"] = "Books are a wonderful {invention}. If you are ever tired of your heroic exploits, take the time to read one.",
  ["L2P"] = "You need to defeat the second warzone boss to be able to get free access to the third warzone.",
  ["L2Q"] = "He has access to all kind of odd items, and he might have just the right bribe to convince someone to continue negotiations. ...",
  ["L2R"] = "Here you go.",
  ["L2S"] = "You will seek out this rebel commander in his hideout and kill him. We will show them that not even a Mooh'Tah master is needed to get rid of such wannabe leaders but that a mere human can handle them. ...",
  ["L2T"] = "Great! Simply bring me 100 iron ore and one royal steel and I will happily {forge} it for you.",
  ["L2U"] = "If you manage though to kill all the tentacles it is using within a few heartbeats, it will become confused by its momentary helplessness and will probably attack with its main body. ...",
  ["L2V"] = "You have no cookie that I'd like.",
  ["L2W"] = "Come back when you kill 500 blue djinns and Marid.",
  ["L2X"] = "Well then. Here, take the book, I added the story. Oh, just a piece of advice: Not to inflame prejudice but poachers are of rather simple disposition. I doubt they are ardent readers. ...",
  ["L2Y"] = "She tried to rescue the workers but it was too late. The orcs ... <m>",
  ["L2Z"] = "Ahhh, capital, capital. Good girl for keeping it for me. I'll take back my cape now, thank you. ...",
  ["L2a"] = "Nicely decorate it on a plate, and voilà, we're done already! Can't tell you much about the effects, but fishermen in Svargrond seem to love it. Enjoy!",
  ["L2b"] = "Great. Just place it over there - yes, thanks, that's it. Come see me another day, I'll be busy for a while now. ",
  ["L2c"] = "I doubt those poor fools will be able to control such entities. I can't figure out how they came up with such an insane idea, but they have to be stopped. ...",
  ["L2d"] = "All right. May Daraman bless your hunt, human.",
  ["L2e"] = "You don't have the fish.",
  ["L2f"] = "Great! After all this meat, we shouldn't neglect to prepare some fish. <carefully removes heads, tails and bones from the fishes and peels shrimps at incredible speed> ...",
  ["L2g"] = "Let me have a look! Yes, that's what we wanted. A copy of 'Songs of the Forest'. I won't ask any questions about those bloodstains.",
  ["L2h"] = "I am pleased to hear that. On the isle of Tyrsung foreign hunters have set up camp. They are hunting the animals there with no mercy. We will haveto find something that distracts them from hunting ...",
  ["L2i"] = "Here you are.",
  ["L2j"] = "Head zztraight to zze entranzze of zze zzity. If you can convinzze zze guardzz to let you enter zze zzity, you should be able to reach our contact zzere wizz eazze. ... ",
  ["L2k"] = "You're too valuable to us. Speaking about your value, I might have some other mission for you.",
  ["L2l"] = "You did some impressive things. I think people here start considering you as one of us. But these are dire times and everyone of us is expected to give his best and even exceed himself. Do you think you can handle that?",
  ["L2m"] = "YOU STUPID! STUBBORN! I KILL YOU! WILL LEAVE NOW?!",
  ["L2n"] = "Me know they hoard some in their underground lair. My people raided dworcs often before humans came. So we know the moss is hidden in east of upper level of dworc lair ...",
  ["L2o"] = "The mission should be simple to fulfil. For our excavations we have ordered a sturdy pickaxe in Kazordoon. You would have to seek out this trader Uzgod and get the pickaxe for us ...",
  ["L2p"] = "Okay, here we go, listen closely! I need a few things... a basic hat of course, maybe a legion helmet would do. Then about 100 chicken feathers... and 50 honeycombs as glue.That's it, come back to me once you gathered it!!",
  ["L2q"] = "It seems you have already cooked this dish this year. Please come back next year in August.",
  ["L2r"] = "Beneath one of the chests is a secret stash, under a loose stone tile. The scroll piece should be inside. Off you go.",
  ["L2s"] = "Ha! You are clever indeed, well done! I'll take this from you. Come see me tomorrow, I think we two might get into business after all.",
  ["L2t"] = "You want to sacrifice a cookie to the spirits?",
  ["L2u"] = "I have now no mission for you.",
  ["L2v"] = "For your noble deeds, we would like to invite you to a special celebration ceremony. ...",
  ["L2w"] = "As soon as we have gathered the strength, we should crush this city once and for all.",
  ["L2x"] = "<blushes> Oh, he is so wonderful. A very special man with a special place in my heart.",
  ["L2y"] = "I'm probably not that good anymore, but if you're interested and find me a red lantern, I could make one of those for you.",
  ["L2z"] = "So I ask you: do you wish to become a member of the ancient order of the Nightmare Knights, |PLAYERNAME|?",
  ["L3"] = "Where do you want to go? To {Carlin}, {Ab'Dendriel}, {Venore}, {Port Hope}, {Liberty Bay}, {Svargrond}, {Yalahar}, {Roshamuul}, {Oramond} or {Edron}?",
  ["L30"] = "Ahem. Just take a yellowed bone or big bone, and hallow it - you don't know how? ...",
  ["L31"] = "Zo are you ready to drink ziz poizon here?",
  ["L32"] = "Thanks, you successfully cast your vote. Feel free to continue gathering votes by helping the city! Farewell.",
  ["L33"] = "Well, you don't mind if I play around with this antidote rune a bit ... UHHH, YOU LOU ... uhm that was so ... funny, haha ... ha. Mhm, you better leave now.",
  ["L34"] = "Here is the final addon for your demon hunter outfit. Congratulations!",
  ["L35"] = "Ah yes, you read the signs in tomb? Good! May me look into your mind to see what you saw?",
  ["L36"] = "Listen, I don't get paid enough to chat with citizens. Move on.",
  ["L37"] = "Would you like to accept this mission?",
  ["L38"] = "We need someone to reduce the steadily growing number of demon skeletons in the caves. If you are interested, I can give you some more information about it. Are you willing to accept this mission?",
  ["L39"] = "You head back north to the plateau. ",
  ["L3A"] = "Here we go! <pounds with his bare hands on the steak> This will break through the meat fibres, making our steak more tender for this fine Daramanian dish. ...",
  ["L3B"] = "Come back when you gather all essences.",
  ["L3C"] = "Ah, you must be the hero Trisha talked about. I'll prepare the shoulder spikes for you. Please give me some time to finish.",
  ["L3D"] = "I can only hope that this information are as valuable as we expected it. A good man died for them.",
  ["L3E"] = "I'm very pleased to hear that! Which do you prefer - paying 150000 at once or 10000 for 15 times?",
  ["L3F"] = "No, no. That's not enough, I fear.",
  ["L3G"] = "Thank you for your offering. You may pass the Portal to the Powers of Holy now.",
  ["L3H"] = "Our sources have told us that those ships often end up in the hands of pirates or smugglers ...",
  ["L3I"] = "Did you gather all necessary ingredients to prepare a Hydra Tongue Salad with me?",
  ["L3J"] = "Excellent, now bring me 5 green perch.",
  ["L3K"] = "I have no work for you right now. If you like to, you can have a look at the last floor. I open the door for you.",
  ["L3L"] = "Sorry, you do have not have the required rank to undertake this mission.",
  ["L3M"] = "Find these vines in this mountain, climb up there and find out who is spying on us! If they mean harm, get rid of them if possible. ...",
  ["L3N"] = "Great, please go to my house, just a few steps south of here. Upstairs in my room, you'll find a chest. You can keep what you find inside of it! Come back after you got it and greet me to talk to me again. {Yes}?",
  ["L3O"] = "My collection of recipes is almost complete. There are only but a few that are missing. ...",
  ["L3P"] = "Obviously he wasn't pleased with this place, because he headed for Thais the next day. ...",
  ["L3Q"] = "Ye' don't have enought tokens.",
  ["L3R"] = "I told him about what I saw but he didn't believe me because he never saw anything like that in all the years before. But you believe me right? Go and convince yourself. ...",
  ["L3S"] = "Shush!! I don't want everybody to know what I am up to. Listen, things are not going too well, I need a new attraction. Do you want to help me?",
  ["L3T"] = "So, since we are done here... I need to prepare another ritual, so please let me work, child.",
  ["L3U"] = "Did you enter the Lost Mines yet? They are west of Edron, close to the sea. You will also need a pick once you get to the crystal deposit.",
  ["L3V"] = "In exchange for a truly generous donation, I will offer a special outfit. Do you want to make a donation?",
  ["L3W"] = "Marvellous! With this information combined we have all that's needed! ...",
  ["L3X"] = "You don't have enough money.",
  ["L3Y"] = "You are now one of us. Learn to endure this world's suffering in every facet and take delight in the soothing eternity that waits for the {purest} of us on the other side.",
  ["L3Z"] = "You have not found the hidden seal yet. Return when you are better prepared.",
  ["L3a"] = "Maybe you can provoke him with something to get angry, like saying... 'MINE!' or something. But beware, I'm sure that he will try to hit you. ...",
  ["L3b"] = "If another prince comes to kiss me, I'll kick his ass so bad that he'll need a sedan chair to get away.",
  ["L3c"] = "Well, the... what? You... mean you're no longer interested? I see, well maybe I overestimated your spirit after all.",
  ["L3d"] = "There the nightmare beast can be challenged and defeated.",
  ["L3e"] = "I. Greet. You. Ma-Ma-Ma-ster! Did. You. Bring. Mo-Mo-Mo-M*chhhhrrrk*ore. Samples. For. Me. To-To-To. Analyse-lyse-lyse?",
  ["L3f"] = "Travel to the Plains of Havoc and find the base of our competitors under the ruins of the dark cathedral ...",
  ["L3g"] = "A what? I don't even know what you're talking about, human. If you aren't just giving up - will you kindly change the topic please?",
  ["L3h"] = "Ok then.",
  ["L3i"] = "Well, I hope it stinks a lot. I like stinking cookies best ... BY MY THOUSAND SONS! YOU ARE SO DEAD HUMAN! DEAD!",
  ["L3j"] = "Haha, no! No. Why don't you just stop asking me that and start enjoying your stay here?",
  ["L3k"] = "You head north passing countless stones in the crimson sea of stones beneath your feet.",
  ["L3l"] = "Excellent. To bind the earthly powers, we, I mean you, must worship at the Fireglass Altar. ...",
  ["L3m"] = "A contact of zze rezzizztanzze izz located furzzer in zze norzz of Zao. ... ",
  ["L3n"] = "Not that I am bribeable but I doubt that you own 1000 gold pieces. Or do you?",
  ["L3o"] = "Destroyed you say? That's impossible! I'm not sure if I can trust you in this matter? One might assume, you fled from the ghosts in terror and left the charm there. ...",
  ["L3p"] = "What? My hat?? Theres... nothing special about it!",
  ["L3q"] = "I've marked itzz location on your map. Go and find out what happened zzere. In zze pazzt it wazz known azz zze Temple of Equilibrium. ",
  ["L3r"] = "It said it should be opened at a specific day 20 years ago to prevent this whole incident but I wasn't even at the Academy by that time. Someone just found the letter earlier today and brought it to my attention. ...",
  ["L3s"] = "Oh. Ok. Welcome then. You may pass. ...",
  ["L3t"] = "Instinctively you run to a larger emerald bluff near the raise to find cover. Mere seconds after you claimed the sturdy shelter, a deep dark humming starts to swirl through the air. ...",
  ["L3u"] = "You alread have that outfit.",
  ["L3v"] = "Well, to be honest it doesn't say much about humans in this book. However, it seems that the humans on this continent used to live in the steppe. ...",
  ["L3w"] = "Calassa is an underwater settlement, so you are in severe danger of drowning unless you are well-prepared. ...",
  ["L3x"] = "NAAAAARGH. If you promise to leave me alone and NOT TO TELL MY SECRET to anyone - you can have one. ...",
  ["L3y"] = "Follow the tunnel until you reach a small cave. Step down and down until you see a blue energy field. It will lead you to my egg. It is sealed so that not everyone may enter the room. But you have the permission now.",
  ["L3z"] = "In the name of the spirits I accept this offer ... UHNGH ... The spirits are not amused!",
  ["L4"] = "Where do you want to go? To {Carlin}, {Ab'Dendriel}, {Venore}, {Port Hope}, {Liberty Bay}, {Svargrond}, {Yalahar}, {Roshamuul}, {Oramond} or {Edron}?",
  ["L40"] = "I wonder if Ajax has an idea. Could you ask him about Gelagos?",
  ["L41"] = "What will it be?",
  ["L42"] = "I fear these notes will be used to turn the plague into some kind of weapon. Someone with this plague at his disposal could subdue the whole city by blackmailing. ...",
  ["L43"] = "It's a fearsome subterranean beast like nothing I've ever encountered. It is dangerous and almost unbeatable because its main body is hidden beneath the ground ...",
  ["L44"] = "You managed to deceive Erayo? Impressive. Well, I guess, since you have come that far, I might as well give you a task too, eh?",
  ["L45"] = "Welcome to the Jolly Axeman, |PLAYERNAME|. Have a good time and eat some food!",
  ["L46"] = "You don't have enough money.",
  ["L47"] = "Ok, ok. You've got this one right! Ready for the next one?",
  ["L48"] = "You aren't married to get a divorce.",
  ["L49"] = "It only blooms underground in a cavern to the northwest. I will need 15 units of pollen. Bring them to me and we shall conduct a seance.",
  ["L4A"] = "Instead of breeding warbeasts, this druid should breed cattle to feed our people. Please I beg you, convince him to do that!",
  ["L4B"] = "Pyrale? That idiot transformed me into an human once. But my wife came and kissed me, so I'm a frog again.",
  ["L4C"] = "Impressive!! Let me take a look.......Ahh, ",
  ["L4D"] = "Kill 300 members of the Fafnar cult, help me find Ivory Lyre and help me find an animal to stone.",
  ["L4E"] = "Well done! You have form 411!! Here is Form 145. Have fun with it.",
  ["L4F"] = "Done.",
  ["L4G"] = "Here is the list with the missing ingredients to complete the ritual.",
  ["L4H"] = "After that, um, let me think... I'd like to have some holy orchids. Or no, many holy orchids, to be safe. Like 35. ...",
  ["L4I"] = "With your eyes covered and avoiding direct sight of the rays, you put the mirror into the stand. ...",
  ["L4J"] = "The explorer society would like to acquire an ancient urn which is some sort of relic to the lizard people of Tiquanda. Would you like to accept this mission?",
  ["L4K"] = "Find out about his whereabouts and retrieve him or at least his posthorn. He was looking for a new underground passage that is rumoured to be found underneath the troll-infested Mountain east of Thais.",
  ["L4L"] = "Use the GREEN command crystal in the cave to begin the charging of the teleport! Good luck.",
  ["L4M"] = "Your actions will tell if you are only yelping for attention like a puppy or if you have the teeth of a wolf. ...",
  ["L4N"] = "Thank you!! Ah, this makes my day! I'll take the rest of the day off to get to know this little guy. Come see me tomorrow, if you like.",
  ["L4O"] = "Do you want to trade Boots of haste for Enchanted Chicken Wing?",
  ["L4P"] = "What will you choose?",
  ["L4Q"] = "Sorry, you do not have enough crystal coins.",
  ["L4R"] = "Me sad. Please reconsider.",
  ["L4S"] = "I can give you a new one, but I fear that I have to take a small fee for it. Would you like to buy a waterskin for 1000 gold?",
  ["L4T"] = "What are you looking at me for? Waiting for something? I told you that there was no reward. Despite being allowed to stand before me without being squashed like a bug. Get out of my sight!",
  ["L4U"] = "Oh, Gregor sent you? I see. It will be my pleasure to adorn your helmet. Please give me some time to finish it.",
  ["L4V"] = "Do you have the cookbook of the dwarven kitchen with you? Can I have it?",
  ["L4W"] = "Things are running fine so far. Actually so fine that we are short of supplies and men. I'd send a letter home but I guess sending you to get some assistance gives the whole affair a bit more urgency. ...",
  ["L4X"] = "Yes, that's me.",
  ["L4Y"] = "Did you manage to get the ancient urn?",
  ["L4Z"] = "We need weapons to overcome our situation.",
  ["L4a"] = "I may alzzo have anozzer mizzion for you if you are interezzted.",
  ["L4b"] = "Anyway, you succeeded in hallowing the Fireglass Altar! Only one altar remains to be hallowed! Shall we {proceed}?",
  ["L4c"] = "{Kilmaresh} and {Oramond} maintain important commercial relations, and for this reason Rathleton has an envoy here. In the past, the relations were good but now ..",
  ["L4d"] = "Once you did that go to the large high seat near the camp and watch for the travelling merchants. ...",
  ["L4e"] = "Ah, a good man and a competent aid.",
  ["L4f"] = "Then into the vampire crypts, deep down, you must go. ...",
  ["L4g"] = "Take this!",
  ["L4h"] = "Are you in need of another one? ",
  ["L4i"] = "However, it has to be assumed that in the end the sheer power of his creation scared Zathroth, who had to fear the weapon could one day be used against him. So he disassembled it. ...",
  ["L4j"] = "Do you want to try to release me with a kiss?",
  ["L4k"] = "Well, you could attempt the mission to become a recognised trader, but it requires a lot of travelling. Are you willing to try?",
  ["L4l"] = "If you like, you can also enter the room to the left and pick one item of your choice.",
  ["L4m"] = "The device needs a special crystal. It's called {mirror crystal}. The inventor somehow damaged it - with fatal results. He had to give up, as no second crystal was left to try. I, however, know of another one... but are you up to the task?",
  ["L4n"] = "Cheap but good quality? Impossible. Unless... you bring material. Three iron ores, 250 gold. Okay?",
  ["L4o"] = "With your help and efforts we finally cornered what we think is one of 'those below'! For all you have done and endured you are granted the privilege to be one of the first to fight the true enemy. ...",
  ["L4p"] = "Calling it a song or melody is the best I can do to describe it to those who don't share this kind of perception. ...",
  ["L4q"] = "Your next mission concerns an internal matter for our agency. Some decades ago, one of our most talented field agents vanished in the Green Claw Swamp ...",
  ["L4r"] = "Good... so after you broke a branch, please push it here and select 'use with'. That will turn your mouse cursor into crosshairs. Then left-click on my cart. {Alright}?",
  ["L4s"] = "You already have a horse.",
  ["L4t"] = "Zzen zzizz izz zze way which will lead you to zze great gate. ...",
  ["L4u"] = "On the next day, the guards brought me to emperor {Rehal}, and Rerun was there, too. He said I had stolen his ring. I'd never steal, you have to believe me.",
  ["L4v"] = "I am so glad you are still alive. Benjamin found the container with the bone sample inside. Fortunately, I inscribe everything with my name, so he knew it was mine. ...",
  ["L4w"] = "Could you help me do a ritual?",
  ["L4x"] = "Pah!! You have NO idea, leave me alone now.",
  ["L4y"] = "Excellent. This mission is easy but nonetheless vital. Travel to Ab'Dendriel and get the book.",
  ["L4z"] = "Do you want to purchase a weekly ticket for the ore wagons? With it you can travel freely and swiftly through Kazordoon for one week. 250 gold only. Deal?",
  ["L50"] = "Yes, take care, the gate is opening! Can you see a bright light?",
  ["L51"] = "Yes? Do you have the {scroll} piece? ",
  ["L52"] = "Talk research with spectulus to take some mission.",
  ["L53"] = "Do you want to purchase a weekly ticket for the ore wagons? With it you can travel freely and swiftly through Kazordoon for one week. 250 gold only. Deal?",
  ["L54"] = "Oh, sorry, I have to hurry, bye!",
  ["L55"] = "This... person... makes me want to... say something bad... must... control myself. <sweats> I really don't know what to do anymore. ...",
  ["L56"] = "Oh yes, that project the whole dwarven community is so excited about. I guess I already know why you are here, but speak up.",
  ["L57"] = "But zere iz more. To reach ze emperor, you will need accezz to hiz inner realmz. Ze zecret to enter iz guarded by a dragon. ...",
  ["L58"] = "Hahah, eager for it, I like that! ...",
  ["L59"] = "Let's try that stuff first - ARRRRRRHH! <coughs> That must have been the worst cookie I've ever eaten. Get off my ship.",
  ["L5A"] = "Well, nothing wrong about exploring the town on your own. Let me know if you need something!",
  ["L5B"] = "Ah well, I think you passed the test! Here is your disguise kit! Now get lost, fate awaits me!",
  ["L5C"] = "Have you found 20 pieces of red cloth?",
  ["L5D"] = "We've already talked about that.",
  ["L5E"] = "Have you defeated the nightmare monsters?",
  ["L5F"] = "If you join the bonus system now, I will ask you each time you are bringing back 100 or more vials to me whether you claim your deposit or rather want a lottery ticket. ...",
  ["L5G"] = "I thought you have been haunted and killed by the undead. I'm glad that this is not the case. Thank you for your help.",
  ["L5H"] = "It zzoakzz zze land, itzz people and even zze air itzzelf. But zzere are zztill zzpotzz not tainted by zze darknezz. ... ",
  ["L5I"] = "You do not have enough money to donate that amount.",
  ["L5J"] = "Do Krunus dance for us! Step and dance and turn around! You will know when you do good. Make {Krunus} happy and support our great hunt!",
  ["L5K"] = "I need you to sabotage the most dangerous of those catapults which can be found right in their harbour, aiming at ships passing by the entrance. ...",
  ["L5L"] = "The society offers a substantial reward for the retrieval of Ratha or his remains. Do you have any news about Ratha?",
  ["L5M"] = "It was very decent of you to help me, and I am thankful, really I am, but now I have to get back to my duties as a foreman.",
  ["L5N"] = "Great! You see, I really would love to sew a nice shirt for him. I just need a few things for that, so please listen closely: ...",
  ["L5O"] = "So you found out that one artefact in the MoTA is fake? And {Gareth} sent you to me to get a new artefact as a replacement? Sorry, I hardly know you so I don't trust you. I won't help you with that!",
  ["L5P"] = "Do you want to go back to {Yalahar}?",
  ["L5Q"] = "Would you like me to mark locations like - for example - the depot, bank and shops on your map?",
  ["L5R"] = "With your help, his defeat will not only be deadly but also humiliating and so discourage others to follow his example. ...",
  ["L5S"] = "Great! I've signed you up for our bonus system. From now on, you will have the chance to win the potion belt addon!",
  ["L5T"] = "It is said that the orcish shamans cursed the Red Legion. <m>",
  ["L5U"] = "The helmet is for those who have hunted down all 6666 demons and finished the demon oak as well, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["L5V"] = "Interesting. The fact that you have the ring means that Nokmir can't have stolen it. Combined with the information Grombur gave you, the case appears in a completely different light. ...",
  ["L5W"] = "They insist that most resources belong to the crown. This is quite sad, especially ivory is in high demand. Collect 10 elephant tusks and bring them to me.",
  ["L5X"] = "How many platinum coins would you like to get?",
  ["L5Y"] = "Now this compass is ready for usage. It can transfer the bound energy to other inanimate objects to open certain gates or chests.",
  ["L5Z"] = "So be it! Here is my part of the sceptre. Combine it with the other parts on the altar of the Great Snake in the depths of this temple.",
  ["L5a"] = "So you would like to donate 250.000.000 gold pieces which in return will entitle you to wear unique helmet?",
  ["L5b"] = "Good hunt. That will be enough to help us uhm... get through the winter yes. Now if you want to help us getting even more lucky charms, you can always ask.",
  ["L5c"] = "Here you are |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["L5d"] = "I hate to admit it but I heavily suspect that the current {Ambassador} is a traitor and consorts with the forbidden cult of {Fafnar}. I have several hints and {Kallimae} saw it in one of her visions. ...",
  ["L5e"] = "Maybe next time.",
  ["L5f"] = "Take this bone flute and play it in front of the five Dark Shrines so that they answer with song in return. You will find them in the Gardens of Night. ...",
  ["L5g"] = "Oh my. Have you gotten an exquisite cigar for me, my young friend?",
  ["L5h"] = "Maybe another time.",
  ["L5i"] = "The missions available for your rank are the {butterfly hunt}, {plant collection} and {ice delivery}.",
  ["L5j"] = "The mission should be simple to fulfil. For our excavations we have ordered a sturdy pickaxe in Kazordoon. You would have to seek out this trader Uzgod and get the pickaxe for us ...",
  ["L5k"] = "Excellent, that should be enough fish to make the bait. Tell me when ya're ready fo' the {hunt}.",
  ["L5l"] = "You thought you could choose sides? Think again! I nearly led you into the destruction of two species! ME, THE NAVIGATOR! I CONTROL YOU, I OWN YOU! QJELL AFAR GOU JEY!",
  ["L5m"] = "<mumblemumble> Sha Kesh Mar!",
  ["L5n"] = "I need a {medicine pouch}, to give you the {belongings of deceased}. Come back when you have them.",
  ["L5o"] = "I must warn you, the quarters are in a horrible state. I strongly advise you to stay on the main roads whenever possible while you get those reports. ...",
  ["L5p"] = "You might find several hints there, but I am sure you will know exactly when you have found what we are looking for.",
  ["L5q"] = "Good! As you can imagine, I had a scroll piece, too. I hid it in my old quarters, northwest of the library. ...",
  ["L5r"] = "Once you gathered some rabbit feet, put one of our - handcrafted by the guys - ribbons on each of them. That will make two lucky charms per rabbit. ...",
  ["L5s"] = "What newzz do you bring? Did you find any cluezz about zzeir whereaboutzz? ",
  ["L5t"] = "Then off you go! I'm sorry that I cannot offer you any further help but I'm sure you will find support along your way. And - be careful. The sea can appear pitch black down there.",
  ["L5u"] = "I've learnt more about the {lizard} culture. It's really fascinating.",
  ["L5v"] = "You can't tell by a person's appearance who is a pickpocket and who isn't. You simply can't close the city gates for everyone.",
  ["L5w"] = "There you should find lots of their war wolves and hopefully also some of the orcish powder. Good luck!",
  ["L5x"] = "So Waldo is dead? This is grave news indeed. Did you recover his posthorn?",
  ["L5y"] = "I had vizzionzz of an - item. Yezz. It may be uzzeful for uzz - I mean you, ezzpecially you. ... ",
  ["L5z"] = "So return to the upper tunnels where cultists and ice golems dwell. Somewhere in these tunnels you will find a small prison haunted by a ghost. South of this prison cell there is a tunnel that will lead you eastwards. ...",
  ["L6"] = "Where do you want to go? To {Carlin}, {Ab'Dendriel}, {Venore}, {Port Hope}, {Liberty Bay}, {Svargrond}, {Yalahar}, {Roshamuul}, {Oramond} or {Edron}?",
  ["L60"] = "Finally someone notices I'm a FROG. Congratulations, you're VERY observant... *sigh*",
  ["L61"] = "So listen please: Take this ice pick and use it on a block of ice in the caves beneath Folda. Get some ice and bring it here as fast as you can ...",
  ["L62"] = "You have no cookie that I'd like.",
  ["L63"] = "IIIEEEEEK!",
  ["L64"] = "The great hunt! About to begin, but gods are not in favour of us yet. We need all help we get. We please Krunus with special nature dance. ...",
  ["L65"] = "Congratulations! Here is your brand-new accessory, I hope you like it. Please visit us again!",
  ["L66"] = "You don't have the demonic essences, back here when you get it.",
  ["L67"] = "Really? You look fine to me, must have been just a scratch. Well, there are much more dangerous monsters than cockroaches out there. Take a look at your status bar. You have 155 Health right now. I'll show you something, {yes}?",
  ["L68"] = "Sorry, but you don't have enough hunting task points.",
  ["L69"] = "Unfortunately, much of my understanding is instinctive, and our language just doesn't contain the right words for me to express the things I feel adequately.",
  ["L6A"] = "Are you trying to mess with me?!",
  ["L6B"] = "Ah well. Doesn't matter.",
  ["L6C"] = "Fine. Then get a hold of that deer trophy and bring it to me while I'm in Svargrond. Just ask me about your mission.",
  ["L6D"] = "I think I need to talk to Gabel about this. I am sure he will know what to do. Perhaps you should have a word with him, too.",
  ["L6E"] = "And this is where you come in. There are two extremely rare species I need samples from. Typically not easy to come by but it should not be necessary to venture too far into Zao to find them. ...",
  ["L6F"] = "{B}) throw the gnome as safely as you can to ensure his safety. {C}) Sabotage the throwing gnomes of your competitors. {D}) Never participate in such an abominable competition.",
  ["L6G"] = "Kisavuta! <giggles>",
  ["L6H"] = "Good, now all you need to do is find a ghost, defeat it and catch its very essence with the cage. Once you have it, return to me and Spectulus and I will move it into our chamber device. Good luck, return to me as soon as you are prepared.",
  ["L6I"] = "Now we will have power we truly deserve!...",
  ["L6J"] = "I guess claiming back a present would be a bit suspicious. You'll have to find another way. I resent thinking about theft but sometimes, desperate times call for desperate measures.",
  ["L6K"] = "You will have to leave the plant through the eastern door on the lowest level. I have arranged for it to be 'accidentally' open. ...",
  ["L6L"] = "That's very kind of you, my friend! Listen: I know there is a spell to transform her fishtail into legs. It is a temporary effect, so she could return to the ocean as soon as the spell ends. Unfortunately I don't know how to cast this spell. ...",
  ["L6M"] = "To hallow it, dig out three dragon tears and place them on the altar to appease the dark powers. ...",
  ["L6N"] = "In case of emergency {A}) break glass {B}) break a leg {C}) have a break {D}) call a gnome?",
  ["L6O"] = "Even though they claim differently, this city is in the firm grip of Zathroth and his evil minions. Their whole twisted religion is a mockery of the teachings of our gods ...",
  ["L6P"] = "You adventurers become more and more of a pest.",
  ["L6Q"] = "Remember: If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can heal you for free.",
  ["L6R"] = "As soon as you got both things, travel to Venore and find the merchant Nurik. Trade the false documents for the famous painting of Mina Losa and bring it to me.",
  ["L6S"] = "I guess I will stick around for a time to watch over the grave. After this final watch I will find peace, I can feel this. Thank you, human being. You redeemed me.",
  ["L6T"] = "Me thank you much! All wisdom safe again now.",
  ["L6U"] = "Find that pit, dig for a well-preserved human skeleton and conserve a sample in a special container which you receive from me. Are you going to help me?",
  ["L6V"] = "Yes, you heard that right! Even though I was laying sick on my divan for weeks, I have some new dishes for you. Ehem. Of course I couldn't have done it without my little helpers travelling around the world and discovering recipes. ...",
  ["L6W"] = "I understand your scepticism, but believe me, all will be well! As you can see, they change colour from dark to light red, and that's when they also start turning soft. <stirs with one hand while he slices carrots and peppers with the other hand> ...",
  ["L6X"] = "Take the fruits out of the spicy coconut milk and heat them on an oven. Once the chicken is fried, add the fruits and spray some squeezed lemon over it. ...",
  ["L6Y"] = "Why, certainly! I'm always up for some small talk. ...",
  ["L6Z"] = "Hello there recruit!",
  ["L6a"] = "Thank you! They look so pretty, I'm very pleased. Agreed, now I will steal the ring from the Ambassador of Rathleton. Just be patient, I have to wait for a good moment.",
  ["L6b"] = "Then no.",
  ["L6c"] = "We would need help and additional resources. That's were you come into play. If you are interested, let's talk about possible missions.",
  ["L6d"] = "I am a little sad, that you seem to have forgotten me, handsome. I am Aruda.",
  ["L6e"] = "Okay, then please find Miraia in Darashia and ask her about the {'scarab cheese'}.",
  ["L6f"] = "Alright. Well, az you might not be aware of it yet - we are on top of an old temple complex. It haz been abandoned and it haz crumbled over time. ...",
  ["L6g"] = "If you are interested go to Alesar and ask him about it.",
  ["L6h"] = "Unlike serpent spawns, the Draken hatched from some of the eggs in the hatcheries. ...",
  ["L6i"] = "You don't have my heart.",
  ["L6j"] = "Hm ... good bye.",
  ["L6k"] = "I azzume you are already geared up and ready to conquer zze norzz? ",
  ["L6l"] = "I was even more worried when he explained the route he chose. he wanted to head straight through a giant steppe and through a massive mountainous ridge to reach the grassy plains of lower Zao. ...",
  ["L6m"] = "Great! Let's get it done! <mixes and shakes faster than any human could> An easy one again, but you'll get right into holiday mood, like the Meriana beach dwellers I got that recipe from. ...",
  ["L6n"] = "To gather the sacred ashes, you have to use magic chalk with the Shadow Fire in the Ember Chamber. ...",
  ["L6o"] = "The greatest necromant who ever cursed our land with the steps of his feet. He was defeated by the nightmare knights.",
  ["L6p"] = "Bring me the following ingredients and I'll show you how it's done: Ten jalapeño peppers, two pieces of cheese, one troll green, one shadow herb, one vial of mead and two eggs.",
  ["L6q"] = "This vase it not meant to be touched by human hands, so just keep your hands off it. Are you ready to buy that vase for 1000 gold?",
  ["L6r"] = "If you'd just take this very tiny probing device I designed to analyse the {coloured glooth} and, you know, go down there and place it - oh, and I'll also give you this really tiny {detector}, modified to find a spot where to place the {probe} - so?",
  ["L6s"] = "This preparation kit will allow you to collect a red butterfly you have killed ...",
  ["L6t"] = "With some luck you will arrive before the ritual's completion. But be warned. At least four risen lich-knights will be present, to raise 'their king'. ...",
  ["L6u"] = "You are starting this discussion again? Why should I listen to you this time, do you have anything to convince me to let you even try?",
  ["L6v"] = "Have you finished your mission?",
  ["L6w"] = "Now we're breaking all of the eggs into there - 1, 2, 10, 20, 40 <ticktickcrack> crumble the honeycombs and toss the sliced mangoes into the hot mix. ...",
  ["L6x"] = "So be it! Hmmmmmm...",
  ["L6y"] = "Then try to be better prepared next time we meet.",
  ["L6z"] = "Come back when you do.",
  ["L7"] = "I'm sorry, but we don't serve the routes to the Ice Islands.",
  ["L70"] = "Impressive indeed! Someone with your skills will quickly raise in our ranks of helpers. You have great potential, and if you are upfor further missions, just ask for them. ",
  ["L71"] = "Did you acquire some of the orcish powder?",
  ["L72"] = "Do you have news to make old Uncle happy?",
  ["L73"] = "I quickly dug a tunnel to get into what I assume is a throne room and waited for them to pick me up an carry me around! ...",
  ["L74"] = "I grant you three chests - filled to the lid with platinum coins, a house in the city in which you may reside, a set of the finest armor Zao has to offer, and a casket of never-ending mana. ...",
  ["L75"] = "Hah, developed a taste for it, have you? I believe the next scroll piece was hidden somewhere, my old friend being of a somewhat distrustful nature. ...",
  ["L76"] = "But first things first. Are you ready to {undertake} the hallowing of the five altars?",
  ["L77"] = "Don't forget that you'll need very potent holy water for your task. If you need some, just ask me for a {trade}.",
  ["L78"] = "Restore their connection and open this nexus to access the buried cathedral and find the cause to this... eliminate all remainders there if you must, ",
  ["L79"] = "Try to sneak in undetectedly and bring back our treasure as soon as you obtain it. May Daraman hold his protective hand over you on your mission. I wish you good luck. ...",
  ["L7A"] = "I'm not sure if I'm in the mood to talk about that matter again. Or do you have anything that might change my mind?",
  ["L7B"] = "Very good! You gained the first addon to the festive outfit.",
  ["L7C"] = "Receive the helmet, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["L7D"] = "Welcome, young |PLAYERNAME|! If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can {heal} you for free.",
  ["L7E"] = "If I understood that correctly, the gnomes 'grew' a device to completely neutralise diremaw corpses. Acting as a very effective counter measure. ... ",
  ["L7F"] = "I can't explain that stuff, even the gnomes don't know what grows in those caves. All we know is that this stuff brought about all the diremaws we are now facing. ...",
  ["L7G"] = "Which one would you like to trade: the deathstrike's {snippet}, gnomevil's {hat} or the abyssador {lash}?",
  ["L7H"] = "Tell him Hairycles you sent and he will grant you entrance. ...",
  ["L7I"] = "Fine.",
  ["L7J"] = "Ah well, let's forget about the scientific details - you will do just fine as long as you do exactly what I say. Ready for me to go on with your task?",
  ["L7K"] = "I wonder if you are able to deliver goods so fragile they almost break when looked at. ...",
  ["L7L"] = "Ah, the Lady of Darkstone. You have done well to remember her name. ...",
  ["L7M"] = "I would like to visit the beach more often, but I guess it's too dangerous.",
  ["L7N"] = "You need to donate the {shield} addon first.",
  ["L7O"] = "Have you brought me a gold fish??",
  ["L7P"] = "Alright, the device is holding it. The magical barrier should be able to contain nearly 20 times the current load. That's a complete success! Spectulus, are you seeing this? We did it! ...",
  ["L7Q"] = "... was made to remind us of their great tactics against the orcs ... <m>",
  ["L7R"] = "You dont have the required items!",
  ["L7S"] = "To enter the realm of the sanguine master and destroy its spawn, a sufficient sacrifice is imperative. ...",
  ["L7T"] = "Your next mission is somewhat bigger and I'm sure much fun for you. Some new-rich merchant is being a bit more greedy than it's good for him. ...",
  ["L7U"] = "Great! Finally, some light at the end of the tunnel! Come back and ask me for the quest when you solved this mystery!",
  ["L7V"] = "Oh yes, so since I wanted to study the Draken up close, I came up with an idea. Based on my research, and some slight bruises and a scar, the perfect hiding place is often right in the middle of subjects. ...",
  ["L7W"] = "I'm sorry, human. But you need Gabel's permission to trade with me.",
  ["L7X"] = "|PLAYERNAME|, that almost sounded like the word of greeting. Humans - cute they are!",
  ["L7Y"] = "In the parts of the original text that I was able to reconstruct with the help of some alchemy, there were some references to lizard spawns that were sighted in the Tiquanda area and linked to the snake god. ...",
  ["L7Z"] = "Well ... I have met him for a little while .. but this was nothing serious.",
  ["L7a"] = "So let's proceed. Take this vial of paint. Travel to Tyrsung again and ruin as many pelts of baby seals as possible before the paint runs dry or freezes. Then return here to report about your mission. ",
  ["L7b"] = "You take an emerald from the pile. ",
  ["L7c"] = "Have you finished your mission?",
  ["L7d"] = "No no no! That is not correct!",
  ["L7e"] = "I've learnt something interesting about {dragons} and their symbolism.",
  ["L7f"] = "... and form little balls together with the sweets! <shapes candy balls about the size of rice balls faster and more perfectly than any mortal ever could> ...",
  ["L7g"] = "So have you won us a new ally? Excellent. I knew you would not dare to ruin this mission. Soon we might be able to strengthen our defences and even relocate some of our guards. ...",
  ["L7h"] = "I took a closer look and found my family casket ripped open. It contained a precious necklace. If I had it back, I could sell it and start over! ...",
  ["L7i"] = "Dizabling ze cryztalz will probably alert ze emperor. It will likely be too late for him to intervene in perzon but a creature of hiz power might have ozer wayz to intervene. ...",
  ["L7j"] = "Me zzimple ferryman. I arrange {trip} to Zzao.",
  ["L7k"] = "You do not have that money.",
  ["L7l"] = "WHAT?? No way, I ask you again - you DID tell me the TRUTH here... right?",
  ["L7m"] = "If you find something interesting, come back to talk about the {abandoned sewers}.",
  ["L7n"] = "In case you find a door, Ill tell you the old trick of the Carlin mining company to open it <whisper> <whisper>. Find some hint or someone who is willing to talk about what is going on there.",
  ["L7o"] = "Your determination izz highly appreciated. To zzneak pazzt zze eyezz of zze enemy, you will have to uzze a diverzzion. Zzere are zzeveral old tunnelzz beneazz zze zzoil of Zzao. ... ",
  ["L7p"] = "You see, I'm quite hungry from standing here all day. Could you get me some {food}?",
  ["L7q"] = "Welcome, |PLAYERNAME|! Lovely steamboat, ain't it? I can even offer you a {passage} if you like.",
  ["L7r"] = "Did you acquire the sample of the witches cauldron we are looking for?",
  ["L7s"] = "Sadly I have no ship that lacks a captain, else you would of course be our first choice. I am still true to my word asbest as I am able. ...",
  ["L7t"] = "Are you up to that challenge?",
  ["L7u"] = "Sorry, but I can't see a legion helmet.",
  ["L7v"] = "It seems you have already cooked this dish this year. Please come back next year in August.",
  ["L7w"] = "I'm sorry, you don't have enough pelvis bones. Return if you can offer fifty of them.",
  ["L7x"] = "If you have done that, you may have the scroll piece. Now go.",
  ["L7y"] = "Once again you've finished your job, and I'll keep my promise. From now on, you can trade with old Black Bert somewhere upstairs to get access to certain items that mightbe of value to someone like you. ...",
  ["L7z"] = "First you need to buy the base addon to unlock this addon.",
  ["L8"] = "I'm sorry, but we don't serve the routes to the Ice Islands.",
  ["L80"] = "If you want to learn more about these gemstones don't forget to visit our library. ...",
  ["L81"] = "Yum! Just the thought of it makes me drool. <tosses the shrimps into a bowl and soaks them in coconut milk as he goes on chopping all mushrooms in the blink of an eye> ...",
  ["L82"] = "Blending the rays, the mirror directs pure white light directly towards the part where you assume the face of the creature. ...",
  ["L83"] = "Then go to the holy altar and create a new one.",
  ["L84"] = "Incidentally, I have talked to Fa'hradin about you during dinner. I think he might have some work for you. Why don't you talk to him about it?",
  ["L85"] = "|PLAYERNAME|, good day .. or night, whatever.",
  ["L86"] = "You want trip to Izzle of Zztrife?",
  ["L87"] = "Well then, the next task is to anoint the Bloodgong Altar. This will animate the dark flows we need for the ritual. ...",
  ["L88"] = "How many crystal coins would you like to get?",
  ["L89"] = "No then.",
  ["L8A"] = "That's bad news. If you lost it, only way to get other is to kill holy serpents. But you can't go there so you must ask adventurers who can.",
  ["L8B"] = "You don't have enough money.",
  ["L8C"] = "Take this!",
  ["L8D"] = "Cling clang!",
  ["L8E"] = "Wow. These polite young adventurers nowadays. Thank you.",
  ["L8F"] = "In a first step, it will involve retrieving specific artefacts of dark magic and hallowing the altars of the dark powers with them. ...",
  ["L8G"] = "Well, that's good to hear. From you as my trader and deliveryman, I expect more than carrying heavy packages. ...",
  ["L8H"] = "I'll immediately send some of our most dedicated explorers to check those things out!",
  ["L8I"] = "And as if this wasn't enough they stole an ancient and precious artefact, the moon mirror. Please seek out the tainted fae, retrieve the artefact and free the captured fairies. ...",
  ["L8J"] = "If eaten it allows an air breathing creature to breathe underwater for a while. Please find this plant for me. But know that you'll only find it at night. It resembles a common fern but its leaves are of a lighter green.",
  ["L8K"] = "You need 20 of them.",
  ["L8L"] = "Listen, we have information about a heretic coven that hides in a mountain called the Big Old One. The witches reach this cursed place on flying brooms and think they are safe there. ...",
  ["L8M"] = "Thought so. Well, no reason to be ashamed. I'll have to find help elsewhere now, though.",
  ["L8N"] = "There are theories that the caves are some kind of burrow of some extinct creature or even creatures that are still around us, but exist as some form of invisible energy; but those theories are far-fetched and not supported by any discoveries. ...",
  ["L8O"] = "The battles continued until someone or something literally ploughed through the battlefields, turning everything upside down. All this killing and death soaked the area with negative energy. ...",
  ["L8P"] = "Could you help me do a ritual?",
  ["L8Q"] = "You don't have enough money.",
  ["L8R"] = "Well, the situation is this: We have explored a portal, I would say a very aggressive, capriciously and dangerous one. Through this gate monsters entered the construction site and attacked our workers. ...",
  ["L8S"] = "Good, good. So eventually I found a way and invented a magic device I called the Lightboat. It was a large construction you could sit in and... well, judging by your looks you don't believe a word. Do you want to hear the story or not?",
  ["L8T"] = "I have more urgent problem to attend then that. Those hawks are hunting my carrier pigeons. Bring me 12 arrows and I'll see if I have the time for this nonsense. Do you have 12 arrows with you? ",
  ["L8U"] = "There is a fairy who once told me about this spell. Perhaps she will share her knowledge. You can find her in a small fairy village in the southwest of Feyrist.",
  ["L8V"] = "I have massive problems with the goblin tribe that lives here. You look strong enough to face their leader but you need to be smart to lure him out. ...",
  ["L8W"] = "Let me cover my nose before I get this for you... Would you REALLY like to buy scarab cheese for 100 gold?",
  ["L8X"] = "After you told me about the direction, put a bait on the crane again and go up to the lookout! That would be all sailor, let's go hunt down the sea serpent!!",
  ["L8Y"] = "Our warriors need a more potent yet more secure berserker elixir to fight our enemies. To brew it, I need several ingredients. The first things needed are 5 bat wings. Bring them to me and Ill tell you the next ingredients we need.",
  ["L8Z"] = "Sorry, you do not have enough gold coins.",
  ["L8a"] = "A shaft, a cuzzp, and an emerald form a zzeptre of zzuch power zzat zze partzz were hidden and are now guarded by vile creaturezz. ... ",
  ["L8b"] = "But when we finally found it after years of toiling and danger, we quarreled over who could have it. The scroll tore. ...",
  ["L8c"] = "You are not worthy to be transported there yet.",
  ["L8d"] = "Please ask about the 'outfit' first.",
  ["L8e"] = "The improbable lifespan of 'Zao' can thus be explained with the time the Zao dynasty reigned. On the other hand, we all know larger-than-life heroes did exist and some of them had an extremely long lifespan. ...",
  ["L8f"] = "The bargain has been made, the business is done.",
  ["L8g"] = "Good. I accept your sacrifice. The second sacrifice I require from you is a dragon scale mail. Bring it to me and do give it happily.",
  ["L8h"] = "You did it! Zere waz zome kind of zparkle and I zink it iz working again - oh pleaze feel free to try it, I uhm, I will wait here and be ready juzt in caze zomezing uhm happenz to you. ... ",
  ["L8i"] = "Thanks so much! I'll be waiting eagerly for your return then.",
  ["L8j"] = "I knew this question was too easy. But let us continue with the {test}.",
  ["L8k"] = "Here is the list of ingredients that are missing to complete the ritual. ",
  ["L8l"] = "Long journey it will take, good luck to you.",
  ["L8m"] = "Which mission do you want to report: crystal {keeper}, {spark} hunting, monster {extermination} or mushroom {digging}?",
  ["L8n"] = "Since my valued and practical oriented colleague and mentor Spectulus did not join us, there is only one member of the academy exploration division to actually venture out to see the place - me. ...",
  ["L8o"] = "The foundations of this {temple} are testament to their genius and advanced understanding of complex problems. They were master craftsmen and excelled in magic.",
  ["L8p"] = "This is why we have established our brand-new instalment sale. You can choose to either pay the price at once, or if you want to be safe, by instalments of 10000 gold pieces. ...",
  ["L8q"] = "Astonishingly, Dedoras from Cormaya has recently asked me for these kinds of inscriptions. For sure he is able to bring light into the darkness. You should visit him. ",
  ["L8r"] = "You do not have enough level yet.",
  ["L8s"] = "Unfortunately, the high temperature in the desert makes it rot really fast, so it must not stay in the sun for too long. ...",
  ["L8t"] = "Do you have the green dragon scale I requested?",
  ["L8u"] = "I already crafted one sun catcher for you.",
  ["L8v"] = "So are you ready for another mission?",
  ["L8w"] = "Unless you feel that you hugged the bear, the test is not passed. Once you are done, talk to me about the bear hugging.",
  ["L8x"] = "Concentrate! ...",
  ["L8y"] = "I think you're really capable and if you finish another mission, I'll allow you full access to our black market of lost and found items. Just ask me to learn more about that mission.",
  ["L8z"] = "Yeeeees... you need to help meeeeeee. I want those ghosts gone... this is my home and I need it to teach my students. Will you take care of the... ghosts?",
  ["L9"] = "I'm sorry, but we don't serve the routes to the Ice Islands.",
  ["L90"] = "So you wold like to donate 500.000.000 gold pieces which in return will entitle you to wear a unique armor?",
  ["L91"] = "Some annoying nightmarish creatures rove about in the tunnels underneath this island. They are threatening the members of my court and devastate the flora and fauna. They also threaten the natural balance. Would you go and fight them for me?",
  ["L92"] = "I guess this is the first time I entrust a human with a mission. And such an important mission, too. But well, we live in hard times, and I am a bit short of adequate staff. ...",
  ["L93"] = "Getting cold feet, eh?",
  ["L94"] = "Would ye' like to give me vampire tokens?",
  ["L95"] = "Did you manage to find Small Tortoise?",
  ["L96"] = "The research on ectoplasm makes good progress. Now we need some spectral article. Our scientists think a spectral dress would be a perfect object for their studies ...",
  ["L97"] = "I'll immediately send some of our most dedicated explorers to check those things out!",
  ["L98"] = "Seconds pass as the hum gets louder. The noise is maddening, drowning all other sounds around you. As you cover your ears in pain, the humming explodes into a deafening growl. ...",
  ["L99"] = "His grave is somewhere to the south, somewhere deeper. And he only reacts to magic words. ...",
  ["L9A"] = "We could indeed need some help. These are very cold times. The ice is growing and becoming thicker everywhere ...",
  ["L9B"] = "You should ask about that in one of the temples.",
  ["L9C"] = "Most of them were killed and captured, but a few of them were able to flee the continent. They found other minotaurs, mighty Mooh'Tah masters, and told them their story. ...",
  ["L9D"] = "Your mission would be to seek out gardener mushrooms in the caves and use some fertiliser on them. If you are interested, I can give you some more information about it. Are you willing to accept this mission?",
  ["L9E"] = "Lil' one bring three bast skirts.",
  ["L9F"] = "Firy steel it is. Need green ones' breath to melt. Or red even better. Me can make from shield. Lil' one want to trade?",
  ["L9G"] = "This preparation kit will allow you to collect a blue butterfly you have killed ...",
  ["L9H"] = "Thank you! I would do it myself, but I don't have a weapon. Just kill a few rabbits or deer, loot food from them and bring me one piece of {meat} or ham, will you?",
  ["L9I"] = "Ah hello, young friend! Did you bring me two ghoul snacks as requested?",
  ["L9J"] = "...but we are always looking for support in our fight against the evil Efreets. Tell me if you would like to join our fight.",
  ["L9K"] = "While reading this tome, I discovered a drawing of this beautiful statue. I was a skilled sculptor in the past, so I can't resist. ...",
  ["L9L"] = "You travel east across several large emerald bluffs and edges. All sorts of gems are scattered alongside your path. ",
  ["L9M"] = "Add garlic and mushrooms and fry gently until the mushrooms have shrunk up. Now, we add the peeled tomatoes and corn and have it all nicely cook together. ...",
  ["L9N"] = "Oh hello. I hardly noticed you. I'm afraid I am a bit distracted at the moment.",
  ["L9O"] = "You don't have my heart.",
  ["L9P"] = "Gnomo arigato |PLAYERNAME|! You did well. That will help us a lot. Take your tokens and this gnomish supply package as a reward. ",
  ["L9Q"] = "They seem to have supplied him with resources and workforce and a powerful {guardian} to prevent anyone from entering the passages to his lair.",
  ["L9R"] = "While it's buried, it only uses his tentacles to attack. If one is destroyed it will simply use another set of tentacles and its supply seems endless. ...",
  ["L9S"] = "Oh, you're back already? Did you bring a legion helmet, 100 chicken feathers and 50 honeycombs?",
  ["L9T"] = "You have no cookie that I'd like.",
  ["L9U"] = "Wizz zzeir eyezz towardzz zze gate, your chanzzezz to zzlip zzrough have never been better. I will keep zze zzpare materialzz here wizz me, we can alwayzz build a new one if you need to. ",
  ["L9V"] = "We would like to study some ancient runes that were used by the lizard race. We suspect some relation of the lizards to the founders of Ankrahmun ...",
  ["L9W"] = "He'll bring you to your destination. At their meeting place, you'll find a cauldron in which they cook some forbidden brew ...",
  ["L9X"] = "The. {Slime}. Has. Entered. Our. {Master}. Has. Left! We. Must. {Help}.",
  ["L9Y"] = "It's always the same, the {fungus} grows, I am EXCITED and... well... WHAAAAAM! It just EXPLODES! It spreads, covers everything.",
  ["L9Z"] = "Oh, so you brought some gold from Eleonore to me?",
  ["L9a"] = "Incredible! You got a hair of holy Bong! This will raise the spirit of my people. You are truly a friend. But one last mission awaits you.",
  ["L9b"] = "Thank you! I really needed them for my anti-wrinkle lotion. Now, please bring me 20 pieces of red cloth.",
  ["L9c"] = "Is that for me?",
  ["L9d"] = "Very noble. Shiny. Me like. But breaks so fast. Me can make from shiny armour. Lil' one want to trade?",
  ["L9e"] = "For sufficient silver tokens you can also enchant: {spiritthorn ring}, {alicorn ring}, {arcanomancer sigil}, {arboreal ring}, {turtle amulet}. Make you choice!",
  ["L9f"] = "Well, can I help you with something else?",
  ["L9g"] = "We provide addons to people dedicated to our city. So the first addon is granted to someone who has voted for each of the available shortcuts and each dungeon at least once. ...",
  ["L9h"] = "This way he might learn that violence doesn't always help, but that a friendly word might just do the trick. ...",
  ["L9i"] = "I have but a few copies, anyway.",
  ["L9j"] = "Ohh, then I need to find another adventurer who wants to earn a great reward. Bye!",
  ["L9k"] = "Another symbol - that of the snake - that must have been much more popular than the dragon, faded into unimportance over the years. ...",
  ["L9l"] = "You don't have it...",
  ["L9m"] = "The dish is quite fried and tropical. Bring me the following ingredients and we're going to prepare it: One fresh dead chicken, two lemons, two oranges, two mangos, one stone herb and two vials of coconut milk.",
  ["L9n"] = "Please talk to Sam and tell him I sent you. I'm sure he will be glad to refine your helmet, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["L9o"] = "My studies indicate that without all doubt Ferumbras the fiendish is in the process of accumulating nearly godlike powers. We have to stop him.",
  ["L9p"] = "The whole growing downwards could come to a halt, leaving us exposed to even more attacks, counter attacks, and giving the enemy time to prepare their defences. There's a lot to do for aspiring adventurers.",
  ["L9q"] = "Cling clang!",
  ["L9r"] = "But I think I have a clue where we can find the first piece of the scroll. Would you go looking?",
  ["L9s"] = "If you could retrieve the logbook, we'd finally know what happened. Have you understood your task and are willing to take this risk?",
  ["L9t"] = "When the wind blows into this cave and hits the stalagmites, it is supposed to create a sound similar to a soft song. ...",
  ["L9u"] = "Very good, mortal being! Now you have to catch the respective light and store it in the corresponding vessel. You can gather moon rays by night but this will only work on one special sacred glade on Feyrist. ...",
  ["L9v"] = "Really?? She was looking for someone to help her. Maybe you could go and see her. She lives just to the east and down the mountain. So, thank you again and {bye} for now!",
  ["L9w"] = "SPECIAL OFFERS TODAY!",
  ["L9x"] = "This is an important lesson from me - an experienced veteran fighter. Take this! Look at your status bar again. As you can see, you've lost health. Now I'll tell you how to heal that, {yes}?",
  ["L9y"] = "If they are too powerful, just retreat and we will have to re-evaluate the situation. If they are harmless, all the better.",
  ["L9z"] = "The explorer society needs a great deal of help in the research of astral travel. Are you willing to help?",
