  ["N98"] = "LONG LIVE THE QUEEN!",
  ["N99"] = "LONG LIVE THE QUEEN!",
  ["N9A"] = "Greetings, traveller. I'm a magical trader and trainer for sorcerer spells. How may I help you?",
  ["N9B"] = "Good bye.",
  ["N9C"] = "Good bye.",
  ["N9D"] = "Of course, just browse through my wares. Or do you want to look only at",
  ["N9E"] = "Hello, my lad. Sit down, have a drink, why don't you?",
  ["N9F"] = "Hunter's greeting! I assume you want something from me since you came all the way out here on your own. This is a dangerous place to be, I doubt that all my men will accept strangers like I do. You don't seem to have any problems with that, though.",
  ["N9G"] = "Welcome to the finest weaponshop in the land, |PLAYERNAME|! Tell me if you're looking for a good {trade}.",
  ["N9H"] = "Good bye. Come back soon.",
  ["N9I"] = "Good bye. Come back soon.",
  ["N9J"] = "Of course, just browse through my wares.",
  ["N9K"] = "Oh, a customer. Hello |PLAYERNAME|. If you'd like to see my wonderful self-tailored clothes, ask me for a {trade}.",
  ["N9L"] = "Oh, good bye.",
  ["N9M"] = "Oh, good bye.",
  ["N9N"] = "Of course, just browse through my wares.",
  ["N9O"] = "Hello, my name is Saideh. Once this was the entry to the crypt of our heroes. One of the graves belongs to our beloved hero Dayyan. Nowadays it is not a good idea to visit this place.",
  ["N9P"] = "Well, bye then.",
  ["N9Q"] = "Welcome to my shop, adventurer |PLAYERNAME|! I {trade} with weapons and armor.",
  ["N9R"] = "Good bye and come again, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["N9S"] = "Good bye and come again.",
  ["N9T"] = "Hm. Greetings.",
  ["N9U"] = "Praise the gods, I bid you farewell.",
  ["N9V"] = "Hello |PLAYERNAME|, welcome to the fluid and potion {shop} of Edron.",
  ["N9W"] = "Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|, please come back soon.",
  ["N9X"] = "Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|, please come back soon.",
  ["N9Y"] = "Of course, just browse through my wares. By the way, if you'd like to join our bonus system for depositing flasks and vial, you have to tell me about that {deposit}.",
  ["N9Z"] = "...er... hello? Yes...? Well, if... if you have any questions - I am not even here.",
  ["N9a"] = "Yes... then, goodbye.",
  ["N9b"] = "Yes... then, goodbye.",
  ["N9c"] = "Welcome back! Where were we... ? Ah, right, I asked you if you saw your 'level up'! You did, {right}?",
  ["N9d"] = "Welcome back! Where were we... ? Ah, right, I asked you if those nasty cockroaches {hurt} you! Did they?",
  ["N9e"] = "Welcome back! Where were we... ? Ah, right, I asked you if I should demonstrate some damage on you. Let's do it, {okay}?",
  ["N9f"] = "Welcome back! Where were we... ? Ah, right, I was about to show you how you regain health, right?",
  ["N9g"] = "Welcome back! Where were we... ? Ah, right, I gave you a fish to eat?",
  ["N9h"] = "Welcome back! Where were we... ? Ah, right, I asked you if you saw Zirella! Did you?",
  ["N9i"] = "Hello again, |PLAYERNAME|! It's great to see you. If you like, we can chat a little. Just use the highlighted {keywords} again to choose a {topic}.",
  ["N9j"] = "Take care, |PLAYERNAME|!.",
  ["N9k"] = "Good bye traveller, and enjoy your stay on Rookgaard.",
  ["N9l"] = "Hello |PLAYERNAME|, nice to see you on Rookgaard! I saw you walking by and wondered if you could help me. Could you? Please, say {yes}!",
  ["N9m"] = "Oh, |PLAYERNAME|, it's you again! It's probably impolite to disturb a busy adventurer like you, but I really need help. Please, say {yes}!",
  ["N9n"] = "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! Ahh, you found my chest. Let me take a look at you. You put on that coat, {yes}?",
  ["N9o"] = "Hey, I want to give you a weapon for free! You should not refuse that, in fact you should say '{yes}'!",
  ["N9p"] = "Good job! For that, I'll grant you 100 experience points! Oh - what was that? I think you advanced a level, {right}?",
  ["N9q"] = "Oh, please come in, |PLAYERNAME|. What can I do for you? If you need adventure equipment, ask me for a {trade}.",
  ["N9r"] = "Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["N9s"] = "Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["N9t"] = "Of course, just browse through my wares. {Footballs} have to be purchased separately.",
  ["N9u"] = "|PLAYERNAME|. I have been watching your fate for quite some time. It's about time you came here. Do you seek to enter the riven island of Quirefang or travel back from where you came?",
  ["N9v"] = "Greetings, daring adventurer. If you need a {passage}, let me know.",
  ["N9w"] = "Good bye.",
  ["N9x"] = "Oh well.",
  ["N9y"] = "Greetings, daring adventurer. If you need a {passage}, let me know.",
  ["N9z"] = "Good bye.",
  ["NA"] = "I am the captain of this ship.",
  ["NA0"] = "Two hydra tongue plants, two tomatoes, one cucumber, two eggs, one troll green and one vial of wine.",
  ["NA1"] = "Pick it up from Willard and bring it back to me while I'm in Liberty Bay. Everything clear and understood?",
  ["NA2"] = "And I navigated them out of their miserable lives. Away from their petty interests. I led them to a greater purpose - to form chaos out of order, to bring back the storm to the seas and to make THINGS MOVE. Do you want to hear the rest as well?",
  ["NA3"] = "Zzizz izz mozzt unfortunate. Zzo many warriorzz? Large amountzz of food? And how many weaponzz did you zzay? I zzee, hmm. ... ",
  ["NA4"] = "Come back when you find any information.",
  ["NA5"] = "Just go to the docks at exactly midnight and be very quiet. Look at the horizon and maybe you will hear and see it, too!",
  ["NA6"] = "Oh, I thought you have one.",
  ["NA7"] = "AH YES! I WORKED ON THE DRESS PATTERN FOR THOSE UNIFORMS. STAINLESS TROUSERES, STEAM DRIVEN BOOTS! ANOTHERMARVEL TO BEHOLD! I'LL SENT A COPY TO KEVIN IMEDIATELY!",
  ["NA8"] = "With the objects you've provided our researchers will make steady progress. Still we are missing some test results from fellow explorers ...",
  ["NA9"] = "You already have accepted this mission. Don't forget to {report} to me when you are done.",
  ["NAA"] = "Hey! Don't touch that hat! Leave it alone!!! Don't do this!!!!",
  ["NAB"] = "Well, bye then.",
  ["NAC"] = "We dived under the bow and saw that it was stuck right on the tip of a sharp rock. The world below us was treacherous, we could see large underwater mountains and a labyrinthine system of caves and holes. ...",
  ["NAD"] = "Excellent! Now, let me explain. If you donate 1.000.000.000 gold pieces, you will be entitled to wear a unique outfit. ...",
  ["NAE"] = "You need to wait some hours to take another mission again or you are still on a mission.",
  ["NAF"] = "I'm sorry, you don't have enough incantation notes. Return if you can offer fifty of them.",
  ["NAG"] = "Do you want to buy the dungeon key for 2000 gold?",
  ["NAH"] = "So you have finally made it! I did not think that you would have it in you ... However: are you ready for another assignment?",
  ["NAI"] = "For your brave action, I tell you a secret which has been kept for many many years. There is an old house south of the location where you found the demon oak. There should be a grave with the name 'Yesim Adeit' somewhere close by. ...",
  ["NAJ"] = "Thank you! I look forward to reading this interesting discovery of yours and learn a few things about {Zao}.",
  ["NAK"] = "Grarkharok angry now!! Want throw rock on human cave down hill again!",
  ["NAL"] = "You have made it! We have enough bones for the fund! You remind me of myself when I was young! Interested in another mission?",
  ["NAM"] = "Right, now before the merchants enter the woods, you will install several traps - nothing too dangerous, just nets and ropes. ...",
  ["NAN"] = "Would you like to buy a broken compass for 10.000 gold?",
  ["NAO"] = "The trolls living west of our city have become quite a nuisance lately. Not that they are really dangerous to us, but still, we must show them that there's a line they shouldn't cross. ...",
  ["NAP"] = "You don't have these many tokens.",
  ["NAQ"] = "You need to wait some hours to take another mission again or you are still on a mission.",
  ["NAR"] = "Hello, young apprentice. Do you have that scroll piece from the priestess?",
  ["NAS"] = "Indeed I heard you did a good job out there. <sigh> I guess that means I can hand you one of our necrometers. Handle it with care.",
  ["NAT"] = "You have come for the report? Great! I have been working hard on it during the last months. And nobody came to pick it up. I thought everybody had forgotten about me! ...",
  ["NAU"] = "We built an iron fence around it and added a mechanism to quickly get barrel if need be. Then an... accident happened to our guard down there and ...",
  ["NAV"] = "So listen, you will check certain tours our members have to take to see if there is some trouble. First travel with Captain Bluebear's ship from Thais to Carlin, understood?",
  ["NAW"] = "Have you understood everything I told you and are willing to handle this task?",
  ["NAX"] = "Fine. But the first thing you have to know is that we are not the city's problem. We are just trying to survive. We usually seek shelter in the sewers.",
  ["NAY"] = "I trade Enchanted Chicken Wing for Boots of Haste, Warrior Sweat for 4 Warrior Helmets, Fighting Spirit for 2 Royal Helmet Magic Sulphur for 3 Fire Swords",
  ["NAZ"] = "For now ze mazter will zee zat you and your alliez are zpared of ze wraz of ze dragon emperor az you are unimportant for hiz goalz. ...",
  ["NAa"] = "That's the spirit! But let us continue with the {test}.",
  ["NAb"] = "Simple enough? Are you interested in this task?",
  ["NAc"] = "It'd be better for you to leave now.",
  ["NAd"] = "If you help me to solve my problems, I will help you with your mission. Do you accept?",
  ["NAe"] = "Come back when you got all neccessary items.",
  ["NAf"] = "Mh, if you can find zzome nailzz - 3 should be enough - and 1 piezze of wood, I should be able to create an appropriate cazzing. Return to me if you found zze itemzz and we will talk about zze next zztep. ",
  ["NAg"] = "Use this botanist's container on a giant jungle rose to obtain a sample for us. Bring it here and report about your plant collection.",
  ["NAh"] = "Yesss! So this time he will get it for a change! And he lived there...? He helped whom? Ha! He won't get away this time! What did he do there? I see... interesting! ...",
  ["NAi"] = "Nobody knows the trouble I've seen .. <tells a quite detailed report>. ",
  ["NAj"] = "They are not only more complicated but also more specific. A single word which always keeps the same meaning is astonishingly effective in its primitive way. ...",
  ["NAk"] = "Thank goodness!",
  ["NAl"] = "Think carefully, human, for this mission will bring you into real danger. Are you prepared to do us that final favour?",
  ["NAm"] = "I guard this humble temple as a monument for the order of the {nightmare knights}.",
  ["NAn"] = "Good. As you may have gathered, the body parts you brought need to be assembled to form a whole body. ...",
  ["NAo"] = "Anyway, I found another nice pattern in this book. It's for a lizard carrying device. I've given it to Pompan, just in case you're interested.",
  ["NAp"] = "I collect everything that reflects light in strange ways. However, I am bored by my collection. And there wasn't anything new to add for years. ...",
  ["NAq"] = "I was hoping that you'd agree. Please deliver these 200 gold pieces to the herbalist Charlotta in the south-western part of the town. If you return from this errand, I will grant you 5 gold pieces as reward for your efforts.",
  ["NAr"] = "Did you bring all the materials I informed you about? ",
  ["NAs"] = "Ah, so you want it, too? Well, do me a favour: fetch two samples and assist in my experiment, in exchange for the scroll piece. Yes?",
  ["NAt"] = "I had some cough syrup a while ago. It was stolen in an ape raid. I fear if you want more cough syrup you will have to buy it in the druids guild in carlin.",
  ["NAu"] = "Gnowful! Use the fertiliser on four gardener mushroom in the caves.",
  ["NAv"] = "The stampor in the back? She's my friend, but she came to me out of her own free will. I must admit I've never managed to tame any other stampor. ...",
  ["NAw"] = "It should become a day to remember and so I want to give them something special as a present. I searched the land for the finest craftsmen so they could create suitable presents for my sons. ...",
  ["NAx"] = "That is a noble resolution you have made there, human, but I'm afraid I cannot accept your generous offer at this point of time. ...",
  ["NAy"] = "I am constantly waiting for ordnance to arrive. A lot of gnomes intend to travel out here to help us but the main access path to our base is not safe anymore. ...",
  ["NAz"] = "Do you want to purchase a weekly ticket for the ore wagons? With it you can travel freely and swiftly through Kazordoon for one week. 250 gold only. Deal?",
  ["NB"] = "This is Venore. Where do you want to go?",
  ["NB0"] = "Even though we are spirits, we can't create anything out of thin air. You will have to donate some precious metal which we can drain for energy and substance. ...",
  ["NB1"] = "Then not.",
  ["NB2"] = "You know, a large group of merchants is travelling from Thais to Venore and they are crossing the forest to shorten their way - can you believe it? ...",
  ["NB3"] = "I hope our craftsmen can do something with this stuff. For me it makes hardly any sense.",
  ["NB4"] = "Wrong Word.",
  ["NB5"] = "Too clozze, far too clozze. I felt a huge impact not long after you left. Zze war machinery of zze emperor muzzt finally have been zztarted. ...",
  ["NB6"] = "I hereby grant you the permission to enter the abandoned part of the sewers. Take care, man! ...",
  ["NB7"] = "What we need is enough {mortar} to actually build a durable traverse. And we will need even more mortar to maintain it as it constantly gets attacked by vile critters.",
  ["NB8"] = "Oh, you don't have my book.",
  ["NB9"] = "BUT, you will have only this ONE chance to catch him! Good luck!",
  ["NBA"] = "Against all odds, we managed to gain some modest profit by exploiting these circumstances in one way or the other. Recently though, one of our neighbours went too far...",
  ["NBB"] = "Did you acquire the sample of the jungle bells plant we are looking for?",
  ["NBC"] = "Excellent. Now I can start baking the pies. As you helped me, I will make you a good price for them.",
  ["NBD"] = "Zzizz should be our pazz to zze great gate. Head to zze zztorage onzze again. Zzere should be zzome extra greazzy oil which should work wizz zzuch a large mechanizzm. Zze leverzz should zzen be movable again. ",
  ["NBE"] = "You are not done yet.",
  ["NBF"] = "Admittedly, it is just a hypothesis that is based on a few hints in these tomes and my correspondence about serpent spawns with the sage Edowir... ...",
  ["NBG"] = "Wrong Word.",
  ["NBH"] = "You have indeed the spirit of an adventurer! In the south-east of Tiquanda is a small settlement of the lizard people ...",
  ["NBI"] = "Oh no! I knew that day would come! I am slightly above the allowed weight and if you can't supply me with some grapes to slim down I will get fired. Do you happen to have some grapes with you? ",
  ["NBJ"] = "They will only work for a certain amount of time though, so you will have to hurry or some of the machines will turn inactive again.",
  ["NBK"] = "I've heard some odd rumours about this new dwarven outpost. But tell me, what has the Edron academy to do with Farmine?",
  ["NBL"] = "Sorry.",
  ["NBM"] = "If you can find any documentzz about zzeir zztrategiezz, zze rezzizztanzze will be very grateful. ...",
  ["NBN"] = "Did you acquire a copy of 'Songs of the Forest' for us?",
  ["NBO"] = "Unfortunately in the current state of time, he was never interested in attending Edron Academy, he never looked for a job to finance his studies and of course has never been one of my interns. ...",
  ["NBP"] = "Good luck on your audience with the Empress. May Kilmaresh prosper.",
  ["NBQ"] = "Great! That's my breakthrough. Now she can't refuse to go out with me. I grant you access to the western part of the mine.",
  ["NBR"] = "I think it's one of my masterpieces.",
  ["NBS"] = "But you don't have it...",
  ["NBT"] = "At night it will weep bloody tears and only at night you will meet the ghost there. Take this talisman so you may be able to talk with animals and even plants and stones. Just don't expect that all of them will answer you.",
  ["NBU"] = "Have you gathered the mandrake and the 5 voodoo dolls from the dworcs?",
  ["NBV"] = "Well, this piece here is a rather fascinating thing - see those strange blood stains? - ...",
  ["NBW"] = "Please bring me some valuable information!",
  ["NBX"] = "I'm fine. There's no trouble at all.",
  ["NBY"] = "Haha, just kidding, fooled you there, didn't I? Always control your nerves, that's quite important during bargaining. ...",
  ["NBZ"] = "It is commonly known that orcs of Uldereks Rock use some sort of powder to increase the fierceness of their war wolves and berserkers ...",
  ["NBa"] = "I do not fear for his safety because his cover is foolproof, but I cannot contact him either. This is where you come in. ...",
  ["NBb"] = "Great. Here, take it.",
  ["NBc"] = "The explorer society would like to acquire an ancient urn which is some sort of relic to the lizard people of Tiquanda. Would you like to accept this mission?",
  ["NBd"] = "Take it, if you are up to that challenge ... or perish in agony if you deserve this fate ...",
  ["NBe"] = "No, no. That's not enough, I fear.",
  ["NBf"] = "Now, let me see... yes... yes... very good. Let me add THIS ..... swill it... there. Sanguine! ...",
  ["NBg"] = "Thank you, you are ... YOU SON OF LIZARD!",
  ["NBh"] = "I hereby grant you permission to use the basic gnomish teleporters. I also give you four gnomish teleport crystals. One will be used up each time you use the teleporter. ...",
  ["NBi"] = "I met this troll when he was hanging around near the town. He carried something I would consider rather uncharacteristic for a troll: a stunningly beautiful cloak entirely made of white feathers. I was curious and asked him if he would sell it. ...",
  ["NBj"] = "You don't have my scroll.",
  ["NBk"] = "Ask around in the settlement where you can help out. If you have proven your worth I might have some missions for you.",
  ["NBl"] = "Of course! Ivory! Its value is quite obvious.",
  ["NBm"] = "Unfortunately, my intrusion was discovered and I had to run for my life. During my escape, I lost my favourite wolf tooth chain.",
  ["NBn"] = "I see... so Armenius is the master, and the spell didn't even cause a scratch on him... Well, that went worse than expected. Let me think for a moment and then ask me about a mission again.",
  ["NBo"] = "Sorry.",
  ["NBp"] = "You haven't finished your final mission yet. Shall I explain it again to you?",
  ["NBq"] = "Indeed, indeed. Without the help of Thais, our allies stand no chance! Well, I'll send some money to support their cause.",
  ["NBr"] = "He uses this energy to increasingly empower himself and will eventually be prepared to take the final step to transform himself into a godlike being. ...",
  ["NBs"] = "Oh, you're back already? Did you bring a legion helmet, 100 chicken feathers and 50 honeycombs?",
  ["NBt"] = "Good, you've returned. Your skill in practical matters seems to be useful. If you're ready for a further mission, just ask. ",
  ["NBu"] = "Yes, maybe it was the right decision. Astronomical research is nothing for the faint-hearted.",
  ["NBv"] = "I bow to you, player, and hereby grant you the right to wear Ferumbras' hat as accessory. Congratulations!",
  ["NBw"] = "And voilà, we're done! The girls of Carlin swear that it sharpens their eyesight, at least for a while. I'm sure it will somehow aid you in your battles. Enjoy! ...",
  ["NBx"] = "Yes, well for instance I tried for some time to figure out how to enter the fiery portal in this complex. Most of the draken never come up here. They rather hide somewhere down there, planning and plotting. ...",
  ["NBy"] = "Luckily, the walls of the owner's house are covered with vines, that will make a burglary quite easy. ...",
  ["NBz"] = "Do you have the 5 bat wings I requested?",
  ["NC0"] = "As you wish.",
  ["NC1"] = "You will have to re-empower several wardstones all over the world, to weaken the beast of nightmares. ...",
  ["NC2"] = "Find and slay the keeper of blooded tears and bring the nectar of his eyes before the blood god. Present your gift on the sacrificial altar. ...",
  ["NC3"] = "Make sure that you have all the ingredients with you.",
  ["NC4"] = "I know where the great wolf mother lives, but I will not tell that to just anyone. You have to earn my respect first. Are you willing to help me?",
  ["NC5"] = "You don't have enough money.",
  ["NC6"] = "The slayer of my enemies is my friend! For a mere 1000 gold I will create the documents you need. Are you interested?",
  ["NC7"] = "Another option if you want to do a task for Edron would be to killing 150 goblins. Would that suit your taste better?",
  ["NC8"] = "That would be sufficient proof. Would you like to accept this mission?",
  ["NC9"] = "Each one seemed to cause a different effect and he was never really sure what the next one would do. Seems safer to be careful with them and not to eat them in dangerous situations! ...",
  ["NCA"] = "No no no! That is not correct!",
  ["NCB"] = "Then not.",
  ["NCC"] = "Don't waste any more time. We need the spyreport of our man in Mal'ouquah as soon as possible! ...",
  ["NCD"] = "Currently we are offering accessories for the nobleman - and, of course, noblewoman - outfit. Would you like to hear more about our offer?",
  ["NCE"] = "Great! This blow strikes them where it hurts most: profit.",
  ["NCF"] = "Do you have news to make old Uncle happy? Don't tell me you need another barrel of beer, though.",
  ["NCG"] = "Oh! You look horrible - I mean, rather weary. What happened? Who is the master vampire?",
  ["NCH"] = "Well, you need to mix flour with holy water and use that dough on garlic to create a special dough. Bake it like normal bread, but I guarantee that no vampire can eat that. Are you following me?",
  ["NCI"] = "Well, can I help you with something else?",
  ["NCJ"] = "Have you brought the cheese?",
  ["NCK"] = "Just ask me for more missions and we will see what you are capable of!",
  ["NCL"] = "Zzz...",
  ["NCM"] = "Only then my people will be safe. Please tell Hairycles, will you go there?",
  ["NCN"] = "A lot of corpses are lying around wherever these creatures are being hunted. Now all we need are, you guessed it, volunteers to clean up as many of those remains as possible ... ",
  ["NCO"] = "Recently, our fishermen have been attacked by a maritime race called the quara. They live in the sunken quarter and are a significant threat to our people. I ask you to enter the sunken quarter and slay all their leaders. ...",
  ["NCP"] = "Now you know as much as we do about the things happening in Yalahar. It's up to you what you do with this information. ...",
  ["NCQ"] = "Look at these dwarven legs. They were forged years ago by a dwarf who was rather tall for our kind. I want you to have them. Thank you for rescuing my son |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["NCR"] = "Of course we should talk again about your request. What do you say makes Farmine important?",
  ["NCS"] = "He's basically a ferryman nowadays, but I remember when he was our village's leading fisherman. He offers a ferry service between Grimvale and Edron. You must have met him - he sailed you here.",
  ["NCT"] = "Oh, there's a waterpipe in one of my cells? ...",
  ["NCU"] = "Me saw a stone with lizard signs and other signs at once. If you read signs and tell Hairycles, me will know how to read signs. ...",
  ["NCV"] = "Take this boots as a token of great gratitude. Let us forever remember this day, my friend. ",
  ["NCW"] = "I am responsible for our war {missions}, to {trade} with seasoned soldiers and rewarding war {heroes}. You have to be rank 4 to enter the {warzones}.",
  ["NCX"] = "Noted. Now, get down there and rain some fire on them.",
  ["NCY"] = "The Yalahari seem to be obsessed with conserving their dead, so I guess the embalming fluid will be a great success in Yalahar. Do you want a passage to Ankrahmun for 230 gold?",
  ["NCZ"] = "You only have to bring me 100 pieces of ape fur, so I can brew the potion. Do we have a deal?",
  ["NCa"] = "Here it is.",
  ["NCb"] = "Please get the cheese from Miraia and bring it to me while I'm in Port Hope. Everything clear and understood?",
  ["NCc"] = "Concentrate! ...",
  ["NCd"] = "Make sure that you have all the ingredients with you.",
  ["NCe"] = "Never heard that name. Well, I don't mind, thanks for the cake.",
  ["NCf"] = "A client of our guild would like to get a certain vase. Unfortunately, it's not for sale. Well, by the original owner, that is. ...",
  ["NCg"] = "Alright |PLAYERNAME|. Vocation?",
  ["NCh"] = "Shove off, little one! Humans are not welcome here, |PLAYERNAME|!",
  ["NCi"] = "They had gathered hint after hint - until, ultimately, they were squashed by the Seven or their minions; which only made the leads that hinted at them all the more probable. ...",
  ["NCj"] = "Don't be afraid. It won't hurt! Just step in!",
  ["NCk"] = "Recently, the technomancers with the help of the temples of fire and earth made some crucial discoveries that allowed the ships to extend their cruising range almost limitlessly. ...",
  ["NCl"] = "Please bring me proof of the mad technomancers defeat!",
  ["NCm"] = "You are still alive, |PLAYERNAME|? Well, what do you want?",
  ["NCn"] = "Come back if change mind.",
  ["NCo"] = "You need 5 heavy old tome.",
  ["NCp"] = "Zze emperor of zze dragonzz hazz tranzzformed himzzelf into an undead creature to lazzt for all eternity, to cheat deazz. Hizz corruption flowzz to zzozze he bound, and from zzem to zzozze zzey bound, and from zzem into zze land.",
  ["NCq"] = "You don't have any barrel of beer!",
  ["NCr"] = "I hope your first mission will not scare you off. Even though, we cut off our sewer system from other parts of the city to prevent the worst, it still has deteriorated in the last decades. ...",
  ["NCs"] = "From now on you are a grand postman for special operations. You are an honoured member of our guild and earned the privilege of your own post horn. Here, take it.",
  ["NCt"] = "This glade has been desecrated. We kept it secret for centuries, yet evil has found a way to sully and destroy what was our most sacred. ...",
  ["NCu"] = "These smugglers think they don't have to pay us respect and try to withhold our share of the profit. Recently, they got hold of a certain valuable goblet. ...",
  ["NCv"] = "I have one final task for you, |PLAYERNAME|. Many months ago, I was trying to free the war wolves which are imprisoned inside the orc fortress.",
  ["NCw"] = "...However, considering everything that I could figure out about their origin, they seem to hatch from the same eggs like ordinary lizardmen. ...",
  ["NCx"] = "Wrong Word.",
  ["NCy"] = "Yes... Yes... <sigh>. We already talked about that. I can't remember if you have already tried the {test}, so lets get going.",
  ["NCz"] = "With the help of certain apparatuses, they tracked deposits of ore and compiled ship routes to reach them. These mining bases had some obvious advantages and disadvantages. ...",
  ["ND0"] = "What comes first? {A}) safety {B}) I {C}) duty {D}) George",
  ["ND1"] = "You no have tasty snake! Bring tasty snake!!! Grarkharok hungry!!",
  ["ND2"] = "So be it. Now you are a member of the inquisition. You might ask me for a {mission} to raise in my esteem.",
  ["ND3"] = "If you need some more ribbons just come back to me and ask.",
  ["ND4"] = "You do not have enough money.",
  ["ND5"] = "Find them and get us this goblet as rightful payment. If you have to bash some noses during your mission, even better.",
  ["ND6"] = "We will grant you permission to travel to that isle of Helheim. Our legends say that this is the entrance to the dark world. The dark world is the place where the evil and lost souls roam in eternal torment ...",
  ["ND7"] = "I am Albinius, a worshipper of the {Astral Shapers}.",
  ["ND8"] = "I'm pleased to hear that. Rarely we meet outsiders that care about our problems. Most people come here looking for wealth and luxury. ...",
  ["ND9"] = "Would you like to donate 7,500 silver tokens and 6,250 gold tokens for a unique crown?",
  ["NDA"] = "Did you gather all necessary ingredients to cook a Veggie Casserole with me?",
  ["NDB"] = "Five tainted hearts and five darklight hearts drowned in a worldly wealth of 50000000 gold pieces for the righteous. Are you prepared?",
  ["NDC"] = "Have dead frog for Grarkharok??",
  ["NDD"] = "The academy instated the 'Edron-Zaoan Exploration Division' shortly after. I was a founding member and head of the 'Draken' research branch. ...",
  ["NDE"] = "Okay, listen closely: First of all, you need to gather 20 enchanted emeralds in order to go to the earth sphere. Deep under the academy, one floor below the elemental shrines, there is a machine. Put the gems in there and activate it. ...",
  ["NDF"] = "Have you understood everything I told you and are willing to handle this task?",
  ["NDG"] = "Here it is.",
  ["NDH"] = "Excellent, you brought just the tool we need! Of course it was only a simple task. However ...",
  ["NDI"] = "Do you want to buy a poem scroll for 200 gold?",
  ["NDJ"] = "Sorry, you have not yet earned enough renown that we would risk your life in such a dangerous mission.",
  ["NDK"] = "The 'dragon' part derives from the fiery afterburn of this meal, but the wings we use are much smaller, though similar in shape. Bring me the following ingredients and I'll show you how it's done. ...",
  ["NDL"] = "You need to donate {helmet} addon first.",
  ["NDM"] = "So are you ready for another mission?",
  ["NDN"] = "Congratulations! Here is your brand-new accessory, I hope you like it. Please visit us again!",
  ["NDO"] = "I recommend not to go alone becauze it will be very dangerouz - but ALL of you will have to uze zeir zeptre replicaz on ze emperor'z remainz to prozeed! ...",
  ["NDP"] = "THAT'S what we need!! Are you in on it?",
  ["NDQ"] = "Now all kinds of beasts roam the park, and gladiators challenge them and visitors to test their skills. One of the residents is an ancient druid that rather cares foranimals than for people. ...",
  ["NDR"] = "Then no.",
  ["NDS"] = "I see you brought my stuff. Good. I'll keep my promise: Here's katana in return.",
  ["NDT"] = "The evil cult has placed a curse on one of the captains here. I need at least five of their pirate voodoo dolls to lift that curse.",
  ["NDU"] = "What do you think? I am the sheriff of Carlin.",
  ["NDV"] = "Last ingredient for charm of life is thing to lure magic. Only thing me know like that is mushroom called witches' cap. Me was told it be found in isle called Fibula, where humans live. ...",
  ["NDW"] = "Did you get an atlas of the explorers society as I requested?",
  ["NDX"] = "Also don't forget the password to contact our man: PIEDPIPER!",
  ["NDY"] = "Hmmm... I don't think so. Return to Thais and continue your search!",
  ["NDZ"] = "You have found an inscription I would like to translate for you. The tibianus cipher was used: ...",
  ["NDa"] = "There's no mission left for you, friend of the Marid. However, I have a task for you.",
  ["NDb"] = "If you lose it I will have to write a new one and put it in there again - which will undoubtedly take me a while. So keep an eye on it on your travels. ...",
  ["NDc"] = "AND I shall be made whole, and YOU shall be RICH!",
  ["NDd"] = "Before ye' open his coffin and drag that beast out to destroy it, I advise ye' to place some garlic necklaces on the stone slabs next to his coffin. That will weaken him considerably. ...",
  ["NDe"] = "So listen please: Take this ice pick and use it on a block of ice in the caves beneath Folda. Get some ice and bring it here as fast as you can ...",
  ["NDf"] = "We'd like to ease our lives somewhat. Therefore, we would appreciate the cooperation with one of the Venore city guards. ...",
  ["NDg"] = "Come back when you do.",
  ["NDh"] = "Our mission for you is to step into the gnomish transformer and then destroy eight monster nests in the caves. If you are interested, I can give you some more information about it. Are you willing to accept this mission?",
  ["NDi"] = "The hole grows larger, you cannot close your eyes. An unimaginable black. Deeper and darker than any nothingness you could possibly imagine drags you into it. ...",
  ["NDj"] = "To collect the unbelievably rare, practically unique mirror crystal, you will need to use this special carrying device I developed. If you find the crystal, use it to store it and transport it safely to me. There is no second one.",
  ["NDk"] = "Therefore I have to ask you, if you are willing to retrieve the parts of the godbreaker, and face the threat of the ascending Ferumbras?",
  ["NDl"] = "Exit the city and go through a mountain passage leading to the west, then keep on heading north. The entrance is marked by large, obelisk-like stones arranged in a circle. ...",
  ["NDm"] = "Good! Please return once you have gathered 30 pieces of wood.",
  ["NDn"] = "Strange being you are! Our people need help!",
  ["NDo"] = "You telling me to forge one?! Especially for you? You making fun of me?",
  ["NDp"] = "Hi there! Welcome to my little {tavern}.",
  ["NDq"] = "Here it is.",
  ["NDr"] = "Simply cut the rolls in half, shortly fry one slice of each fish type, put in the shrimps and spice up with grinded fern, which, by the way, tastes slightly like dill. ...",
  ["NDs"] = "His whole existence seems to be centred on becoming a name that strikes fear into the heart of men and to become a persistent figure in the minds of humanity. ...",
  ["NDt"] = "No, no, I was asking for one of the names.",
  ["NDu"] = "Therefore I have to ask you, if you are willing to retrieve the parts of the godbreaker, and face the threat of the ascending Ferumbras?",
  ["NDv"] = "You don't have enough money.",
  ["NDw"] = "HOLY MOTHER OF ALL ROTWORMS! You did it and they are of even better quality than the old ones. You should be the first one to try the elevator, just jump on it. See you my friend.",
  ["NDx"] = "With the death of their leader, the rebels return to our camps one by one, deeply humiliated. It might be a wise decision to let a useful tool like you continue to exist.",
  ["NDy"] = "My pride is great but not greater than reason. I am not too proud to ask for help as this is a dark hour. ... ",
  ["NDz"] = "What a fine material. That will be worth a coin or two. So far, so good. Ask me for another mission if you're ready for it.",
  ["NE"] = "Do you seek a passage to {0} for {1}?",
  ["NE0"] = "You need to donate {armor} outfit first.",
  ["NE1"] = "Did you get the requested pickaxe from Uzgod in Kazordoon?",
  ["NE2"] = "I'm very pleased to hear that! Which do you prefer - paying 150000 at once or 10000 for 15 times?",
  ["NE3"] = "You do not have enough level yet.",
  ["NE4"] = " I would like you to visit the grave of our beloved hero Dayyan. His remains have to be reburied, because a horde of ogres controls this place. Do you want to start this holy mission?",
  ["NE5"] = "You are most welcome to keep on killing pirates for us though for some bucks and experience. If you want to do so, just ask me about a {task} anytime.",
  ["NE6"] = "Have you found the moon mirror and freed the captured fairies?",
  ["NE7"] = "Did you bring me the 50 honeycombs I requested and do you absolutely admire my beauty?",
  ["NE8"] = "You can acquire the {basic} outfit for 1000 Gold, the {first} addon for 2000 gold and the {second} addon for 3000 gold. Which do you want to buy?",
  ["NE9"] = "Some high ranking members would like to study elven poetry. They want the rare book 'Songs of the Forest' ...",
  ["NEA"] = "Talk to him by calling his name 'Sniffler' and tell him you got meat for him. After he has eaten the meat, return here to talk to me about your mission.",
  ["NEB"] = "Do you want to buy a key for 50 gold?",
  ["NEC"] = "Will you be our guardian?",
  ["NED"] = "Bring me the following ingredients - if you dare - and I'll show you the secret of {Blackjack}: Five sandcrawler shells, two vials of water, twenty carrots, ten potatoes and three jalapeño peppers.",
  ["NEE"] = "You feel as if you cannot breathe anymore. The very second you let loose of your consciousness, you sense all heaviness around you lifted. ...",
  ["NEF"] = "I'm pleased with your eagerness. To reach your goal, you have to kill the brown trolls and troll champions. Good luck!",
  ["NEG"] = "I don't care what you say! This is a disaster! We need a complete scr - wait. I have an idea. ...",
  ["NEH"] = "I was captured and tortured to death by the cultists here. They worship a being that they call Ghazbaran ...",
  ["NEI"] = "For your {rank} there are four missions avaliable: crystal {keeper}, {spark} hunting, monster {extermination} and mushroom {digging}. By the way, you {rank} now allows you to take aditional missions from {Gnomeral} in {Gnomebase Alpha}. ... ",
  ["NEJ"] = "A cookie? Well... I have to admit I haven't had one for ages. Can I have it?",
  ["NEK"] = "Ok but your next assignment might be dangerous. Our Courier Waldo has been missing for a while. I must assume he is dead. Can you follow me so far?",
  ["NEL"] = "I think it'll rain soon and I left some laundry out for drying.",
  ["NEM"] = "Alright then. Come back when you got all neccessary items.",
  ["NEN"] = "If you could kill 150 goblins for us, that'd be a good start. Would you be willing to help us in this matter?",
  ["NEO"] = "You can {pass} either to the {Alchemist Quarter} or {Cemetery Quarter}. Which one will it be?",
  ["NEP"] = "I would have to sing to the Dark Shrines, but I cannot. ...",
  ["NEQ"] = "Our other operatives were not that lucky, though. But you will learn more about that in your next {mission}.",
  ["NER"] = "Wait - I am the guardian here, yes! The keeper of... something... or another, yes, I... guard this place. With my life. Don't I? Of course! ...",
  ["NES"] = "You no have hair. You lost it? Go and look again.",
  ["NET"] = "This is why we have established our brand-new instalment sale. You can choose to either pay the price at once, or if you want to be safe, by instalments of 10000 gold pieces. ...",
  ["NEU"] = "I won't talk about that.",
  ["NEV"] = "Sorry, that's only dust in your purse.",
  ["NEW"] = "Thank you very much. Can you spare 500 more gold pieces for me? I will give you a nice hint.",
  ["NEX"] = "... a wand of decay, a wand of cosmic energy and a wand of inferno. Please bring them all at once so that their energy will be balanced. ...",
  ["NEY"] = "My sister Ikassis sent you? Blessed be her soul! Yes, it is true: I need help. Listen, I will tell you a secret but please don't break it. As you might already suspect I'm not really a swan but a fae. ...",
  ["NEZ"] = "In the tome, there was also a really nice pattern of a carrying device that might have been used by minotaurs. Or maybe by enemies of minotaurs. I've given it to Pompan. ...",
  ["NEa"] = "I zink we can zave you zome gold and zome treazurez, and you can keep one pieze of your elite armor at leazt. ...",
  ["NEb"] = "I, however, have a {hunch} as to why they dwell so deep under the earth.",
  ["NEc"] = "Did you bring me the package?",
  ["NEd"] = "The kings fund the inquisition and sometimes provide manpower in matters of utmost importance. The inquisition, in return, protects the realm from heretics and individuals that aim to undermine the holy reign of the kings.",
  ["NEe"] = "Hahahaha! ...",
  ["NEf"] = "Once you have found the lamp you must enter Ashta'daramai again. Sneak into Gabel's personal chambers and exchange his sleeping lamp with Fa'hradin's lamp! ...",
  ["NEg"] = "Aaah, zzezze look zzertainly interezzting. Zzezze manuzzcriptzz show uzz zzeveral locationzz of zze enemy troopzz. ... ",
  ["NEh"] = "All right - listen - I know Fa'hradin would not approve of this, but I can't help it. I need some cheese! I need it now! ...",
  ["NEi"] = "Zere were meanz to activate teleporterz zomewhere in ze complex. But zinze you cannot reach all ze roomz, I guezz you will have to improvize. ... ",
  ["NEj"] = "Or would you {B}) smash it to an unrecognisable pulp. Or would you {C}) pluck it to take it with you for further examination. Or would you {D}) try to become friends with the mushroom by singing questionable bar-room songs?",
  ["NEk"] = "Very good, these readings do tell me a lot - the coloured glooth may be instable but it has some... 'interesting' effects on its surroundings. Oh - no worries, you will be perfectly safe. I will also take back my detector now, thanks. ..",
  ["NEl"] = "The dish is quite fried and tropical. Bring me the following ingredients and we're going to prepare it: One fresh dead chicken, two lemons, two oranges, two mangos, one stone herb and two vials of coconut milk.",
  ["NEm"] = "Have a nice day.",
  ["NEn"] = "That's a pity.",
  ["NEo"] = "Good, I have noted down your order. Once you have the money, please come back to pick up your accessory.",
  ["NEp"] = "The druids have asked the brigade for a favour. Given that we heavily rely on their resources and they are important supporters of our cities, we can't deny them the request ...",
  ["NEq"] = "They were driven back into the mountains and survived by growing mushrooms, collecting herbs and probably hunting smaller animals. Today, the orcs pose a major threat to them, so I guess they need every help they can possibly get. ...",
  ["NEr"] = "Did you acquire some of the orcish powder?",
  ["NEs"] = "So Harsin is probably not the person he appeared to be. Actually I haven't heard from him for quite a while. He was resident in the local bed and breakfast hotel. You should be able to find him there or at least to learn about his whereabouts.",
  ["NEt"] = "As you wish.",
  ["NEu"] = "You will have to realign ze cryztalz one after ze ozer. Ztart wiz ze one in ze norz-wezt and work your way clockwize zrough ze room. ...",
  ["NEv"] = "Then not.",
  ["NEw"] = "Ah... <sighs> Very good. Just say the word when you are ready for the next {mission}.",
  ["NEx"] = "My grandpa told me, in the old days there were some behind this cottage. Nothing big though, just small ones, for chicken or rabbits.",
  ["NEy"] = "I thank you also in the name of these poor lost souls. I will send the charm to a priest who is able to release them. ...",
  ["NEz"] = "The equivalent of 5000 gold will do. Are you willing to make such a donation?",
  ["NF"] = "We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["NF0"] = "And here they are! Now forget where you got them from.",
  ["NF1"] = "Hehe, good choice. Okay, the price for this game is 100 gold pieces. I will roll a dice. If I roll a 6, you can have my dice. Agreed?",
  ["NF2"] = "You do not have all the required items.",
  ["NF3"] = "Make sure that you have all the ingredients with you.",
  ["NF4"] = "The scent may not be lost, though - ask a shadow pupil if he can help - but be careful. ...",
  ["NF5"] = "Thank you very much! Our smiths are now able to craft heat-resistent weapons and armor. A little reward for you is this. ...",
  ["NF6"] = "I'm impressed by your support for our cause. Still, I'm aware that this scheming Palimuth tried to influence you. Think about who are your real friends and who can assist you in your career. ...",
  ["NF7"] = "You've slain a mere ",
  ["NF8"] = "How many platinum coins would you like to change into gold?",
  ["NF9"] = "I heard you have already helped our cause. Are you interested in another mission, even when it requires you to travel to a distant land?",
  ["NFA"] = "It seems things went from bad to worse! First we had some problems with the mine shafts we were building, and now that we found some precious veins in one of the new mines, and it happens to be the holiday resort of some hostile stone creatures! ...",
  ["NFB"] = "Then no.",
  ["NFC"] = "The book about tunnelling is in the library which is located in the north eastern wing of Beregar city.",
  ["NFD"] = "You did well. That will help us a lot. Take your {token} and this gnomish supply package as a reward. ",
  ["NFE"] = "Oh marvellous, please excuse me. I need to read this text immediately. Here, take this small reward of 500 gold pieces for your efforts.",
  ["NFF"] = "He was greedy even by dwarven standards. He would never share anything or give away the cheapest thing in his possession ...",
  ["NFG"] = "You do not have enough items.",
  ["NFH"] = "Anyway. Are you prepared to embark on a dangerous mission for us?",
  ["NFI"] = "I didn't dare hope for it! The man told something about selling my babies to the orcs so they could train them as war wolves. ...",
  ["NFJ"] = "Good. Zzat will do. ... ",
  ["NFK"] = "A flawless memory stone! Incredible! It will take years even to figure out how it works but what an opportunity for science, thank you!",
  ["NFL"] = "Your eagerness is a virtue, young one, but first let's talk about advancement",
  ["NFM"] = "Got any dwarven brown ale?? I DON'T THINK SO....and Bolfana, the tavern keeper, won't sell you anything. I'm sure about that...she doesn't like humans... I tell you what, if you get me a cask of dwarven brown ale, I allow you to enter the mine. Alright?",
  ["NFN"] = "I can't let you enter the warzone teleporter one for free, unless you handle me a Deathstrike's snippet. But can still always use a red teleport crystal.",
  ["NFO"] = "No then.",
  ["NFP"] = "Good bye.",
  ["NFQ"] = "The cave is said to lead to a temple complex underground which is ued as a gathering place for a race called 'draken'. He left right away and tried to enter Zao on his own. ...",
  ["NFR"] = "Well, to make a long story short, the barrels are unguarded right now and the diremaws are now too numerous and we are in desperate need of volunteers. ... ",
  ["NFS"] = "...slipped. And cracked. Don't look at me like that ...",
  ["NFT"] = "Ya gotta learn a lot! The correct command would be STARBOARD side. ...",
  ["NFU"] = "Our gnomish crystal golems sometimes go nuts. A recent earthquake has disrupted the entire production of a golem factory. ... ",
  ["NFV"] = "If any documents are left, you probably find them in the catacombs beneath. Good luck!",
  ["NFW"] = "Uhm, as you wish.",
  ["NFX"] = "You should find the beggar somewhere in Edron. Stay persistent, I'm sure he knows more than he wants to tell us.",
  ["NFY"] = "So hereby receive the blessings of the gods, provided by me as the voice of the inquisition! ...",
  ["NFZ"] = "I should go and tell Fa'hradin. ...",
  ["NFa"] = "Before I can nominate you for an award, please complete your task.",
  ["NFb"] = "Excellent. You'll learn this trade from scratch. Our operations cover many fields of work. Some aren't even illegal. ...",
  ["NFc"] = "Could you look for this mean beast, find out why he did and either get me some money ormy necklace to rebuild my business?",
  ["NFd"] = "Would you like me to repeat the task requirements then?",
  ["NFe"] = "Oh well. I guess I am still on the hook. Tell your 'uncle' I will proceed as he suggested.",
  ["NFf"] = "Did you acquire the red butterfly we are looking for?",
  ["NFg"] = "However, the empowering of the two hidden stones could be a bit more complicated. But you have to find out on yourself what to do with those stones.",
  ["NFh"] = "What we get to eat is really ridiculous. Particularly in view of the fact that we should dig up an insane amount of ores.",
  ["NFi"] = "Ah, hello! I take it you have the next scroll piece for me, {yes}?",
  ["NFj"] = "I heard there is a problem with a wolf mother and her whelps. However, I don't know more about it. One of my sisters, Ikassis, has taken over the body of a snake. ...",
  ["NFk"] = "It became obvious that their goal is to raise an ancient and fallen king, to lead their lich-knights and raise even more of them. ...",
  ["NFl"] = "I don't need a present right now. Thank you.",
  ["NFm"] = "Yes! YES! I have felt that! The altars are alive again! Well done! ...",
  ["NFn"] = "You might find at places he has been, should be easy to see them since Bong is big. ...",
  ["NFo"] = "Hm. Greetings.",
  ["NFp"] = "Anyway, there should be a way to use that elemental ice and strengthen one of the elementals. If my calculations are right, you will create an Ice Overlord who hopefully will consist of some sort of 'concentrated' ice or something similar. ...",
  ["NFq"] = "Have you been successful?",
  ["NFr"] = "Sorry.",
  ["NFs"] = "If you want to enter our fortress you have to become one of us and fight the Efreet. ...",
  ["NFt"] = "You have indeed. The shrines have sung back to you. Well done, brother. Not many men take such an interest in our art. ...",
  ["NFu"] = "But there is only one way to achieve this: You have to find a Ring of {Secret Thoughts}. Legend has it that a monstrous being called {Urmahlullu} has such a ring. If the myths are true you can find this creature in a subterranean tomb south of Issavi.",
  ["NFv"] = "Three cheers for the noble |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["NFw"] = "Hahahaha! ...",
  ["NFx"] = "That's an interesting one, nothing like I have ever seen myself. What you describe is a device of which I heard that it grants literally 'complete' control over some sort of... artificial thing? ...",
  ["NFy"] = "The thing is the ingredients of the medicine are extremely rare and some only exist in far away and distant lands. If you could help me collecting the ingredients, I would be eternally grateful ...",
  ["NFz"] = "I should have known better than to ask for an act of kindness in this cruel, selfish, world!",
  ["NG"] = "Do you seek a passage to Darashia for |TRAVELCOST|?",
  ["NG0"] = "We ask you to explore the ruins of the black pyramid and look for any signs that prove our theory. You might probably find some document with the numeric bonelord language ...",
  ["NG1"] = "Sorry, you are not worthy!",
  ["NG2"] = "How could I help you?",
  ["NG3"] = "The Thaian kings are crowned by a representative of the churches. This means they reign in the name of the gods of good and are part of the godly plan for humanity. ...",
  ["NG4"] = "Me sad. Me expected better from you!",
  ["NG5"] = "Take this!",
  ["NG6"] = "We have placed an order to transfer {} gold from your guild account to guild {}.  Please check your inbox for confirmation.",
  ["NG7"] = "Would you really like to deposit {} gold to your {guild account}?",
  ["NG8"] = "Your guild account balance is {} gold.",
  ["NG9"] = "So you would like me to change {} of your crystal coins into {} platinum coins for you?",
  ["NGA"] = "So, are you ready for your first real task?",
  ["NGB"] = "What gives you the impression, I am the kind of women, you find in sewers?",
  ["NGC"] = "So listen, little ape was struck by plague. Hairycles not does know what plague it is. That is strange. Hairycles should know. But Hairycles learnt lots and lots ...",
  ["NGD"] = "Well, I hope you like it here. We tried to rebuild in the {Shaper}'s will. I am a bit preoccupied at the moment because of the absence of my {father}. I may not be the best of help currently, sorry.",
  ["NGE"] = "Well, he does not really like it if someone tells his story ... but I do! A long, long time ago Santa was nothing but a greedy little dwarf. A real miser, I tell ya ...",
  ["NGF"] = "Business reasons - you know.",
  ["NGG"] = "You don't have enough money.",
  ["NGH"] = "A traveller told me about a barricaded zzettlement zzey ezztablished. It'zz a weak and in all zzeir arroganzze, poorly guarded outpozzt beyond zze mountainzz. ...",
  ["NGI"] = "Now he has returned for vengeance, he reclaimed an old abandoned underground {laboratory} and he has acquired new powerful {allies}.",
  ["NGJ"] = "The blessing of the inquisition will bestow upon you all available blessings for the price of 110000 gold. Also, don't forget to ask me about your {outfit} to receive the final addon as demon hunter.",
  ["NGK"] = "I've got anozzer mizzion for you which will be even more dangerouzz zzan zze lazzt one. Return to me when you're ready. ",
  ["NGL"] = "Well, to be honest, I envy him a little. He can continue his research in his laboratory. He still has working equipment... I sometimes read his publications. He is an able man, but completely on the wrong track... give these plans to him.",
  ["NGM"] = "Wha ... What??? Are you saying you've seen a mouse here??",
  ["NGN"] = "Excuse me, but I'm waiting for someone important!",
  ["NGO"] = "You will have to leave the plant through the eastern door on the lowest level. I have arranged for it to be 'accidentally' open. ...",
  ["NGP"] = "Gnometastic! You should have no trouble finding enough drillworms.",
  ["NGQ"] = "Last but not least, just drop by with 100 pieces of blue cloth and I will happily show you how to make a turban. ...",
  ["NGR"] = "If you want to go, just ask for an {exit} and I will transform you into a creature small enough to fit through that hole over there.",
  ["NGS"] = "Even more important, retrieve the last research notes that the local alchemists made before the plague killed them. They might be the key for a cure or something else. ...",
  ["NGT"] = "He really doesn't look like the man of the sea he pretends to be, does he? Noted down! Any other name?",
  ["NGU"] = "So, did you find anything worth examining? Did you actually catch a ghost?",
  ["NGV"] = "As we have our hands full with a lot of things right now, we could need someone to chart the unknown parts of this underground labyrinth ...",
  ["NGW"] = "Then no.",
  ["NGX"] = "You do not have these things!",
  ["NGY"] = "Sorry, you dont have the necessary items.",
  ["NGZ"] = "Precisely time.",
  ["NGa"] = "Do you think you are ready for that mission?",
  ["NGb"] = "And voilà, we're done. I developed this recipe while talking to Maryza in the Jolly Axeman. She said to eat it when one's health is low. Enjoy!",
  ["NGc"] = "Take this!",
  ["NGd"] = "And by the way: if you thought all of this was boring and you'd rather skip the tutorial with your next character, just say 'skip tutorial' to Santiago. ...",
  ["NGe"] = "But it might be a nice outfit for a little human. You also can take the porcelain mask and the feathers. There's a wizard named Muriel in Thais who reportedly embellishes outfits with stuff like this.",
  ["NGf"] = "We will of course pay for every ghost you catch. You will receive more if you hunt for some of the tougher fellows - but don't overdue it. What do you say?",
  ["NGg"] = "I see.",
  ["NGh"] = "Between a triangle of big stones you must dig... in the eastern caves. ...",
  ["NGi"] = "He's an experienced hunter and knows much about the woods, the animals that dwell there, and about the {werewolves}. He's devoted himself to finding out everything there is to know about the {Curse}.",
  ["NGj"] = "Here you go.",
  ["NGk"] = "Your choice.",
  ["NGl"] = "I like the quietness and the climate. And admittedly it helped my studies not to be constantly disturbed by petitioners.",
  ["NGm"] = "Did you already talk to Gabel about the report? I think he will have further instructions for you.",
  ["NGn"] = "I've forgotten to tell you something. Of course I need proof that you killed cockroaches. Please bring me at least 3 of their legs. Good luck!",
  ["NGo"] = "Sadly some of the ships never returned and others only found minor deposits of ore, not worth the effort. But one of the ships made some groundbreaking discovery - a cave that had a connection to the surface. ...",
  ["NGp"] = "Here you are",
  ["NGq"] = "Stop it! The test is over, you can ask me for your {results}.",
  ["NGr"] = "Two carrots, two tomatoes, two corncobs, two cucumbers, one onion, one bulb of garlic, one piece of cheese, twenty white mushrooms and five brown mushrooms.",
  ["NGs"] = "According to the descriptions, I'd call them mentally unstable, but their people see them as 'blessed by the dragon emperor'. I assume there are strange forces at work in this land, and I have a bad feeling about it. ...",
  ["NGt"] = "I am proud of you, my child, excellent work. This staff shall be yours from now on!",
  ["NGu"] = "A 150 {Green Tunic}! Great. Here, take this green piece of cloth, I don't need it anyway.",
  ["NGv"] = "Fine, fine! Next, travel with Captain Seahorse to the city of Venore. Understood?",
  ["NGw"] = "Sorry, but you don't have your lottery ticket with you.",
  ["NGx"] = "Thank you so much for your kindness. I'm an old woman and I desperately need firewood for my oven. Could you please help me?",
  ["NGy"] = "Its visage is covered with holes and tunnels in which its leggy inhabitants are hiding. Its bowels filled with the strangest creatures, waiting to feast on whatever dares to disturb their hive. ...",
  ["NGz"] = "Did I get that right: You want to cast 1 of your votes on funding the {archives}?",
  ["NH"] = "I warn you! This route is haunted by a ghostship. Do you really want to go there?",
